<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">ACAKI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk mukwongo pa Moses ma kilwongo Acaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Acaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aca</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk mukwongo pa Moses ma kilwongo</para>
  <para style="mt1">ACAKI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Nying buk man teloke tye ni “acaki.” Buk man tito kit ma kicweyo ki polo ki lobo, acaki pa dano, acaki me bal ki can matye i lobo, ki kit yo ma Lubanga tiyo kwede ki dano.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man kitwero poko iye i dul aryo madito kit man: (1) Cwec me lobo ki lok atita ma mako lok kom jo macon. Lok ma mako kwo pa Adam ki Kawa, Kain ki Abel, Nua ki pii aluka, ki Lubele ma wiye ocudu me Babel (cura 1—11). (2) Lok atita ma mako kom tekwaro pa jo Icrael. Mukwongo aye Abraim, ma pire oywek pi niyene ki kit ma obedo lawiny dog Lubanga. Malubu meno obedo lok atita ma mako wode Icaka, ki lakware Yakobo (ma kilwongo Icrael), ka dok lok ikom awobe pa Yakobo aparwiye aryo, ma rok aparwiye aryo pa Icrael oa ki iye. Ikin lutino pa Yakobo, Yocepu aye tye macalo latin ma okelo wone ki jo ode ducu me doko lubedo i lobo Ejipt (Cura 12—50).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kadi bed buk man tito lok kom dano, ento gin ma pire tek ma kinyutu iye aye obedo tic ma Lubanga otiyo. Cako ki moko ni Lubanga aye ocweyo gigu ducu, ka dok giko ki gicike ni Lubanga tye ki yub ikom danone. Lubanga aye tye madit mada i buk man, kun en aye ngolo kop dok bene en aye miyo pwod ikom lubal ducu, en bene telo danone dok bene konyogi, kun tiro yo kwogi. Buk man mukwongoni kicoyo me gwoko lok atita ma mako niye pa dano kun temo me gwoko niye man wek pe oruce ento obed tye ada.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwec me polo, lobo ki dano <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 1:1-2:25">1:1—2:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Acaki bal ki deno can <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-24">3:1-24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Me a ikom Adam nio ikom Nua <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 4:1-5:32">4:1—5:32</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nua ki pii aluka <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-10:32">6:1—10:32</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lubele ma wiye ocudu me Babel <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:1-9">11:1-9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Me a ikom Cem nio ikom Abram <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 11:10-32">11:10-32</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tekwaro: Abraim, Icaka, Yakobo <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-35:29">12:1—35:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Likwayo Ecau <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 36:1-43">36:1-43</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yocepu ki omegine <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 37:1-45:28">37:1—45:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jo Icrael i Ejipt <char style="ior"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-50:26">46:1—50:26</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ocweyo polo ki lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />I acaki Lubanga ocweyo polo ki lobo. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Lobo onongo tye nono, onyobe woko atata, piny macol ocido wi kut matut, kun Cwiny pa Lubanga twago wi pii.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:6">2 Kor 4:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek dero obed tye,” ci dero obedo tye. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Lubanga oneno dero ni ber; Lubanga opoko kin dero ki colpiny. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Lubanga olwongo dero ni Dyeceng, ki colpiny olwongo ni Dyewor. Piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me acel.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:5">2 Pet 3:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek pete orine ikin pii, me poko kin pii ki pii wadi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Ci Lubanga oyubu pete me poko pii matye piny ite pete ki pii matye malo iwi pete; ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Lubanga olwongo dan pete ni polo, piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me aryone.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek pii matye ite polo ocoke, ogure ikabedo acel, wek piny ma otwo onen.” Ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Lubanga olwongo piny ma otwo ni Lobo, ki pii ma ocoke, ogure kaceli ni Nam; ci Lubanga oneno ni ber. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek gin malot ducu ma a ki i ngom otwi iwi lobo, ki ginapita ma nyako nyiggi, ki yadi ma nyako nyiggi ma kodi tye i igi, ki kit kwayigi ducu.” Ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Kitmeno gin malot ducu ocako twi iwi lobo, ki ginapita ma nyako nyiggi ikit kwayigi ki acel acel, ki yadi ma nyako nyiggi ma kodi tye i igi, ikit kwayigi ducu. Ci Lubanga oneno ni ber. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me adeke.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek gin maryeny obed ikom pete me polo me poko dyeceng ki dyewor, ki me bedo ginanena ma nyutu kare ki nino ki mwaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />wek guryeny ikom pete me polo ma menyo lobo.” Ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Ci Lubanga ocweyo gin madito aryo ma giryeny, wek maryeny madite aye oloo dyeceng, ki maryeny matidine oloo dyewor; dok ocweyo lwak lakalatwe bene. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Lubanga oketogi ikom pete me polo me menyo lobo, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />me loyo dyeceng ki dyewor, ki me poko kin dero ki colpiny. Ci Lubanga oneno ni ber. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me angwene.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek pii onywal gin makwo ma gicore limuk, ki winyo bene gutuk lamal iwi lobo i dan pete me polo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Lubanga ocweyo nyang madongo i nam, ki kwayi gin makwo ducu mapatpat ma gimol, ma gicore limuk i pii, ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat, ki winyi ma gituk ki bwomgi, ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat. Ci Lubanga oneno ni ber. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Lubanga omiyogi gum kun waco ni, “Wunywal, wunya, wupong pii ki nam, winyo bene gunya iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me abice.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Wek lobo onywal lee makwo ikit kwayigi ducu: lee ma paco, ki gin ma lak alaka piny i ngom ki lee me tim madongo ki matino ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat.” Ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Lubanga ocweyo lee tim ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat, ki lee ma paco ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat, ki gin ma lak alaka piny i ngom, ikit kwayigi ducu mapatpat. Ci Lubanga oneno ni ber.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:7">1 Kor 11:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Weku wacweyu dano ma gical ki wan; wek gin aye gulo rec ma i nam, ki winyi me polo, ki lee ma paco, ki ma iwi lobo ducu, gulo bene gin ducu ma lak alaka iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar 10:6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:1-2">Aca 5:1-2</ref></char></note> Ci Lubanga ocweyo dano ikit calle kikome; en ocweyogi laco ki dako. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Lubanga omiyogi gum kun waco botgi ni, “Wunywal, wunya, wupong lobo, wulo bene; dok wulo wa rec ma i nam, ki winyi me polo, ki gigu ducu makwo ma giwoto iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Ci Lubanga owaco ni, “Nenu, amiyowu ginapita ducu ma nyako nyiggi matye iwi lobo ducu, ki yadi ducu ma nyako nyiggi ma kodi tye i igi; wubicamogi. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Dok lee ducu me tim, ki winyi ducu me polo, ki gin ducu ma lak alaka wi lobo, ma gitye ki kwo, amiyo botgi ginapita ducu madyak me bedo camgi.” Ci otime kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Lubanga oneno gin madong en ocweyo ducu, ci nen, tye mabeco tutwal. Piny oyutu dok piny oru, meno nino me abicele.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Polo ki lobo yam cwece otum kitmeno, ki lwak mony matye iye ducu. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Ibru 4:4</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 4:10">10</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Nia 20:11</ref></char></note>Ma nino me abiro romoni onongo Lubanga dong otyeko tice mayam otiyo woko ducu; en oywe ikom nino me abiro ki i tice ducu mayam otiyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Ci Lubanga omiyo gum ikom nino me abiro, olonyo obedo maleng, pien ikom nino meno en aye Lubanga yam oywe iye ki itice ducu ma en otiyo me cweyo polo ki lobo.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Man aye acaki nya pa kwayi gigu ducu ma i polo ki i lobo ikare ma Rwot Lubanga ocweyogi kwede.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Poto me Eden</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Inino meno ma Rwot Lubanga ocweyo iye polo ki loboni, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />yat mo me tim onongo peya tye iwi lobo, onongo doo mo pud pe ma otwi iwi lobo, onongo Rwot Lubanga peya omiyo kot ocwer i lobo, dok onongo peya tye dano mo ma puru lobo; <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />ento lupuu onongo duny malo, ci bido lobo ducu. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:45">1 Kor 15:45</ref></char></note>Ci Rwot Lubanga ocweyo dano ki apwa me ngom, ka yaka okutu aluu me kwo i ume, ci dano odoko gin makwo.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Ci Rwot Lubanga oyubu poto i Eden, tung kunyango: ci oketo iye dano ma en ocweyoni. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 2:7">Niy 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">22:2</ref>,<ref loc="REV 22:14">14</ref></char></note>Dok Rwot Lubanga omiyo yadi gutwi i ngom, kwayi yadi ducu mamwonya manen maber, ki mabeco me acama. Yat me kwo onongo ocung i dye poto bene, ki yat mamiyo ngec me gin maber ki marac.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kulu yam onongo mol a ki i Eden, makelo pii i poto, iye opoke ki kunu, odoko kulu angwen. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Nying kulu mukwongone Picon; en aye kulu mamol rumu lobo Kavila ducu, ma jabu nonge iye. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Jabu matye i lobo meno beco; odok yat ma kilwongo ni bedola ki got onik tye kunu bene. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Nying kulu me aryone Gikon, ma orumu lobo ducu me Kuc. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Ki nying kulu me adeke Taigric; mol dok tung kunyango me Aciria. Ki kulu me angwene Euprate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Rwot Lubanga otero dano, oketo i poto Eden wek opur, dok ogwok bene. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ci Rwot Lubanga ociko dano ni, “Yadi ducu matye i poto, camgi kit ma i mito; <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />ento yat mamiyo ngec me gin maber ki marac pe icam, pien inino ma ibicamo iye, en aye ibito iye bene.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Ka dok Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Pe ber dano obed kene; abiyubu lawote ma opore kwede wek obed lakony kore.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Ci Rwot Lubanga ocweyo lee tim ducu ki winyo ducu me polo, nia ki i ngom, okelogi bot dano me neno kit ma obicako ki nyinggi. Kit mayam dano ocako ki nying gin makwo acel acel ducu, en aye obedo nyinggi. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Dano ocako nying lee ma paco ducu, ki winyo me polo, ki lee tim ducu; ento lakony pa dano ma opore kwede aye onongo pud pe onen. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Rwot Lubanga omiyo nino madwong omako wang dano; ma en tye kanino, ci okwanyo cogo lakngete acel, omwono wange woko ki ringo. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Ci cogo ma Rwot Lubanga okwanyoni ocweyo odoko dako, ka okelo bote. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Dano owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Man aye cogo ma oa icogona kikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">ki ringo bene ma oa ki i ringona kikome;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">kibilwongo nyinge ni ‘dako,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">pien kikwanye ki ikom laco.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:24:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mat 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mar 10:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:16">1 Kor 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Epe 5:31</ref></char>
    </note> Ma omiyo laco weko wone ki mine, ci moko ikom dakone liking, gin aryoni dong gidoko kom acel. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Ikare meno laco ki dakone onongo pud gibedo munero ma lewic pe makogi.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Acaki bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 12:9">Niy 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:2">20:2</ref></char>
    </note>Twol yam onongo ryek makato lee tim ducu ma Rwot Lubanga ocweyo. En owaco ki dako ni, “Lubanga mono owaco ada ni, ‘Pe wucam yat ducu matye i potoni’?” <figure style="fig" alt="The snake deceived Eve" file="CO00606B.TIF" size="col" copy="DAVID COOK" ref="3:1">Twol obwolo dako</figure> <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Dako otito ki twol ni, “Watwero camo nyig yadi ducu matye i potoni, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />ento Lubanga ociko ni, ‘Pe wubicamo nyig yat matye i dye poto, pe wugud kome bene, wek pe wuto.’” <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Ci twol owaco ki dako ni, “Pe wubito wa ki acel. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Lubanga owaco kitmeno pien en ngeyo ni ka wucamo, ci wangwu biyabe woko, ci wubidoko calo Lubanga, miyo wungeyo gin maber ki marac.” <verse eid="GEN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Ka dako oneno ni yate ber me acama, dok nen mwonya bene, dok yat meno ber, ci cwiny dako opyete ikome, pien miyo gidoko ryek, ci opwono nyige, ocamo; omiyo mogo bot cware, ci ocamo. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Gin aryo ducu wanggi oyabe woko, gucako ngeyo ni kara gitye munero, ci gukwoyo pot olam guruku ipyergi.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Ma guwinyo Rwot Lubanga woto i poto ikare ma ceng okwe, ci dano ki dakone gukane woko cen ki inyim Rwot Lubanga ikin yadi matye i poto. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Ci Rwot Lubanga olwongo laco kun penye ni, “In mono itye kwene ka?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />En ogamo ni, “Awinyo ka iwoto i poto, ci lworo omaka, pien atye munero, akane woko.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Dok openye aye ni, “anga madong otiti ni itye munero? Dong ityeko camo nyig yat ma onongo aciki ni pe i cammi ce?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Ci laco ogamo ni, “Dako ma imiya ni obed kwedani aye omiya nyig yat meno, ci acamo.” <verse eid="GEN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 Kor 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:14">1 Tem 2:14</ref></char></note>Rwot Lubanga openyo dako ni, “Man kono itimo tim ma kit man pingo?” Dako ogamo ni, “Twol aye obwola, omiyo acamo.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lubanga ongolo kop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Ci Rwot Lubanga owaco bot twol ni, “Pien in aye itimo man, kiceno in keni ki ikin lee ducu. Ibilak, ibiywane piny ki ii, dok ibicamo apwa ikare me kwoni ducu. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:17">Niy 12:17</ref></char></note>Abiketo mone ikin in ki dako, ki ikin likwayi ki likwaye; en bigoyo wii, in ibitongo opunye.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Ki bot dako owace ni, “Abimedi arem matek ikare me nyodo; ibinywalo lutino ki arem, cwinyi bipyete ikom cwari dok en aye biloyi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:8">Ibru 6:8</ref></char></note>Ki bot Adam owace ni, “Pien in aye iwinyo dog dakoni, ci icamo nyig yat ma aciki iye ni, ‘Pe icam,’ kiceno lobo piri: ibicam ki aroma madit ikare me kwoni ducu. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Loboni biceko okutu ki ocok, ibicamo pot dek ma i tim. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Ibicamo kwon ki kwok ma cwer ki itur nyimi, nio ka ibidok i ngom, kit ma con kikwanyi ki iye; in apwa, dok bene ibidok i apwa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adam ocako nying dakone ni Kawa, pien en aye megi jo ducu makwo. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Ci Rwot Lubanga oyubu laa aruka, ka omiyo Adam ki dakone guruku.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiryemo Adam gin ki Kawa woko ki i poto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 22:14">Niy 22:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ci Rwot Lubanga owaco ni, “Nen, dano dong odoko rom ki ngat acel ikinwa, en dong ngeyo gin maber ki gin marac woko. Omyero pe dong wawek ocam nyig yat me kwo, miyo en dong bibedo makwo nakanaka.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Ma omiyo Rwot Lubanga oryeme woko ki i poto Eden, wek odok opur gire ngom mayam kikwanye ki iyeni. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Ci oketo lukerubi tung kunyango me poto Eden, ki pala lucwan ma lyel mac, ma wire tungi ki tungi me gwoko yoo ma cito ikom yat me kwo.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kain ki Abel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adam obedo ki dakone Kawa, ci dakone ogamo ic, onywalo Kain ci owaco ni, “Dong atyeko nongo latin laco ma Rwot okonya kwede.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Ka dok onywalo omine Abel. Abel obedo lakwat romi, Kain obedo lapur poto. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Ka kare mo okato, Kain okelo cam ma oceko i potone, otyero bot Rwot. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Ibru 11:4</ref> </char></note>Abel okelo mere lutino kayo romi ki dwologi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4:4 </char> <char style="fk">Dwolo </char> obedo moo ma nonge ikom lee ma Acoli yam tiyo kwede me wiro bol tong, kwot, ki bol kweri. </note> Ci Rwot ojolo Abel ki gityere, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />ento pe ojolo Kain ki gityere; omiyo Kain okeco, ma wange ocido ki akemo madit. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Ci Rwot owaco ki Kain ni, “Ikeco pingo ka? Wangi ocido pingo ka? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Ka itimo gin maber ci pe kijoli ce? Ento pien pe itimo gin maber, nen bal obutu i dogolani me loyo in; ento omyero iloye.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:51">Luk 11:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12">1 Jon 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Kain owaco ki omine Abel ni, “Wacit i poto.” Ma guo i poto, Kain ocako lweny ikom omine Abel, ci oneko woko. <verse eid="GEN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Lacen Lubanga openyo Kain ni, “Omeru Abel tye kwene?” En ogamo ni, “Pe angeyo; an aye abedo lagwok omera bo?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Ibru 12:24</ref></char></note> Ci Rwot owace ni, “Man dong itimo tim marac kuman pingo? Nen, remo pa omeru tye kakok inyima, winye kun a ki i ngom. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Kombedi dong kiceni woko, pe dok ibipuru lobo ma ongamo doge me mato remo pa omeru ma ioyoni. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Ka ipuru poto, pe biceki cam ki teke ducu; i bibedo lamalgang kun imal ata i lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Ci Kain owaco ki Rwot ni, “Twon can ma imiyani dong dit obwoyo koma woko do. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Nen, tin dong iryema woko ki i poto, wa ki inyimi bene. Abibedo lamalgang kun amal ata i lobo, dok ngat mo keken ma binonga, bitwero neka woko.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Rwot owace ni, “Pe kumeno! Ka ngat mo bineko Kain, kibiculu kwor ikome ki kwo pa dano abiro kulu.” Rwot oketo lanyut mo ikom Kain, wek jo ma binonge pe guneke. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Ci Kain ocako a woko ki inyim Rwot, ocito obedo i lobo Nod, tung kunyango me Eden.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Kain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kain obedo ki dakone, ci dakone ogamo ic, ci onywalo Enoka. Lacen Kain ogero gang madit, ci ocako nying gang meno macalo nying wode, ni Enoka. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoka onywalo Irad, Irad onywalo Mekujael, Mekujael onywalo Metucael, Metucael onywalo Lamek. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamek onyomo mon aryo; nying dako acel Ada, ki nying mukene Jilla. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada onywalo Jabal; en aye nene won jo ma gibedo i kema, ki wegi lim makwo. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Nying omine Jubal, en aye nene won jo ma gigoyo opuk ki lukut nyamulere. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Jilla onywalo Tubal-kain; en aye nene latet kit kwa jami tic ducu me mola ki nyonyo bronze. Lamin Tubal-kain nyinge Naama. <verse eid="GEN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lamek owaco bot mone ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada ki Jilla, wuwiny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">wun mon pa Lamek, wuwiny lok ma awaciwu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Atyeko neko dano ma omiya ret,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">aneko awobi mo ma ogoyani.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:24:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:22">Mat 18:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka kibiculu kwor pa Kain ki kwo pa dano abiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">Lamek kibiculu kwore ki kwo pa dano pyere abiro wiye abiro kulu.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ceji gin ki Enoci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adam dok obedo ki dakone, ci dakone onywalo latin laco, ci ocako nyinge Ceji, pien owaco ni, “Lubanga dok omiya latin mukene ma oleyo ka Abel, mayam Kain onekoni.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Ceji bene onywalo latin awobi, ocako nyinge Enoci. Ikare meno en aye dano gucako lwongo iye nying Rwot.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Adam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Tek 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:27-28">Aca 1:27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Man aye buk me tekwaro pa Adam. (Ikare ma Lubanga ocweyo dano, en ocweyogi ikit cal mamere kikome. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:6">Mar 10:6</ref></char></note>Yam ocweyo laco ki dako, omiyogi gum, ocako nyinggi ni “Dano” inino mayam ocweyogi iyeni.) <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Ka Adam dong otyeko rii mwaka miya acel ki pyere adek, en onywalo awobi ma cal ki en kikome, ci ocako nyinge Ceji. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Mwaka pa Adam ma onongo dong otyeko nywalo Ceji romo miya aboro, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Adam ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki pyere adek; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Ka Ceji dong otyeko rii mwaka miya acel ki abic, ci onywalo Enoci. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Ceji orii inge nywalo Enoci mwaka miya aboro ki abiro, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Ceji ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki apar wiye aryo; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Ka Enoci dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere abongwen, ci onywalo Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Enoci orii inge nywalo Kenan mwaka miya aboro ki apar wiye abic, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Enoci ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki abic; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Ka Kenan dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere abiro, ci onywalo Maalalel. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Kenan orii inge nywalo Maalalel mwaka miya aboro ki pyere angwen, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Kenan ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki apar; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Ka Maalalel dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere abicel wiye abic, ci onywalo Jared. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Maalalel orii inge nywalo Jared mwaka miya aboro ki pyere adek, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Maalalel ducu oromo mwaka miya aboro ki pyere abongwen wiye abic; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Ka Jared dong otyeko rii mwaka miya acel ki pyere abicel wiye aryo, ci onywalo Enoka. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Jared orii inge nywalo Enoka mwaka miya aboro, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Jared ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki pyere abicel wiye aryo; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Ka Enoka dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere abicel wiye abic, ci onywalo Metucela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Enoka obedo kawot kacel ki Lubanga inge nywalo Metucela mwaka miya adek, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Enoka ducu oromo mwaka miya adek ki pyere abicel wiye abic. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:5">Ibru 11:5</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:14">Jud 14</ref></char></note>Enoka obedo kawot kacel ki Lubanga; ci orwenyo woko matwal, pien Lubanga otere woko.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Ka Metucela dong otyeko rii mwaka miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye abiro, ci onywalo Lamek. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Metucela orii inge nywalo Lamek mwaka miya abiro ki pyere aboro wiye aryo, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Metucela ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki pyere abicel wiye abongwen; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Ka Lamek dong orii mwaka miya acel ki pyere aboro wiye aryo, ci onywalo wode, <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />ma ocako nyinge Nua, kun waconi, “I lobo mayam Rwot ocenoni, latin man aye bimiyo waywe ki aroma tic me cingwa.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Lamek orii inge nywalo awobe mukene ki anyira bene. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Kitmeno nino me kwo pa Lamek ducu oromo mwaka miya abiro ki pyere abiro wiye abiro; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Ka Nua otyeko romo mwaka me dite, miya abic, ci onywalo Cem, Kam ki Yafeci.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bal pa dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 1:6">Yub 1:6</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:1">2:1</ref></char>
    </note> Ikare ma dano gucako mede ki nya iwi lobo, ci gunywalo anyira. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Awobe pa Lubanga guneno ni anyira pa dano gimunya mabeco, ci gucako yerogi me anyoma. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Cwiny ma mere mamiyo kwo pe dong bibedo i dano nakanaka, pien en kom mamwa, piman kare me kwo ne pe bikato mwaka miya acel ki pyere aryo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Wel 13:33</ref></char></note> Jo Nepil onongo gitye i lobo nicake ikare meno ocito kwede anyim, ma awobe pa Lubanga gunyomo anyira pa dano, ci gunywalo kwedgi lutino. Gin aye cogi gala, jo matego mukwongo i lobo, ma nyinggi ngene matek.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:37">Mat 24:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26">Luk 17:26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1 Pet 3:20</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot oneno ni tim aranyi pa dano odoko dit woko iwi lobo, dok tam ducu ma cwinygi lwodo kare ducu kemo bal keken. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Omiyo Rwot ongut kun oparo mada gin ango ma oweko ecweyo dano i lobo. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Abijwero dano mayam acweyoni woko ki iwi lobo, ki lee ki gin ma lak alaka ki winyo me polo, pien dong atyeko ngut pi cweyogi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Ento Nua aye onongo yomo cwiny Rwot.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nua opayo yeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 Pet 2:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Man aye lok ma mako kom Nua. Nua yam obedo dano ma kite atir, ma peke ki bal mo ikin yalwake. Nua obedo kawot kacel ki Lubanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nua onongo tye ki awobene adek: Cem, Kam ki Yafeci.<verse eid="GEN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ento tim cilo onongo obalo lobo woko inyim Lubanga, kun opong ki bwami. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Lubanga oneno lobo, ci ada oneno obale woko ki tim cilo, pien dano ducu gubalo woko ki rac kitgi ma gikwo kwede iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Ci Lubanga owaco ki Nua ni, “Dong amoko tama woko me kelo agiki pa dano ducu. Nen, abityekogi woko liweng, pien dong gupongo lobo woko ki tim bwamigi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Yub yeya piri kun i payo ki ikom yat goper; ci iket kicika me poko i yeya, ka imwon iye ki ngeye ki odok. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Ibiyubu yeya meno kit man: bore biromo mita miya acel ki pyere adek wiye adek, lac iye mita pyere aryo wiye aryo ki bore tung malo mita pyere adek. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Tuc wang dirica i yeya, kun iweko dane malo dong puti acel ki nucu; ka iket dogola ibut yeya, ci ipok iye obed kabedo adek, ma pinye, me aryone ki me adeke ma malone. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Pien nen, abicoro pii aluka madwong iwi lobo, wek otyek kom gin ducu matye ki kwo, ite polo, wek gin ducu matye iwi lobo oto woko. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Ento in aye abimoko gicikena kwedi; ibidonyo i yeya, in kacel ki lutinoni, ki dakoni, ki mon woti ducu. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Kwany gin makwo ducu ma gitye ki kom ki aryoaryo ki ikit kwayigi acel acel, ci ipikgi i yeya, wek gubed kwo kacel ki in; gubed ma co ki ma mon. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Kwayi winyi ducu matye, wa ki lee ducu, wa ki gin ma lak alaka i ngom. Gin bibino boti ki aryoaryo ki ikit kwayigi acel acel wek gubed kwo. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Dok iter kit kwayi cam ducu ma gicamo, ci i kan gi; wek gubed me acamagi bene. <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:7">Ibru 11:7</ref></char></note>Nua otimo kumeno; ocobo ducu kit macalo Lubanga ocike.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Pii aluka ocore iwi lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ci Rwot owaco bot Nua ni, “Dony i yeya, in kacel ki jo ma i odi ducu, pien atyeko neno ni in aye kiti atir inyima ki ikin yalwak me kare man. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Ter lee ma kicamogi abiro abiro, twonine ki megine, ki lee ma kikwero aryo aryo, twonine ki megine. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Ki winyo me polo bene abiro abiro, ma co ki ma mon, wek kit kwayigi odong makwo me nya iwi lobo ducu. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Pien odong nino abiro ka dong abimiyo kot cwer i lobo nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor benebene, ci gin ducu makwo mayam acweyoni ducu, abijwerogi woko ki iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Kitmeno Nua ocobo tic ma Rwot ocike kwede ducu.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nua onongo dong tye ki mwaka me dite miya abicel ikare ma pii aluka ocore iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:38-39">Mat 24:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:27">Luk 17:27</ref></char></note>Ci Nua ki dakone ki awobene ki mon gi gudonyo i yeya me bwot ki i pii aluka. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Lee ducu ma kicamo ki ma kikwero, ki winyogu, ki gin ma lak alaka i ngom, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />gudonyo i yeya bot Nua ki aryo aryo, laco ki dako kit macalo Rwot ociko. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />I nge nino abiro pii aluka ocore, opong iwi lobo.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:6">2 Pet 3:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>I mwaka me miya abicel me dit pa Nua, i dwe me aryo, inino dwe me apar wiye abirone, inino meno aye wang it ducu me kut matut gumwoc woko ki pii, ki polo bene oyabe. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Ci kot ocore iwi lobo nino pyere angwen dyeceng ki dyewor benebene. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Ikom nino meno kikome, Nua ki awobene Cem, Kam ki Yafeci, ki dakone, en Nua, ki mon wote adek kacel kwedgi, gudonyo i yeya. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Gin ki lee tim ducu, ki lee ma paco ducu madito ki matino, ki gin ducu ma lak alaka iwi lobo, ki winyi ducu ki kit kwayigi mapatpat ki gin ducu ma gituk ki bwomgi. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Gin ducu ma gitye ki kwo gudonyo i yeya bot Nua ki aryo aryo, <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />ma co ki ma mon, kit ma con Lubanga ociko ki Nua; ci Rwot oloro wigi woko.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Pii aluka orii wi lobo pi nino pyere angwen kulu; pii opong, omede ameda nio ka otingo yeya, otero yeya malo tutwal nia ki iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Pii opong, omede, ocege woko iwi lobo; yeya obedo ka kwang iwi pii malo. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Pii ocege woko iwi lobo ki teke, nio ka oumu wi godi ma boco matye ite polo ducu. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Pii omede, omwonyo wi godi woko ki puti pyere aryo kulu. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Gin makwo ducu mayam giwoto iwi lobo guto woko; winyo, lee ma paco, ki lee tim, gin ducu ma nya, ma gicore limuk iwi lobo, kacel ki dano. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Gin ducu mayam gitye ki yweyo me kwo i umgi, ma iwi tura, guto woko. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Lubanga ojwero gin ducu makwo mayam gitye iwi lobo, dano ki lee ki gin ma lak alaka, ki winyo me polo; en ojwerogi woko nia ki i lobo. Nua keken aye odong, ki jo mayam gitye kwede i yeyani. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Ci pii ocege iwi lobo nino miya acel ki pyere abic kulu.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Pii aluka otwo woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Wi Lubanga pe owil ikom Nua ki lee tim ducu, ki lee ma paco ducu mayam tye kacel kwede i yeya. Lubanga omiyo yamo okodo iwi lobo, ci pii ocako dwon. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Wang it me kut matut ducu, ki wang polo bene ocule woko, ki kot ma core a ki i polo bene ocok woko, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />pii omede ki dwon woko iwi lobo jwijwi. Ma nino okato miya acel ki pyere abic, pii onongo odwon woko. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />I dwe me abiro, inino dwe apar wiye abirone, yeya ogem iwi got Ararat. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Pii omede ki dwon woko nio kwede i dwe me apar; i dwe me apar, inino dwe acel, wi godi maboco gucako nen.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ka nino pyere angwen okato, Nua oyabo wang dirica mayam otucu i yeyani, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />ci ocwalo agak woko. En obedo ka tuk, kun wire kwede tungi ki tungi nio ka piny otwo woko. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Dok ocwalo amam woko nia ki bote, wek enen ka pii dong otyeko dwon woko ki i lobo ada. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Ento amam pe omedo ki nongo kama myero opye iye ki tyene, ci odok bote cen i yeya, pien onongo pii pud omwonyo wi lobo woko ducu. Ci Nua oryeyo bade, omake, odwoke i yeya bote. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Dok okuru pi nino abiro mukene, ka dok ocwalo amam woko nia ki i yeya. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Amam dok odok bote i yeya ma onongo piny dong oyutu; ci nen, en onongo otingo pot yat jeituni ma opwono madyak idoge. Kitmeno Nua oniang ni pii dong otyeko dwon woko ki iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Dok omede ki kuru pi nino abiro mukene, ka dok ocwalo amam woko; ci dong pe odok bote matwal.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />I mwaka me miya abicel ki acel me dit pa Nua, i dwe mukwongo, inino dwe acel, en aye pii otwo iye woko liweng ki iwi lobo. Nua ocako putu wi yeya woko, ci oneno wi lobo otwo woko. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />I dwe me aryo, inino dwe pyere aryo wiye abiro, onongo lobo dong otwo woko. <verse eid="GEN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ci Lubanga owaco bot Nua ni, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Dong ikat woko ki i yeya, in ki dakoni, ki awobeni ki mon gi kacel kwedi. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Kel gin makwo ducu ma gitye kwedi woko, wa kit kom ducu, winyo ki lee ki gin ducu ma lak alaka wi lobo, wek gucore iwi lobo, kun ginywal, ginya iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Kitmeno Nua okato woko, ki awobene ki dakone, ki mon pa awobene kacel kwede. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ki lee ducu ki gin ducu ma lak alaka, ki winyo ducu, gin ducu ma giwoto iwi lobo, gucako mol, gukato woko ki i yeya, ma oporo kit kwayigi ducu.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nua otyero gityer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nua ocano keno tyer pi Rwot, ci oyero lee ma kicamo ki ikit kwayigi acel acel, ki winyo ma kicamo ki ikit kwayigi acel acel, ci otyero gitum awanga iwi keno tyer. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Ma Rwot ongweyo gin ma ngwece kur ma yomo cwiny, Rwot oloko i cwinye kekene ni, “An pe dok abiceno lobo pi dano, kadi bed tam ducu ma i cwinye kemo bal keken nia wa i tinone; pe dong abineko gin makwo ducu kit mayam atimo. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Ka tek lobo pud tye, ci kare me coyo kodi ki kare me kac, kare me ngico ki lyeto, ki oro ki cwir, dyeceng ki dyewor, pe bigik matwal.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga omoko gicikene ki Nua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:28">Aca 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lubanga omiyo gum ikom Nua ki lutino awobene kun waco ni, “Wunywal, wunya, wek wupong lobo. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Lee tim ducu bilworowu ki myelkom, wa winyo bene ducu me polo, ki gin ma lak alaka i ngom, ki rec ducu ma i nam bene. Kityeko miyogi ducu i cingwu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Gin ducu ma woto, ma kwo, gibibedo ginacama mewu; kit mayam amiyowu pot deki, dong amiyowu jami ducu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">Lev 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Nwo 12:16</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref></char></note>Ento pe wubicamo ringo kacel ki kwo ne, ma en aye remone. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Atikane abiculu kwor ikom laneko pi remowu; abineko lee ducu ma neko dano. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aca 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Nia 20:13</ref></char></note>Ka ngat mo ooyo remo pa dano mo, ci dano meno kibioyo remone bene; pien Lubanga ocweyo dano i calle kikome. <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:28">Aca 1:28</ref></char></note>Wun wunywal, wunya wumede madwong iwi lobo, wunya iye.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Lubanga dok owaco bot Nua ki awobene ma onongo gitye kacel kwede ni, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Nen, amoko gicikena kwedwu ki likwayowu ma bilubuwu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ki gin makwo ducu ma gitye kwedwu, winyo ki lee ma paco ki lee tim ducu ma gitye kacel kwedwu, gin ducu ma gukato woko ki i yeya. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Amoko gicikena kwedwu ni, pii aluka pe dok bineko gin makwo, dok pe bibedo aluka ma bityeko lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Lubanga dok owaco ni, “Man aye lanyut me gicike ma aketo ikin an ki wun ki gin makwo ducu ma gitye kwedwu, ma bibedo matwal i yalwak ducu. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Aketo danyu mera i pol, ma bibedo lanyut me gicikena ikin an ki lobo. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ka amiyo pol oyunge iwi lobo, ci danyu binen i pol, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />abipo ikom gicike matye ikin an ki wun ki gin makwo ducu ma gitye ki kom; dok pii bene pe dok bidoko aluka maromo tyeko gin makwo ducu. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Ka danyu tye i pol, ci abineno, ci abipo i gicikena ma bedo matwal ikin Lubanga ki gin makwo ducu ma gitye ki kom iwi lobo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ci Lubanga owaco bot Nua ni, “Man dong lanyut me gicikena madong amoko ikin an ki gin makwo ducu matye iwi lobo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nua ki awobene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Awobe pa Nua mayam gukati woko ki i yeyani gin aye Cem, Kam ki Yafeci. Kam en aye won Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Lutino awobe pa Nua adeki aye lwak ducu ma iwi lobo gua ikomgi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nua aye yam obedo lapur mukwongo. Ci opito olok i potone. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Ikare ma omato kongo bwino, ci omer woko, ci olunyo bongone woko ki ikome ci obutu munero ikemane. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Ci Kam, won Kanaan, ma oneno wone pe oumu kome, otito ki omegine aryo ma gitye wokoni. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Ci Cem ki Yafeci gutingo bongo iwi gwokgi gin aryo, ka gucako wot kun gijer kingegi, ci guumu ki kom won gi ma onongo tye munero, kun guloko wanggi neno cen, ci pe guneno kom won gi matye nononi. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Ka Nua oco ki iwang mero kongo bwinone, ci oniang gin ma wode matidine otimo ikome, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />ci owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Ki cen Kanaan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">en bibedo opii ikin lwak opii pa omegine.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Dok owaco bene ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">“Ki pak Rwot Lubanga pa Cem; wek Kanaan obed opiine.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Lubanga oyab lobo pa Yafeci obed ma lac!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Wek en obed i kema pa Cem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Ka dok Kanaan obed opiine bene.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Nua orii mwaka miya adek ki pyere abic nia ikare ma pii aluka ocore iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Kare me kwo pa Nua ducu oromo mwaka miya abongwen ki pyere abic; ka dong oto.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa awobe pa Nua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Tek 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Man aye tekwaro pa lutino awobe pa Nua, Cem, Kam ki Yafeci. Gunywalo lutino awobe inge kare ma pii aluka ocore iwi lobo.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Lutino awobe pa Yafeci aye Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Mecek ki Tirac. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Lutino awobe pa Gomer aye Acikenaj, Ripat ki Togarma. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Lutino awobe pa Javan aye Elica, Tarcic, Kitim ki Dodanim. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Jo ma i dog nam guket ki ikom jo meno. Magi aye lutino awobe pa Yafeci ki lobogi, kun ngat acel acel loko leb tugi, macalo kakagi ki rokgi tye kwede.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Kam: Kus, Ejipt, Put ki Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Lutino awobe pa Kuc aye Ceba, Kavila, Cabta, Raama ki Cabteka. Lutino awobe pa Raama aye Seba ki Dedan. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kus onywalo mere Nimurod; en aye dano ma okwongo bedo oteka iwi lobo. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />En obedo ladwar oken inyim Rwot; ma omiyo nio wa onyo kiwaco ni, “Myero Rwot owek ibed ladwar oken calo Nimurod.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Acaki kere onongo tye iye Babel, Erek, Akad, gin ducu gibedo i lobo Cinar. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Nia i lobo meno kere omede, ocito oo wa i Aciria, ci ogero iye Nineve, Rekobot-Ir, Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />ki Recen ma ikin Nineve ki Kala; meno aye gang madit. <verse eid="GEN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Ejipt onywalo jo Lud, jo Anamim, jo Leabim, jo Naptukim, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />jo Patrucim ki jo Kapclukim, ma en aye kaka ma jo Piliciti gua ki ikomgi, ki jo Kaptorim.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaan onywalo Cidon latin kayone, ki Ket, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />jo Jebuc, jo Amor, jo Girgac, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />jo Kiv, jo Arki, jo Cin, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />jo Arvad, jo Jemar ki jo Kamat. Lacen kaka pa jo Kanaan gucako ket woko ata. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Wang lobo pa jo Kanaan ocake ki i Cidon odok kwede i yo tung Gerar, nio kwede wa Gaja; ka odok yo tung Codom ki Gomora ki Adma ki Jeboim, nio kwede wa Laca. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Kam, kit macalo kakagi, lebgi, lobogi, ki rokgi tye kwede.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Cem, omin Yafeci madite, en aye kwaro lutino pa Eber ducu, en bene onywalo lutino. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Lutino awobe pa Cem aye Elam, Acur, Arpakcad, Lud ki Aram, <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Lutino awobe pa Aram gin aye Uj, Kul, Geter ki Mecek. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpakcad onywalo Cela, Cela onywalo Eber. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eber onywalo lutino awobe aryo; nying ngat acel onongo Peleg, pien ikare mere aye kipoko iye lobo, ki nying omine onongo Joktan. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Joktan onywalo Almodad, Celep, Kajarmabet, Jera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Adoram, Ujal, Dikla <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimael, Ceba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Opir, Kavila ki Jobab; magi gin ducu lutino awobe pa Joktan. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Lobo ma gubedo iye wange ocake ki i Meca, odok kwede yo tung Cepar nio kwede wa lobo godi ma tung kunyango. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Cem, macalo kakagi, lebgi, lobogi, ki rokgi tye kwede.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Man aye kaka pa lutino awobe pa Nua, kit ma tekwarogi tye kwede, i rokgi; rok ocako ket nia ki ikomgi oromo lobo, cake inge kare ma pii aluka ocore iwi lobo.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Lubele ma wiye ocudu me Babel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Yam con lobo ducu onongo tye ki leb acel keken, ki lok bene onongo lam. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Ikare ma dano gucako dak nia ki tung kunyango, gunongo ngom ma obedo bar i lobo Cinar, ci gubedo iye kunu. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ci gucako lok keken gi ni, “Wubin, wek wagoyu matapwali, wawanggi woko matek.” Ci gutiyo ki matapwali me ka got, ki odok macol me lamwon kin gi. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Dok guwaco ni, “Wubin, wek wageru taun madit ma mewa, ki lubele ma wiye olur ocudu wa malo ma gudu polo, wek wamiyu nyingwa oyweki, wek pe waket woko ata iwi lobo ducu.” <verse eid="GEN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ci Rwot olor piny kaneno gang ki lubele ma wiye olur ocudu maloni ma dano gugero. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Nen, jo man guribe gitye rok acel, ki lebgi bene acel; man aye pud acaki gin ma gibitiyo, dok gin ma gibitamo pi tiyone pe dong biloyogi. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Wubin walor wunu piny, wek warub lebgi woko, wek ngat acel acel pe oniang leb wadi.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Kitmeno Rwot okeyogi woko nia ki kunu, guromo lobo ducu, ci guweko gero gang meno. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ma omiyo nyinge gucako ni Babel, pien kenyo aye Rwot orubu iye leb ducu ma i lobo, dok Rwot okeyogi woko nia ki kunu, ci guromo lobo ducu.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Cem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Tek 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Man aye likwayo pa Cem. Ka Cem dong tye ki mwaka me dite miya acel, ci onywalo Arpakcad ma onongo dong okato mwaka aryo inge pii aluka. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Cem orii inge nywalo Arpakcad mwaka miya abic, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Ka Arpakcad dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek wiye abic, ci onywalo Cela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Arpakcad orii mwaka miya angwen ki adek madong otyeko nywalo Cela, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Ka Cela dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek, ci onywalo Eber. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Cela orii mwaka miya angwen ki adek madong otyeko nywalo Eber, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ka Eber dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek wiye angwen, ci onywalo Peleg. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Eber orii mwaka miya angwen ki pyere adek madong otyeko nywalo Peleg, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Ka Peleg dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek, ci onywalo Reu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Peleg orii mwaka miya aryo ki abongwen madong otyeko nywalo Reu, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Ka Reu dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek wiye aryo, ci onywalo Cerug. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Reu orii mwaka miya aryo ki abiro madong otyeko nywalo Cerug, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Ka Cerug dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere adek, ci onywalo Nakor. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Cerug orii mwaka miya aryo madong otyeko nywalo Nakor, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Ka Nakor dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere aryo wiye abongwen, ci onywalo Tera. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Nakor orii mwaka miya acel ki apar wiye abongwen madong otyeko nywalo Tera, dok omede ki nywalo awobe ki anyira bene.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Ka Tera dong otyeko rii mwaka pyere abiro, ci onywalo Abram, Nakor ki Karan.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Tera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Man aye likwayo pa Tera. Tera onywalo Abram, Nakor ki Karan; Karan onywalo Lot. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Karan okwongo to ki wone Tera i lobo mayam kinywale iye, i gang me Ur pa jo Kaldaya. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Ci Abram ki Nakor gunyomo mon; dako pa Abram nyinge Carai, dako pa Nakor nyinge Milka, en aye nya pa Karan won Milka ki Icika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Carai onongo lalur, dok onongo pe tye ki latin mo.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera otero wode Abram, ki Lot wod pa Karan, ma lakware, ki Carai ciwode, dako pa Abram, ci gudak woko ki i Ur, gang pa jo Kaldaya, gucito kacel kun gikemo lobo Kanaan; ento ma guo i Karan, kong gudike kenyo. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Nino me kwo pa Tera oromo mwaka miya aryo ki abic; ci Tera oto i Karan.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga olwongo Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:2-3">Tic 7:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Ibru 11:8</ref></char>
    </note>Rwot owaco ki Abram ni, “A woko ki i lobo tuwu, ki i kakawu, ki i paco pa woru, ci icit i lobo ma abinyuti. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Abimiyo idoko rok madit, abimiyi gum bene, abimiyo nyingi bedo dit, pien ibibedo lakelgum. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3:8</ref></char></note>Abimiyo gum ikom jo ma legi gum, abiceno ngat mo ma biceni; dok kaka ducu ma iwi lobo bilimo gumgi piri.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Kitmeno Abram ocako wot, kit macalo Rwot ocike; ki Lot bene ocito kacel kwede. Abram onongo dong tye ki mwaka me dite pyere abiro wiye abic ikare ma en oa kwede ki i Karan. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abram ocito ki dakone Carai, ki Lot latin pa omine, ki lwak limgi ducu ma gucoko kacel, ki lwak opii ducu ma gunongo ki i Karan; gucako wot me cito i lobo Kanaan. Ma dong gutyeko o i lobo Kanaan, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abram okato atir ki i dye lobo obino ikabedo ma i Cekem, nio wa ite yat kworo me More. Ikare meno onongo jo Kanaan aye gitye i lobo meno. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Tic 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:16">Gal 3:16</ref></char></note>Ci Rwot dok onen bot Abram kun wace ni, “Abimiyo lobo man bot likwayi.” Ci Abram ocano keno tyer kunu pi Rwot ma onen boteni. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Ka dok odak woko ki kunu, okobo odok ite got matye tung kunyango me Betel, ci oguro iye kemane, kun weko Betel tung kupotoceng, ki Ai tung kunyango; dok ocano keno tyer pi Rwot kunu, ci oworo iye Lubanga. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Abram dok okobo, omede ki wote i yo tung Negeb.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12:9 </char> <char style="fk">Negeb </char> en lobo ma tung kupiny me lobo Kanaan.</note><verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abram i lobo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Kec onongo opoto i lobo, omiyo Abram owoto odok kupiny i Ejipt, wek kong ebed kunu, pien kec ca onongo dong lyet tutwal i lobo. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ikare ma Abram cok donyo i Ejipt, owaco ki dakone Carai ni, “Angeyo ni in i dako manen mwonya mada; <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />ka Luejipt gibineni, ci gibiwaco ni, ‘Man dakone,’ ci gibineka woko, ento gibiweki makwo. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:2">Aca 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref></char></note>Pi man ibiwaco botgi ni, in lamera, ci gibibedo kweda maber piri, miyo abikwo piri.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Ka Abram dong otyeko donyo i Ejipt, ci Luejipt guneno dako meno mwonya matek tutwal. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Ka ludito ma i kal pa Parao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12:15 </char> <char style="fk">Parao </char> en aye nying ma kilwongo ki rwot me Ejipt. </note> guneno, ci guboro pire bote, gutero dako wa i ot pa Parao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Ci omiyo Parao obedo maber ki Abram pi Carai: omiyo okole lim, romi, ki twoni; twoni kana, lwak opii ki angecagu, megi kanagu, ki lwak kinagagu.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Ento Rwot ocwalo cog two gemo mogo madongo ikom Parao ki jo ma i ode, pi Carai dako pa Abram. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Omiyo Parao olwongo Abram bote, ci openye ni, “Itima kuman pingo? Pingo nene pe itita atir ni Carai obedo dakoni? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Pingo dok iwaco ni, ‘En lamera,’ omiya akwanyo, odoko dakona? Nen dong, dakoni enu. Kwany icit kwede giri.” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Parao ociko jone pire, ci gulwoke i yo, kacel ki dakone, ki lwak jami ducu mayam tye bote.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abram ki Lot gupoke woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Kitmeno Abram odwogo woko ki i Ejipt, en ki dakone, ki lwak jami ducu mayam tye bote, kacel ki Lot, ci gutiro i Negeb.<verse eid="GEN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ikare meno onongo Abram odoko lalonyo dyang mada, ki lim me ryal, ki me jabu bene. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Ci en okobo, omede ki wote nia ki i Negeb, odak wa Betel, kama yam kong okwongo guru iye kemane, matye ikin Betel ki Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />ikabedo mayam okwongo cano iye keno tyer; ki kunu aye dok Abram oworo iye Lubanga. <verse eid="GEN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Ki Lot mayam onywako wot ki Abram, ceng tye ki romi, dyegi ki dyangigu kacel ki jo ode bene. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Lobo onongo dong pe romo ka kwat pi gin aryo ducu; pien onongo gin ducu cinggi ki lim madwong, ma pe romogi bedo kacel. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Onongo mone dong tye ikin lukwa lim pa Abram ki lukwa lim pa Lot. Ikare meno onongo jo Kanaan ki jo Periji aye gibedo i lobo meno.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ci Abram owaco ki Lot ni, “Pe wawek mone obed ikin in ki an, ki ikin lukwa limi ki lukwa lima, pien wan ot acel. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Nen lobo man ducu tye inyimi ene. Ber ipoke giri woko keni ki ikoma. Ka ibidok tung kumalo, ci an abidok gira tung kupiny: ce ka in idok tung kupiny, ci an abidok gira tung kumalo.” <verse eid="GEN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:10">Aca 2:10</ref></char></note>Ci Lot ocako loke ka oneno nota Jordan ducu ma iye ki pii macalo poto pa Rwot, rom ki lobo Ejipt ma odok yo tung Joar; man yam otime ikare ma Rwot peya ojwero Codom ki Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Pimeno Lot oyero gire pire kene lobo ducu mayam tye i nota Jordan, ci Lot ocako dak tung kunyango, kitmeno gupoke woko keken gi. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram obedo mere i lobo Kanaan, kun Lot kono obedo mere ikin gangi ma gitye i nota, ci ocako dak ki jo ode gucito wa i Codom. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Jo ma i Codom onongo jo maracu, balgi onongo dwong tutwal inyim Rwot.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Rwot oloko ki Abram madong onongo gutyeko poke woko ki Lot ni, “Il wangi malo, nen piny nia ki ikabedo ma itye iyeni, nen tung kumalo ki tung kupiny, ki tung kunyango ki tung kupotoceng; <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Tic 7:5</ref></char></note>pien lobo meno ducu ma inenoni abimiyone boti ki bot likwayi matwal. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Abimiyo likwayi bedo pol marom ki apwa me ngom; ma omiyo ka ngat mo twero kwano wel apwa me ngom, ci likwayi welgi bikwane. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Dong ia malo, iwot i dye loboni, wek inen bore ki lace, pien abimiyo boti.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Kitmeno Abram okobo kemane, ci odak, obedo ite kworo me Mamre, matye i Kebron; dok ocano keno tyer pi woro Rwot kunu.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abram olaro Lot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Ikare pa Amrapel rwot me Cinar, ki Ariok rwot me Ellacar, ki Kedor-laomer rwot me Elam, ki Tidal rwot me Goyim, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />luker meno guribe kalweny ikom Bera rwot me Codom, ki Birca rwot me Gomora, ki Cinab rwot me Adma, ki Cemeber rwot me Jeboim, ki rwot me Bela, en aye Joar. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Luker abic magi ducu guribe kalweny i nota me Ciddim, en aye Nam Muto. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Gubedo ite loc pa Kedor-laomer pi mwaka apar wiye aryo, ento gujemo woko i mwaka me apar wiye adeke. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />I mwaka me apar wiye angwene, Kedor-laomer ki luker mayam gitye kwede gubino dok guero lweny, ci guloyo jo Repaim i Aciterot-Kamaim, ki jo Jujim i Kam, ki jo Emim i Cabwe-Kiriataim, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ki jo Kori i lobo godi meggi me Ceir, nio wa i El-paran iwang apoki lobo ma tung tim. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Ka dok gudwogo cen, gucito wa i En-micipat, en aye Kadec, guloyo lobo ducu pa jo Amalek, ki Jo Amor bene ma gibedo i Kajajon-tamar.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Ka dok rwot me Codom, rwot me Gomora, rwot me Adma, rwot me Jeboim, ki rwot me Bela (ma en aye, Joar) gucito guero lweny i nota me Ciddim, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />ikom Kedor-laomer rwot me Elam, ki Tidal rwot me Goyim, ki Amrapel rwot me Cinar, ki Ariok rwot me Ellacar, luker angwen guribe kalweny ikom luker abic. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Nota me Ciddim onongo tye iye bur odok macol; ka luker me Codom ki me Gomora guringo woko, jo mukene gupoto i bur meno, ki jo mukene mudonge guringo, gularo igot. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Ci merok guyako jami pa jo Codom ki Gomora ducu, ki camgi ducu, gucoke, gucito kwede, <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />guyako bene Lot latin pa omin Abram, ma onongo obedo i Codom, ki jamine ducu, guwoto kwede woko.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Ci dano acel mo ma obwot oringo, obino otito ki Abram ma Laibru, ma onongo bedo ite kworo me Mamre, ma en La-amor, omin Ecikol ki Aner; gin yam gucike pi ribe ki Abram. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Ka Abram owinyo ni mony oyako watgi woko, ci ocoko monye kacel, ka otelo wi jo mupwonyo lweny ma kinywalogi i ode, jo ma giromo miya adek ki apar wiye aboro, ci olubu korgi nio wa i Dan. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />En opoko i monye idyewor; ci en ki lutice gumonyogi, ci guryemogi nio wa i Koba, i tung kumalo me Damaciko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Ka oyako jami ducu, odwogo kwede, kacel ki watgi Lot, jamine ducu ki mon gi ki lwakgi ducu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Melkijedek olamo gum ikom Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Ikare madong odwogo ki kama en oloyo iye Kedor-laomer ki Luker ma gitye kwedeni, ci rwot me Codom ocito kangolo wiye i wanga yo wa i nota me Cabwe, ma en aye Nota pa Rwot. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 7:1-10">Ibru 7:1-10</ref></char></note>Melkijedek rwot me Calem okelo ire mugati ki kongo bwino; en aye onongo ajwaka pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Ci en olego gum ikom Abram kun waco ni, “Lubanga Mamalo Twal ma lacwec me polo ki lobo omii gum ikom Abram! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Kipak Lubanga Mamalo Twal ma omiyo lumeroki i cingi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 14:20">Ci Abram omiye dul acel me apar me jami ducu ma en omayo ki bot lumerok. <verse eid="GEN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Rwot me Codom dok owaco ki Abram ni, “Dwoka mera danona aye, ento in iter giri jami ducu obed meri.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Ento Abram odok iye bot rwot me Codom ni, “Dong atyeko kwongo kwong woko bot Rwot Lubanga Mamalo Twal, ma ocweyo polo ki lobo <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />ni, pe abigamo gin mo ki boti kadi latin uci, nyo del war mo, nyo gin mo ikin jami ma merini, wek pe ibed kawaco ni, ‘Amiyo Abram olony.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Pe dok abigamo gin mo, dong agik ki gin ma awobena gucamoni, ki dul lim ma apoko ki jo ma gucito kwedani; wek dong Aner, ki Ecikol Mamre guter jamigi gigi.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga omoko gicikene ki Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />I nge lok meno ducu, Lubanga dok oloko ki Abram i ginanyuta kun waco ni, “Pe ilwor, Abram, an a kwoti, abimiyi mot madit tutwal.” <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Ento Abram ogamo ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, ibimiya mono gin ango? Pud atye labongo latin mo en do, ki laleyona bene aye Eliejer Ladamacikoni do.” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abram dok owaco ni, “Nen, in peya imiya nyodo mo; latin opii ma kinywalo i oda aye bibedo laleyona gire.” <verse eid="GEN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Ci dok nen, lok pa Rwot obino bote ni, “Dano man pe bibedo laleyoni; wodi kikome aye bibedo laleyoni.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:18">Rom 4:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibru 11:12</ref></char></note>Ci okele woko, ka owace ni “Nen malo i polo, kwan wel lakalatwe, ka itwero kwano welgi.” Dok owace ni. “Kitmeno wel likwayi bene bibedo rom meno.” <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Yak 2:23</ref></char></note>Ci en oye lok pa Rwot; ci kikwane ni en dano ma kite atir.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Ci Lubanga owace ni, “An a Rwot ma akeli nia ki i Ur ma gang pa jo Kaldaya, pi mini loboni wek obed meri.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Ci Abram ogamo ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga, man abingeyo ningning ni loboni bibedo mera?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Ci Lubanga wace ni, “Kela roya mo me mwaka adek, dyel me mwaka adek, nyok romo me mwaka adek, amam, ki latin akuri.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Ci okelo bote lwak gin meno ducu, ka dong opoko igi arii aryoaryo, ka opyelogi ma gukeme ki luwotgi; pe onguno i winyo aryo. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Ka acut bino kacamo ringogi, ci Abram ryemogi woko.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:13">Yub 4:13</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 4:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Ikare ma ceng dong mito poto woko, ci nino madwong omako wang Abram; nen, ka piny ocako cido woko macol licuc. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:1-14">Nia 1:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:6">Tic 7:6</ref></char></note>Rwot owaco ki Abram ni, “Nge atir ni, likwayi gibidoko lubedo i lobo ma pe meggi, dok gibibedo opii kunu, kibibwoyogi ki tek pi mwaka miya angwen. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40-41">Nia 12:40-41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:7">Tic 7:7</ref></char></note>Ento abingolo kop ikom rok ma biloyogini, lacen gibiloke, gidwogo kany ki lwak lim madwong. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Ento in kikomi, ibicito bot kwarowu ki kuc; kibiyiki ma nongo dong itii likong. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Dok gibidwogo kany ikare me likwayo ma i yalwak me angwen; pien bal pa jo Amor pud pe ya oromo.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Ikare ma ceng dong opoto, ma piny dong odoko col, nen, agulu ma duny yito, ki mac ma lyel, owok i dye ringo ma kipokoni. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Tic 7:5</ref></char></note>Inino meno aye Rwot oketo iye gicikene ki Abram, kun waconi, “Amiyo lobo man bot likwayi, nia wa i kulu me Ejipt nio wa i nam madit, en nam Euprate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />lobo pa jo Kenit, jo Keniji, jo Kadmon <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />jo Kit jo Periji, jo Repa, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />jo Amor, jo Kanaan jo Girgac ki jo Jebuc.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Agar ki Icmael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Carai dako pa Abram onongo pud peya onywale latin mo, dok en onongo tye ki angecane ma anyira Ejipt ma nyinge Agar. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Carai owaco ki Abram ni, “Nen, Rwot ogenga woko me nywalo latin mo, cit wek i but ki angecana, gwok nyo abinongo iye latin mo ma en binywalo.” Ci Abram owinyo dog Carai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Kitmeno, ikare ma Abram otyeko bedo i lobo Kanaan mwaka apar, Carai dako pa Abram otero Agar anyira Ejipt ma angecane, omiye bot cware Abram wek obed dakone. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Ci Abram ocako butu ki Agar, ci Agar ogamo ic. Ka Agar oneno ni dong egamo ic, ci ocako gayo Carai ki wang me cac. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Carai owaco ki Abram ni, “Kipwola mupoto ikomani odok meri! Amiyo angecana i kori; ci man en oneno ni dong egamo ic, ci ocako gayo an ki wang me cac. Myero Rwot dong ongol kop ma atir ikin in ki an!” <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Ento Abram ogamo dog Carai ni, “Nen, angecani tye ite tweroni giri, in itim giri kit ma i mito ikome.” Omiyo Carai ocako une ki aroma malit, nio ka olwi, oringo woko ki bote.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Lamalaika pa Rwot ononge iwang it mo ma i dye tim; it meno tye i yo ma cito Cur. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Obino openye ni, “Agar, angeca pa Carai, in mono ia ki kwene ka, dok icito wa kwene ka?” En ogamo ni, “An alwi aringo Carai, min ot ma abedo i cingeni.” <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Ci lamalaika ogamo ni, “Dok cen bot min ot meno, ci iwore.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Lamalaika pa Rwot dok omedo lok ni, “An abimiyo likwayi nya mapol tutwal, ma ngat mo pe romo kwano welgi pi polgi.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Dok lamalaika pa Rwot omede ka wace ni, “Nen, igamo ic, ibinywalo latin laco, dok ibicako nyinge Icmael; pien Rwot obedo kaneno aromani. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />En bibedo dano ma cal ki kana me tim, en bituge ikom dano ducu, ki dano ducu bene bituge ikome; en bibedo ikabedone pat kun pyem ki utmegine ducu.” <verse eid="GEN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Ci Agar ocako nying Rwot ma oloko kwede ni, “In Lubanga maneno.” Onongo en owaco ni, “An atyeko neno Lubanga ada, aneno en ci pud atye makwo gira!” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Ma omiyo nying wang it meno kicako ni, Beer-lakai-roi;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16:14 </char> <char style="fk" closed="false">Beer-lakai-roi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tere ni, “Wang it pa en makwo ma neno in matye ikin Kadec ki Bered.” </char></note><verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:22">Gal 4:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Agar onywalo ki Abram latin laco; Abram ocako nying latine ma Agar onywalo ni Icmael. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abram onongo tye ki mwaka me dite pyere aboro wiye abicel ikare ma Agar onywalo Icmael.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lanyut me gicike aye lire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Ikare ma Abram onongo tye ki mwaka me dite pyere abongwen wiye abongwen ci Rwot onen bot Abram kun wace ni, “An Lubanga Matwero ducu, bed inyima labongo bal mo, <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />ci abiketo gicikena ikin an ki in, dok abimiyi likwayo ma mapol tutwal.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Ci Abram oryebe piny inyime; ci Lubanga owace ni, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nen, amini gicikena eno, in i bibedo kwaro rok mapol. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Rom 4:17</ref></char></note>Nia tin nyingi pe dok bibedo Abram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17:5 </char> <char style="fk">Abram </char> te loke Kwaro ma ki ilo malo. </note>, ento nyingi bibedo Abraim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17:5 </char> <char style="fk">Abraim </char> te loke “Kwaro” rok mapol. </note> pien aketo in wek ibed kwaro rok mapol. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Abimiyi inya tutwal; abimiyi idoko rok mapol, ki luker bene gibia ki ikomi. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:55">Luk 1:55</ref> </char></note>Dok abimoko gicikena ikin an ki in ki likwayi ma bilubi, ki i yalwakgi ducu, me bedo gicike ma bedo matwal, wek abed Lubangani, ki Lubanga pa likwayi ma bilubi bene. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Tic 7:5</ref> </char></note> Dok abimiyo boti ki bot likwayi ma bilubi lobo man ma itye iye calo weloni, en aye lobo ducu me Kanaan, wek obed mewu matwal; dok an aye abibedo Lubangagi.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ka Lubanga dok owaco bot Abraim ni, “Ki tung boti, in ibigwoko gicikena, in ki likwayi ducu ma bilubi, ki yalwakgi ducu. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Tic 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rom 4:11</ref> </char></note>Man aye gicikena, ma wubigwoko, ikin an ki in ki likwayi ma bilubi: kibiliro lutino awobe ducu ma ikinwu. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Wubiliro del kom nyimwu me co woko, wek obed gin ma nyutu gicikena ikin an ki wun. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Latin laco ma oromo nino aboro nicake inino ma kinywale iye kibiliro del kom nyime woko; co ducu kibilirogi i yalwak ki yalwakgi ducu, nia ikom lutino opii ma kinywalogi i pacowu, nio ikom lutino ma wuwilo awila ki limwu ki bot lurok bene, ma pe wunywalogi anywala. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Gin ducu ma kinywalogi i pacowu, ki ma kiwilogi awila ki limwu, ducu kibilirogi, wek gicikena obed i del kom nyimwu, wek obed gicike ma bedo matwal. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Ka laco mo onen ma pe giliro del kom nyime me co, ci pe kibikwane ikin dano ma an ayero me bedo danona, pien nongo oturu gicikena.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Ka Lubanga dok owaco ki Abraim ni, “Ma dok ikom Carai dakoni, pe dok kibilwongo nyinge ni Carai, ento nyinge dong bibedo Cara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17:15 </char> <char style="fk">Cara </char> te loke “Nya ker.” </note>. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Abimiye gum, dok makato ducu abimiyo en nywali latin laco; abimiye gum, en bibedo min rok mapol, ki luker mapol gibia ki ikome.” <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ci Abraim opoto piny aryeba ic ki nyero, kun tamo gire kekene ni, “Dano ma dite dong romo mwaka miya kulu aye dok binywalo latin? Ki Cara bene ma dite dong romo mwaka pyere abongwen kulu dok binywalo latin?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Ci Abraim owaco bot Lubanga ni, “Pingo pe dong iwek Icmael aye obed laleyona!” <verse eid="GEN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Lubanga owace ni, “Pe gire, ento dakoni Cara aye binywali latin laco, dok ibicako nyinge Icaka, dok abimoko gicikena kwede wek obed gicike ma bedo matwal bot likwaye ducu ma bilube. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Ma dok ikom Icmael bene, atyeko winyo in, ci nen, abimiye gum, abimiyo en binywal dok nya mapol tutwal; en bibedo kwaro luker apar wiye aryo, abimiye bedo rok madit. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Ento abimoko gicikena ki Icaka, latin ma Cara aye binywali ikare macalo man i mwaka ma bino.”<verse eid="GEN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Ka Lubanga dong otyeko lok ki Abraim, ci oa woko ki bote, odok malo. <verse eid="GEN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Abraim otero Icmael ki lwak opii ducu ma kinywalogi i ode, nyo ma ki wilogi ki lim, co ducu ma gitye ikin lutino ma i ot pa Abraim, ci oliro del kom nyimgi me co woko inino meno kikome, kit macalo Lubanga ocike kwede. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Ka Abraim onongo tye ki mwaka me dite pyere abongwen wiye abongwen en aye kicako liro iye del kome me co. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Ki wode Icmael onongo dong tye ki mwaka me dite apar wiye adek ka kicako liro del kome me co. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Inino meno kikome en aye Abraim ki wode Icmael kiliro iye del komgi me co, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />kacel ki jo ducu ma gitye i ode, lutino opii ma kinywalo i ode, ki jo ma kiwilogi ki lim ki bot lurok; gin bene kilirogi kacel kwede.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ocike me miyo ki Abraim latin laco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Rwot dok onen bot Abraim ite kworo matye i Mamre, ma onongo obedo i dog kemane ikare ma piny lyet. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Ibru 13:2</ref></char></note> Abraim oilo wange malo, ci oneno co adek gucung inyime. Ka onenogi, oringo nia ki i dog kema, ocito kangolo wigi, ci oryebe piny i ngom, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />kun waco ni, “Luditona, ka gum okaya inyimwu, pe wukat an latici akata. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Wek kong kikel pii mo matitidi, wek wulwok ki tyenwu, ka dong wuywe ite yat man. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Dok abicito kaomo mugati mo manok wek wubwol ki dogwu, ka dong wucak kato giwu me cito, kit macalo dong wubino botani.” Ci gin gugamo ni, “Citim kit ma iwaconi.” <verse eid="GEN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Abraim orune ocito bot Cara i kema, owace ni, “Job moko mapwote maromo adita adek, inywang, wek ited mugatimo.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Abraim oringo i idwol, okwanyo wod twon ma ringone pud yom mamit, omiyo bot awobine, ci oyubu oyotoyot. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ka okelo cak lukulu ki cak malibo, ki dek ringo ma gitedo, oketo inyimgi; en obedo kangetgi ka kurugi ite yat, kun gicamo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Ci gin gupenye ni, “Dakoni Cara kono tye kwene?” En ogamo ni, “En tye i kema.” <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom 9:9</ref></char></note> Ci ngat acel ki ikin co adeki owace ni, “Abidwogo boti ikare macalo man, ma nongo dakoni Cara dong tye ki wode.” Cara onongo tye ki ingeye i dog kema, kun winyo lokgi. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ikare meno onongo Abraim ki Cara mwaka me ditogi dong dwong: dok Cara onongo dong pe neno dwe macalo mon wadigi. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 Pet 3:6</ref></char></note> Ma omiyo Cara onyere kekene, kun waco ni, “Ma dong atii woko likong, ki cwara bene dong otii woko likong, dong abinongo miti mo me co ningo?” <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Rwot owaco bot Abraim ni, “Cara onyero mono pirngo kun waco ni, ‘An mono dok abinywalo latin, ma kombedi dong atii wokoni?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:37">Luk 1:37</ref></char></note>Tye gin mo matek maloyo Rwot? Ka kare oromo kit ma awaconi, ci abidwogo dok kany, ikare macalo man, ma nongo Cara dong tye ki wode.” <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Ento Cara pi lworo opyem woko kun waco ni, “An pe anyero gira.” Ogamo doge ni, “Pe, ento me nyero aye inyero gire.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraim olego pi Codom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Ka jo meno gucako a woko ki kunu, ci guneno yo tung Codom; ci Abraim olwokogi i yo. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Rwot openye kekene ni, “Myero akano gin ma acito katiyone woko ki bot Abraim, <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />kun Abraim bidoko rok madit ki matek, ma rok ducu ma iwi lobo gibilimo gum ki ikome? <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Pe; an dong atyeko yero en, wek ocik lutinone ki jo ma i ode wek gulub yo pa Rwot ma gitiyo gin matye atir dok me ada; wek lacen Rwot omii ki Abraim gin mayam otyeko cike kwedeni.” <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Ka dong Rwot owace ni, “Pien koko ikom Codom ki Gomora dong okato kare woko, ki balgi dong dwong tutwal, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />abicito botgi wek acit anen ka ada gitye katiyo kit ma koko ikomgi owinye kwede botani; ka pe, ci abingeyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Kitmeno guloke, gucako wot me kemo i Codom; ento Abraim pud ocung inyim Rwot aye. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Lacen Abraim onyiko bote cok, owaco ni, “In ada ibityeko jo ma kitgi atir kacel ki jo ma kitgi racu? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Ka gwok nyo jo ma kitgi atir binonge pyere abic i gang meno, ci ibityeko kabedo meno woko, pe ibijalo gang meno pi jo pyere abic ma kitgi atir ma gitye iyeni? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Pe kumeno! In pe myero inek jo ma kitgi atir kacel ki jo ma kitgi racu, kun imiyo jo ma kitgi atir bene bedo rom ki jo ma kitgi racu. In langolkop me lobo ducu mono pe ibitimo gin manen atir, bo?” <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Ka anongo i Codom jo ma kitgi atir pyere abic matye i gang meno, ci abitimo kica i kabedo meno ducu pirgi.” <verse eid="GEN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abraim ogamo dok ni, “Nen, an dong adyere me lok kwedi, in Rwot, an mera apwa ki buru mamwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Gwok nyo kace birem jo abic me romo jo pyere abic? Ci ibityeko gang meno ducu woko pi jo abic muremi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “An pe abityekone kace anongo kunu jo pyere angwen wiye abic.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abraim dok onwoyo aye, owaco ni, “Ce ka ibinongo kunu jo pyere angwen keken kono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Pi jo pyerangweni pe abitimo iye gin mo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abraim dok owaco ni, “Pe kiniga omaki, in Rwot, an abilok doki. Kace binonge kunu jo pyere adek kono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Pe abitimo ce abinongo kunu jo pyere adek.” <verse eid="GEN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abraim dok owaco ni, “Nen, an dong adyere me lok kwedi, in Rwot. Gwok nyo jo pyere aryo binonge kunu kono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Pi jo pyeraryonu pe abityeko gang.” <verse eid="GEN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Abraim dok onwoyo aye ni, “Pe kiniga omaki, in Rwot, an abilok doki tyen acel keken. Gwok ka ibinongo kunu jo apar keken kono?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Pi jo aparni pe abityekone.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Ci dong Rwot ocako cito, ka dong otyeko lok ki Abraim; ci Abraim odok gire ikabedone.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Tim cilo pa jo Codom ki Gomora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Lumalaika aryo gubino i Codom otyeno; gunongo Lot obedo piny i dog gang me Codom. Ka Lot onenogi, ci oa malo, ocito kajologi, oryebe, okulu wiye piny i ngom, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />kun waco ni, “Luditona, alegowu, wuloke, wudwog kany, wudony i oda an laticwu, wulwok tyenwu, wubut wor acel, ci dong wubia giwu odiko con, wucito i yo wotwu.” Ci gugamo ni, “Pe, wan wabibutu i dye bar me taun man.” <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Ento en odiyogi ki tek mada, ci guloke, gudonyo i ode; Lot otedo ki gin cam maber, ki mugati ma pe kirubu ki tobi, en aye gucamo.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Ento ma pud peya gubutu, lwak co ma i taun meno, jo me Codom, awobe wa ki ludito bene, gutenge woko ducu, gubino, gurumu ot woko. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 19:22-24">Lung 19:22-24</ref></char></note>Gulwongo Lot, gupenye ni, “Co ma gubino boti otyenoni gitye kwene? Kelgi woko botwa kany, wek wabut kwedgi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lot okato woko, ocito botgi, ci oloro dogola woko cut ki ingeye, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />kun waco ni, “Alegowu, utmega, pe wutim tim aranyi. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Wunen, an atye kany ki anyirana aryo ma pud peya gungene ki co. Wek akel gin aye botwu, wek wutimgi giwu kit ma wumito; ento pe wutim gin mo ikom co man, pien gin dong gutyeko donyo woko i oda.” <verse eid="GEN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Ento gin guwaco ni, “Nyik cen!” Ka dong guwaco ni “Nye man obino kany macalo adonyi, dok mito doko langolkop kany ce? Wan koni dong wabitimi marac makato gin.” Ci gucoro Lot cen, kun gitware ginyiko katuru kika. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Ento co aryo maca gucwalo cinggi, ci guywayo Lot gudwoke cen i ot botgi, ci guloro dogola woko. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:18">Luk 6:18</ref></char></note> Ci gucwalo to wang ma ocoro wang dano ma gudile i dogolani woko, ludito ki awobe bene, wangi ocor woko, gubedo kapange ata kayenyo dogola, ci guol woko ata.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Co aryo meno gucako waco ki Lot ni, “In itye ki jo mukene ma watwu kany bene? Macalo cog anyirani, ki lutino awobe ki anyiragi, nyo ki ngat mo matye i taun kany. Kwanygi wek wua woko ki ikabedo man; <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />pien wayube me tyeko taun man kun waneko woko libok. Pien koko ma ikom jo ma gitye iye dong gudoko dit ma pe tite inyim Rwot, piman Rwot ocwalowa ni dong wabin, watyek kun waneko woko libok.” <verse eid="GEN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Ma omiyo Lot okato ocito, olwongo cog anyirane, ma onongo nene gimito nyomo anyirane ni, kun waco ki gin ni, “Wua woko ki ikabedo man, pien Rwot obityeko gang man woko.” Ento cog anyirane guwinyo calo lok oree.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Kwar piny, ma piny dong bino ka ruu, Lumalaika guruyu Lot, kun giwace ni, “A woko oyotoyot, icit ki dakoni ki anyirani aryo ma gitye kwedi kanyi, wek pe ginekgi i can ma gibimiyo ikom taun man.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 Pet 2:7</ref></char></note>Ento en obedo ka junge, ma omiyo jo meno gumako cinggi, gupeyogi woko, en ki dakone ki anyirane aryo; Rwot obedo ki kica ikomgi, gucwalogi woko cen ki i taun meno. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Ka dong gukelogi woko, ci gucikogi ni, “Wuring wular kwowu; pe wuloke wunen ngewu, pe wugik i yo kamo i nota, wuring wular godi, wek pe kinekwu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Lot owaco ki gin ni, “Pe wuwek obed kumeno luditona. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Nen, an dong gum okaya ki botwu, dok wunyutu ikoma kica madwong pi Laro kwo na; ento pe atwero ringo nio wa i godi, miyo gin marac dok poto ikoma, ci neka woko. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Nen, gang macoke loka ca, ma aromo ringo alaro iye, dok gange tidi mo. Wek aring alar kunu; pe gange nen tidi tutwal? Wek alar kwo na do!” <verse eid="GEN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />En owace ni, “Nen, gum meno dok amiyi bene aye; pe dong abibalo taun ma iloko pireni. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Dong irune oyoto, ilar kunu; peya atwero timo gin mo nio ka io kunu.” Ma omiyo nying taun meno gucako ni Joar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="fk">Joar </char> i Leb Ibru te loke ni tidi. </note> <verse eid="GEN 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Ceng otuc ma onongo Lot donyo i Joar.<verse eid="GEN 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:23-24">11:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:29">17:29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:6">2 Pet 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Jud 7</ref> </char>
    </note>Ci Rwot ocwalo gweng calfa ma lyel mac ma mac oliyo woko, ocwer piny nia ki i polo, ocore ikom Codom ki Gomora, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />obalo gang meno ci oneko woko libok, ki notane ducu, ki lwak jo ducu ma gibedo i gangi meno, ki gin ducu ma gidongo i ngom. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:32">Luk 17:32</ref> </char></note>Ento dako pa Lot mudong cen angeci, oloke oneno ngeye, ci oloke odoko wir kado cut. <verse eid="GEN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Abraim oa odiko con, ci ocito ikabedo mayam kong ocung iye inyim Rwoti. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Ci obolo wange oneno yo tung Codom ki Gomora, ki tung lobo ducu ma i notanu, ci oneno yito ma duny i lobonu, macalo ruk mac mukur.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Kitmeno Rwot otyeko taun ducu ma i nota inino meno, Lubanga opo pi Abraim, omiyo okwanyo Lot woko, wek can pe opot ikome, ikare ma obalo taun mayam Lot obedo iye woko.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwaro pa jo Moab ki jo Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lot oa woko ki i Joar, ocito obedo i godi, kacel ki anyirane aryonu, pien onongo lworo bedo i Joar, ci odonyo obedo i boro, kacel ki anyirane aryonu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Nyare me kayone ocako waco bot lamine matidi ni, “Wonwa dong oteggi woko, pe tye laco mo iwi lobo ma bibino botwa ka nyomowa me bedo kwedwa ikit pa dano ma wi loboni. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Bin, wek wamii ki wonwa kongo bwino, wek omat, ci wabibutu kwede, wek wanong nyodo, wonwa aye onywal kwedwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Ci gumiyo won gi omato kongo idyewor meno, cut latin kayone ocito, obutu ki wone, ma kun pe ngeyo ka nyare obutu kwede, ki kare ma nyare oa kwede malo. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Orwone latin kayone dok owaco bot matidine ni, “Nen, tin dyewor dong atyeko butu ki wora; wek dok wamiye omat kongo tin dyewor bene, wek in dok icit ibut kwede, wek wanong nyodo, wonwa aye onywal kwedwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Dok gumiyo won gi kongo omato idyewor meno; ci nyare matidini dok oa, ocito obutu kwede; en pe ongeyo kare ma nyare obutu kwede, ki kare ma nyare oa kwede malo. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Kitmeno anyira pa Lot aryonu ducu gunywal ki won gi. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Kayone onywalo latin laco, ocako nyinge Moab; en aye odoko kwaro jo Moab nio wa kombedi. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Nyare matidine bene dok onywalo latin laco, ci ocako nyinge Ben-ammi; en aye odoko kwaro jo Ammon wa kombedi.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abraim ki Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Ci Abraim ocako wot me cito i lobo Negeb matye ikin Kadec ki Cur, obedo i Gerar, kama otiro iye macalo labedo. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Aca 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref></char></note>Abraim ocako lok ikom dakone Cara ni, “En lamera.” Ci Abimelek rwot me Gerar ocwalo jone guomo Cara. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Ento Lubanga obino bote iwang lek dyewor, pi lok kom Cara, dako pa Abraim kun wace ni, “Nen, in i dano ma lato, pien dako ma in iomoni dako ma cware tye.” <verse eid="GEN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Abimelek onongo peya obutu kwede; ci en ogamo ni, “Rwot, in mono ibineko rok mo ma pe obalo? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Pe Abraim aye gire otita kun waca ni, ‘Dakoni lamera?’ Dako kikome bene owaco ni, ‘En omera.’ Atimo man ma cwinya leng, ki cinga bene pe obalo gin mo.” <verse eid="GEN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Lubanga dok owace iwang lek ni, “Eyo, angeyo ni itimo kumeno ma cwinyi leng, ci onongo an aye abedo ka ngetgi, oweko pe itimo bal mo inyima; ma omiyo pe aye in igudu kome. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Dong idwok dakoni bot cware gire; pien en lanebi, en bilego piri, ci ibikwo. Ento ka ikwero dwoko dakonu bot cware, ber inge ni ibito woko ada, in ki jo ma i paconi ducu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Oruune odiko con Abimelek oa malo, olwongo lutice ducu, ci otito botgi lok meno ducu, ci gubedo ki lworo madwong. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Ci Abimelek olwongo Abraim bote, owace ni, “Itimowa kuman pingo? Abali gin ango, ma omiyo in ikelo bal madit ikoma ki ikom kera? In itimo gin ma pe myero atiya ikom dano.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Ka dok Abimelek owaco bot Abraim ni, “Onongo mono itamo ningo, ma omiyo itimo kit man?” <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abraim ogamo ni, “Atimo kit man, pien onongo atamo ni, jo ma ikabedo man pe gilworo Lubanga, gibineka woko pi dakona. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Ada mere lamera kikome, nya pa wora, ento pe latin pa maa kikome, ci anyome odoko dakona. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Ikare ma Lubanga okwanya woko ki i ot pa wora, ma abedo kawot kun adonyo i lobo ma woko mapatpat, acako waco bot Cara ni, ‘Pi kicani myero itima kit man: ikabedo ducu ma wabio iye, ibinyuta ni, Man omera.’”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Ci Abimelek okelo romi ki twoni ki lwak opii ki lwak angeca, omiyogi bot Abraim, ci odwoko dakone Cara bote. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimelek owaco ki Abraim ni, “Nen, lobona tye inyimi en; bed kama i mito.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Ka dok en owaco bot Cara ni, “Nen, atyeko miyo ki omeru cekel me ryal maromo alip acel, pi waro kop woko ki ikomi iwang dano ducu ma ibedo kwedgi, wek ibed labongo bal mo ikomi.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ka Abraim olego Lubanga, ci Lubanga ocango Abimelek ki dakone bene, ki lwak angecane, ci gucako nywalo lutino; <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />pien onongo Rwot ogengo nyodo woko i ot pa Abimelek pi lok kom Cara, dako pa Abraim.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Nywalo Icaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Rwot dok olimo Cara kit ma con owaco, ci otime kit mayam ociko kwede. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Ibru 11:11</ref></char></note>Cara ogamo ic, ci onywalo latin laco ki Abraim, ma kun en dong otii woko, ikare mayam Lubanga otite pireni. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abraim ocako nying latin ma Cara aye onywaloni, ni Icaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:12">Aca 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:8">Tic 7:8</ref></char></note>Abraim oliro wode Icaka madong oromo nino aboro me dite, kit mayam Lubanga ocike kwede. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Abraim onongo dong mwaka me dite romo miya acel, ka dong kinywalo wode Icaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Cara owaco ni, “Lubanga dong omiya anyero; wa ngat ma biwinyo bene binyero kacel kweda.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Ci owaco ni, “anga ma kono ceng owaco ki Abraim ni wang mo Cara bidoto latin? Nen man dong anywale awobi madong en otii oloc woko.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiryemo Agar ki Icmael woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Latin odongo, ci kikwanye woko ki i cak; Abraim otedo karama madit inino ma kikwanyo Icaka ki i cak. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ento ka Cara oneno wod pa Agar ma anyira Ejipt, mayam onywal ki Abraim, ka tuku ki latine Icaka, <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-30">Gal 4:29-30</ref></char></note>en owaco bot Abraim ni, “Ryem angeca man ki wode, wek gucit woko, pien wod pa angeca man pe bibedo laleyo kacel ki woda Icaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Lok meno ocwero cwiny Abraim matek, pi wodenu. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7">Rom 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:18">Ibru 11:18</ref></char></note>Ento Lubanga owaco ki Abraim ni, “Pe cwinyi ocwer pi latin ki pi angecani; gin ducu ma Cara owaco ni, tim kit ma en otiti, pien lutino pa Icaka aye kibilwongogi ni likwayu. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Dok abimiyo wod pa angeca bene doko rok, pien en latini.” <verse eid="GEN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Abraim opuk odiko con, okwanyo mugati ki opiru pii, omiyo Agar, olwoke otere i yo, ci ongabo jami ki latine iwi gwoke, ocwale kwede woko. Dako meno ocito gire, obedo ka lak ata i tim me Beer-ceba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Ikare ma pii ma i opiru otum woko, ci opyelo latine piny ite yat bunga mo. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Ci oweko latine, ocito obedo cen kama bore rom ki kama ka kibayo atero ci gik iye; pien owaco ni, “Pe myero anen kit ma latina to kwede,” ci latin odange ki koko. <verse eid="GEN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Lubanga owinyo koko pa latin, lamalaika pa Rwot ocako lwongo Agar ki i polo, kun wace ni, “Man lok ango Agar? Pe dong ilwor, pien Lubanga dong otyeko winyo dwon koko pa latin ki kama ipyele iyeni. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Dong ia malo, ci imak cinge latin wek itinge malo, pien abimiyo en doko rok madit.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Ka Lubanga oyabo wang Agar, ci neno wang it; ci ocito otwomo pii, opiko i opiru pyen pong, ka omiyo wode omato. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Lubanga obedo ki latin meno; odongo, obedo i tim, odoko ladwar matek ki atero. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Obedo i tim Paran; mine onyome nya jo Ejipt.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gicike ikin Abraim ki Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:22:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 26:26">Aca 26:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno Abimelek ki ladit wi monye Pikol guwaco bot Abraim ni, “Lubanga tye kwedi i gin ducu ma itiyo. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Kombedi dong ikwong kwong kweda i nying Lubangani, ni pe ibiumu wanga ki tim buya, kadi wa lutinona ki likwaya bene; kit macalo an bene atimi beri, in bene ibitima ber, ki lobona ma kombedi in labedo iyeni.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abraim ogamo ni, “Abikwongo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ikare ma Abraim okelo kokone bot Abimelek pi wang pii mo ma onongo lutice gucere woko kome. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimelek ogamo ni, “An pe amedo ki ngeyo ngat mo ma otimo lakit lok meno; in bene pe imedo ki tita loke. Pe amedo ki winyo lok meno nio wa tin!” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Lacen Abraim okwanyo romi ki twoni, omiyogi bot Abimelek, ci gin jo aryo guketo gicike ikin gi. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abraim oyero bwongi romi abiro, oketogi pat. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimelek owaco ki Abraim ni, “Bwongi romi abiro ma iketo pati kono pingo?” <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abraim ogamo ni, “Bwongi romi magi abiro ma ibigamogi ki i cingani, ibiketogi pi bedo cadena ma nyutu ni, an aye yam akwinyo wang pii man.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Ma omiyo kabedo meno kilwongo ni Beer-ceba, pien onongo gin aryo ducu gukwonge iye ki kwong, <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Kitmeno guketo gicike i Beer-ceba. Ka dong Abimelek ki Pikol ladit lawi monye gua, gudok i lobo pa jo Piliciti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abraim opito yat kituba i Beer-ceba, ci oworo iye Lubanga, Lubanga Mabedo Nakanaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abraim orii calo labedo i lobo pa jo Piliciti pi kare malac.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga ociko Abraim pi tyero Icaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Ibru 11:17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inino mo acel, Lubanga otemo Abraim kun wace ni, “Abraim!” En ogamo ni, “Ana ene.” <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Tek 3:1</ref></char></note> Ci owace ni, “Kwany wodi Icaka, en wodi acel keken, ma imaroni, wot kwede i lobo Moria, wek icit ityere kunu, obed gitum awanga ikom got mo ma abititi ka io kunu.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Kitmeno Abraim opuk odiko con, otongo yen me wango gitum, otweyo te ne iwi kanane, okwanyo lutice aryo, me cito kwedgi, kacel ki wode Icaka; ci gua gukemo yo me cito ikabedo ma Rwot otiteni. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Inino me adeke, Abraim oneno kabedo meno ki kamabor. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ka dong Abraim owaco bot awobe aryo ma tiyo boteni ni, “Wun wubed kong kany kacel ki kana; an ki latini wabicito anyim loka ca ka woro Lubanga, ka dok wabidwogo botwu.” <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ci Abraim otingo yen me lawang gitum, ocibo iwi wode Icaka; en omako mac ki pala i cinge, ka gucako wot kacel. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Icaka owaco bot wone Abraim ni, “Wora!” En ogamo ni, “An a ene, woda.” Ci owace ni, “Nen ba, watye ki mac ki yen, ento romo me gitum kono tye kwene?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abraim odoke iye ni, latina, “Lubanga kikome aye bimiyo romo me gitume.” Kitmeno, gumede gigi kacel ki wotgi.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:21">Yak 2:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ikare ma guo ikabedo ma Lubanga yam otite, ci Abraim oteno keno tyer, ka ocano yen iwiye, otweyo wode Icaka, ci opyele obutu iwi yen ma iwi keno. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ci Abraim ocwalo cinge, okwanyo pala me neko wode. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Ci cutcut Lamalaika pa Rwot olwonge ki i polo, kun wace ni, “Abraim! Abraim!” En ogamo ni, “An a ene.” <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Ci owace ni, “Pe iket cingi ikom latinu, pe itim gin mo ikome bene; dong tin atyeko niang atir ni ilworo Lubanga, pien pe itwona wodi, kadi bed en obedo wodi acel keken, nen imiya.” <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abraim oloke, oilo wange malo, ci oneno nyok romo mo tye ingeye ma tunge omoko i agaba; Abraim ocito okelo nyok romonu, ci otyero me bedo gitum awanga me ka wode. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Abraim ocako nying kabedo meno ni, Rwot aye bimiyo; man odoko labol ma kiwaco nio wa onyo ni, “Iwi got pa Rwot, en aye bimiyo.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Dok lamalaika pa Rwot olwongo Abraim nia ki i polo tyen me aryone kun wace ni, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:13-14">Ibru 6:13-14</ref></char></note>“Tin Dong akwonge ki nyinga kekena ni, pi tim man, ma pe itwona wodi, ma kun en wodi acel keken, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Ibru 11:12</ref></char></note>abimiyi gum adada; abimiyo likwayi ginya mapol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo, marom ki kweyo ma i dog nam. Dok likwayi aye gibibedo luloc i gang pa lumerokgi; <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:25">Tic 3:25</ref></char></note>rok ducu ma i lobo gibilimo gumgi ki ikom likwayi, pien ityeko woro doga.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Lacen Abraim odok cen bot lutice, ka gua ki kunu, gudok kacel kwedgi wa i Beer-ceba; Abraim obedo i Beer-ceba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Nakor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />I nge lok meno ducu, gitero lok bot Abraim ni, “Nen, Milka otyeko nywalo lutino ki omeru Nakor: <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />latin kayone Uj, ki Buj omine, Kemuel won Aram, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Keced, Kajo, Pildac, Jidlap, ki Becweri.” <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Becweri onywalo Labeka. Milka onywalo Lutino aboro ki Nakor omin Abraim. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Dakone ma angeca, ma nyinge Reuma, onywalo bene Teba, Gakam, Takac ki Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Cara oto ci Abraim owilo kabedo me yik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Cara orii mwaka miya acel ki pyere aryo wiye abiro; meno aye wel mwaka me kwo pa Cara. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Cara oto i Kiriat-arba, ma en aye Kebron, ma i lobo Kanaan; Abraim odonyo i ot okumu, okoko Cara ki pig wange. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Lacen Abraim oa woko ki inyim lato, ocito owaco bot jo Kit ni, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:9">Ibru 11:9</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Tic 7:16</ref></char></note>“An adonyi, madong atyeko bedo ikinwu; wumiya dul lobo mo ikinwu ma bibedo kabedo me yiko dano, wek ayik iye dakona wek oa woko ki i wanga.” <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Jo Kit gugamo dog Abraim ni, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Winy, laditwa; in laker madit ikinwa kany, yik kom latoni i lyel maber ma iyero ikin lwak lyel mewani: pe tye ngat mo ma ikinwa ma bitwoni bur lyele, nyo ma bigengi ni pe iyik latoni iye.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Abraim oa malo, ci oryebe inyim jo Kit, ma wegi lobonu, <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />kun waco ki gin ni, “Ka onongo wumito ni ayik latona wek oa woko ki i wanga, wuwiny loka, wulega Epron ma wod pa Jokar, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />wek oye mina boro ma i Makpela, ma mereni, matye iwi agiki potone. Wek ongola wele kikome maromo wilone, omii bota inyimwu, wek odok mera me kabedo me yik.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Ikare meno onongo Epron bene tye, obedo ikin jo Kit, ci Epron Lakit ogamo dog Abraim, ma jo Kit ducu giwinyo, kacel ki lwak ducu ma gibedo i taun meno, <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />kun waco ni, “Pe kumeno ladit, winy loka; amini poto, dok amiyi wa ki boro matye iyeni ki inyim lutuwa ducu; yik iye kom latoni.” <verse eid="GEN 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abraim dok oryebe inyim wegi lobonu, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ka owaco ki Epron, ma wegi lobo ducu giwinyo ni, “Ento ka iye, ci winy loka, Abimiyi wel lawil poto, in ibigamo lim ki i cinga, wek ayik iye kom latona.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Epron owaco bot Abraim ni, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Ladita, winy loka ya; wel dul potonu romo cekel me ryal miya angwen, meno kono gin ango ki tung boti ki an bene? Yik iye kom latoni.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ci Abraim owinyo dog Epron; ci opimo ki Epron wel ryal ma owaco inyim jo Kit, maromo cekel me ryal miya angwen kulu, kun pimo ki kidi mijan ma lucatwil gipimo kwedeni.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Kitmeno poto pa Epron ma i Makpela, mayam tye tung kunyango me Mamre, poto kacel ki boro mayam tye i potonu, ki yadi ducu matye i potonanu, ma gurumu dyere ducu, kimiyogi, kimoko gin ducu <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />me bedo pa Abraim, ki inyim jo Kit ducu, kacel ki inyim lwak ducu ma gubedo i kacoke meno. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Ka lok meno otum, Abraim oyiko dakone Cara i boro matye i poto Makpela tung kunyango me Mamre, ma en aye Kebron, ma i lobo Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Lukit gumoko ni potonu, kacel ki boro matye iye, gubed pa Abraim me kabedo me yik.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kinyomo dako ki Icaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Ikare ma Abraim dong otii, ma mwaka me dite dong dwong, dok onongo Lubanga dong otyeko miyo gum ki Abraim i gin ducu. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Ci Abraim owaco ki latice matye i ode, ma onongo loyo jamine ducu, ma oteggi ikin gi ni, “Rwak cingi odony piny ikin ema. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Amitoni ikwong kwong ki nying Rwot, Lubanga me polo ki lobo ni, pe ibinyomo nyako mo ki woda ma ikin anyira Kanaan, ma abedo i kingini. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Ento ibicito i lobo tuwa, i kakawa; en aye ibinyomo iye dako ki woda Icaka.” <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Latice ogamo ni, “Gwok nyo dako aye pe biye bino kweda wa i lobo man; omyero an aye adok ki wodi i lobo tuwu mayam i a ki iyeni ba?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abraim owace ni, “Nen maber ni, pe icito ki woda me dwoke cen kunu. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Rwot Lubanga me polo mayam okwanyo an ki i paco pa worani, ki i lobo ma ginywala iyeni, mayam oloko kweda kun kwonga kwong, ni; ‘Abimiyo lobo man bot likwayi,’ en bicwalo lamalaikane inyimi, ci ibinyomo dako ki woda nia ki kunu. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ento ka dako aye pe oye bino kwedi, ci kwonga man ma akwongoni pe bimaki; ento pe myero idwok woda cen kunu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Kitmeno latice orwako cinge, odonyo piny ikin em rwode Abraim, ci okwongo kwong ikom lok meno.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Latice okwanyo kinaga pa rwode maromo apar, ka ocako wot, kun otero bene jami mabeco mapatpat; ci oa me wot me cito i Mecopotamia, i taun mayam Nakor obedo iye. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />En omiyo kinaga orumu conggi piny inge gang macok ki wang pii ikin otyeno abwora, ikare ma mon gicito iye ka twomo pii. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Ci olego ni, “Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa rwoda Abraim, mii lok ducu owota maber tin. Alegi inyut mar meri ma pe loke ikom rwoda Abraim. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nen, acung inget wang pii en, kama anyira ma i gang man gubebino bene ka twomo pii. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Nyako mo ma abilege pii amata, ni; ‘Kong icib aguluni piny, wek imiya pii amati,’ ci nyako ma biwaco gire kene ni, ‘Kong imati, ka dong abimiyo kinagani bene gimato,’ wek en aye obed nyako ma iyero pi latici Icaka. Kitmeno bimiyo angeyo ni; in dong inyutu ki rwoda mar meri ma pe lokeni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ma pud peya otyeko loke, ci nen, Labeka, nya pa Becweri, wod pa Milka, dako pa Nakor, ma omin Abraim, otuc iwang pii ki agulu piine ma obolo iwi gwoke. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Nyakone onongo nen mwonya tutwal, nyako ma peya ngeyo laco dok ngat mo peya omako cinge. Ci nyako meno olor, odonyo iwang pii, otwomo pii opongo agulu piine, ka odwogo, okati kwede woko. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Latic meno oringo, ongole inyime, ci owace ni, “Alegi ba, kong imiya pii ma i aguluni amati.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Ci nyakonu ogamo ni, “Kong imat ladita,” en otugi tingo agulu piine i cinge, omiye omato. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ka otyeko, ci owaco gire kene ni, “Abitwomo pii, amiyo ki kinagani bene, nio ka gumato pii oromogi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Oyotoyot oonyo pii i wee, ci oringo odok ka twomo pii iwang it, otwomo pii nio ka oromo kinaga ducu. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Laco meno ociko wange ikome laling, wek eniang ka Rwot otyeko miyo luguma okaye i yo woteni, nyo pe.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ka kinaga gutyeko mato pii, laco meno okwanyo atego um me jabu ma peke romo nucu cekel, ki atego jabu aryo me ngut cing ma pekgi rom ki cekel apar me jabu, omiyo ki nyako meno <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />kun penye ni, “In mono i nya pa nga? Kabutu mo twero nonge pirwa i gang pa woru?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />En ogamo ni, “An anya pa Becweri ma wod pa Milka, ma onywalo ki Nakor.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Dok otite ni, “Watye bene ki reng kal ki cam maromo kinaga, wa kabutu bene nonge.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Laco meno okulu wiye piny, ci oworo Rwot, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />kun waco ni, “Kipak Rwot, Lubanga pa rwoda Abraim, ma pe oweko mar mere ma pe loke, ki adane, ikom rwoda. An bene, Rwot dong otyeko telo wiya, okela wa i ot ma i kaka pa rwoda kikome.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Ci anyakanu oringo otito lok ma otime ducu bot jo matye i ot pa mine. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Labeka onongo tye ki omine ma nyinge Laban. Ci Laban oringo ocito bot laco meno, wa iwang it. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Ka oneno atego um, ki atego i ngut cing lamine, ki pi winyo lok pa lamine Labeka ni, “laconi oloko bota kit man,” ci ocito bot laconu, ci nen, onongo ocung cok ki kinagane inget wang it. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Laban owace ni, “Bin wa i ot, pien Rwot otyeko miyi gum; pingo dok icung ki woko kany? Pien dong atyeko yubu ot wa ki kabutu pa kinaga bene.” <verse eid="GEN 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Laconi obino, odonyo i ot; ka Laban ocako gonyo del woko ki ikom kinaga, omiyo reng kal ki cam bot kinaga, okelo pii lalwok tyene ki tyen jo ma owoto kwede. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Ka kikelo cam kicibo inyime wek ocam; ento en owaco ni, “An peya abicam, nio ka atito kit kwena ma kiora kwede.” Ci ogamo ni, “Tit do.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Ci en otito ni, “An latic pa Abraim. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Rwot otyeko miyo gum madit omako rwoda, dong odoko dano madit, omiyo en olimo lim makwo, dyegi ki dyangi, ryal ki jabu, lwak opii ki lwak angeca, kinaga mapol, ki lwak kana. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Ikare ma rwoda dong oteggi, ci Cara dakone onywalo latin laco, en aye kimiye oleyo lim ducu ma en tye kwede. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Rwoda omiya akwongo kwong, kun owaca ni, ‘Pe ibinyomo nyako mo ki woda ki ikin anyira Kanaan, i lobo ma abedo iyeni. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Ento ibicito i ot pa wora, ki ikin lutuwa, en aye icit inyom iye dako ki woda.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Ci agamo dog ladita ni, ‘Gwok nyo dako pe biye bino kweda kono.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Ento en odoka iye ni, ‘Rwot ma abedo kalubu cikeni bicwalo lamalaikane nywako kwedi yo, ci luguma bikayi i yo woti; in ibinyomo dako ki woda nia i ot pa wora kikome. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ci kwonga dong pe bimaki, ka dong icito bot lutuwa; kace gin aye pe gumiyi nyako, ci kwonga dong pe bimaki.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />Tin ka ao iwang pii, ci alego ni, ‘Ai Rwot, Lubanga pa rwoda Abraim, ka tin ibimiyo luguma kaya i wota man ma awoto iyeni, <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />ci nen, acung inget wang pii en; nyako mo ma bibino ka twomo pii, an abiwace ni, alegi ba, miya pii mo ki aguluni amati.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Nyako ma bigamo ni, ‘Kong imati, dok abitwomo mukene pi kinagani bene,’ en aye obed dako ma Rwot oyero me bedo dako pa wod pa ladita.<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Ikare ma pud peya atyeko loko lok matye icwinya, ci nen, Labeka otuc, mubolo agulu piine iwi gwoke, ci olor odonyo iwang pii, ka otwomo pii. Ci alege ni ‘Miya pii amat ba!’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />En otugi tingo agulu piine ki iwi gwoke kun waco ni, ‘Kong imati, ci abimiyo kinagani bene gimato.’ Ci an amato, ka en omiyo kinagana bene gumato. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Dok apenye ni, ‘In kono i nya pa anga ka?’ En ogamo ni, ‘An anya pa Becweri ma wod pa Nakor, ma Milka aye onywalo.’ Kitmeno an acako keto agit i ume, ki atego jabu i ngut cinge ryoryo. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Ka akulu wiya piny, aworo Rwot ci apwoyo Rwot, Lubanga pa rwoda Abraim, ma otela i yo maber, omiya anongo nya pa omin ladita me atera bot wode. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Kombedi ka wubitic ki rwoda ki mar ki ada, wutita; ka pe bene wutita; wek aloke adok yo tung cing acuc nyo tung kumalo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Laban ki Becweri gugamo ni, “Lok man oa ki bot Rwot; pe watwero dok iye marac nyo maber. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Nen, en Labeka tye inyimi eno; in ikwany en, wuwot kwede, wek en ocit obed ciwod pa laditi, macalo Rwot dong otyeko wacone.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Ka latic pa Abraim owinyo lok meno, ci ocako ryebe piny i ngom inyim Rwot. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ci latic okwanyo lwak atego ryal ki atego jabu, ki lwak ginaruka, otingo omiyogi bot Labeka; ka dok omiyo ki omine ki bot mine jami me wel. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />En ki jo ma gitye kwede gucako camo cam ki mat, ci gubutu nino acel kunu. Ka gua malo odiko, ci olego ni, “Dong wucwala adok bot ladita.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Laban ki mine gugamo ni, “Wek kong anyaka obed kwedwa kare manok, maromo nino apar; lacen en dong bicito gire.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Ci latic pa Abraim ogamo kun waco botgi ni, “Pe wugal wiya; pien Rwot dong omiyo luguma okaya i wot man, wuwek dong acak wot, adok bot ladita.” <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ci gin gugamo ni, “Kong walwong nyako, wapenye.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Ka kilwongo Labeka, gipenyo kun giwace ni “Ibiye wot ki laco man?” En ogamo ni “Abiwot.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Kitmeno gucako cwalo nyargi Labeka ki dako ma konye, kacel ki latic pa Abraim ki jone. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Gulego gum ikom Labeka, kun giwace ni, “Laminwa, bed megi jo alip ki alip ma pe twero kwane; ki likwayi gulo gang pa lumerokgi!” <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Lacen Labeka ki lwak angecane gua, gucako wot, guito wi kinaga kun gilubu kor laco meno; kitmeno latic meno ocako wot ki Labeka, kun gidok i yo tugi.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Icaka onongo obino oa ki Beerlakai-roi; ikare meno onongo en bedo i Negeb. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Icaka ocito woko i bar kalwodo lok iwi otyeno; ci oilo wange malo, oneno kinaga ka tye kabino. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Ikare ma Labeka oneno Icaka, ci olor woko ki iwi kinaga, opye piny. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Ka openyo latic pa Abraim ni, “Meno laco mene ma loka ca, ma woto i bar kun bino ka romo kwedwani?” Latic ogamo ni. “En aye laditani.” Labeka okwanyo bongo oume kwede. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Ci latic otito bot Icaka lok ducu ma otime. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Icaka okelo Labeka i kema ma mine Cara onongo bedo iye, ci obedo kwede, odoko dakone, kun mare bene. Kitmeno cwiny Icaka ocako kwe ki inge to pa mine.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Abraim ma Ketura onywalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Tek 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abraim dok onyomo dako mukene, ma nyinge Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />En onywale Jimran, Yokocan, Medan, Midian, Icibak ki Cua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokocan onywalo Ceba ki Dedan; lutino awobe pa Dedan gin ene: Acurim, Letucim ki Leumim. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Lutino awobe pa Midian gin aye Epa, Eper, Kanok, Abida ki Eldaa. Gin ducu likwayo pa Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abraim omiyo jamine ducu bot Icaka. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ento lutino awobe pa mone ma angeca Abraim opoko botgi mot bene, ikare ma pud en kwo; ci ocwalogi woko cen nia ki ka nget wode Icaka. Gudok tung kunyango i lobo mudok tung kunyango.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abraim oto ci kiyike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Man aye wel nino me kwo pa Abraim; oromo mwaka miya acel ki pyere abiro wiye abic. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abraim oomo cwinye me agikine, ci oto woko, ma mwakane dong dit, dano muteggi, madong otii, ci kiyike ikin lutugi. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Awobene Icaka ki Icmael guyiko kome i boro lyel ma i Makpela, ma i poto pa Epron wod pa Jokar, ma Lakit, tung kunyango me Mamre, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Aca 23:3-16</ref></char></note>i poto mayam Abraim owilo ki bot jo Kit. Kiyiko Abraim kenyo, kacel ki dakone Cara. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Lubanga omiyo gum ki Icaka ki inge to pa wone Abraim, ci Icaka ocako bedo i Beer-lakai-roi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Icmael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Man aye likwayo pa Icmael wod pa Abraim, ma Agar angeca pa Cara, anyira Ejipt, onywalo ki Abraim. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Man nying lutino awobe pa Icmael, kun lubu kit ma kinywalogi kwede: Nebaiot, en latin kayo pa Icmael; ki Kooar, Adbeel, Mibcam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Micima, Duma, Maca, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Adad, Tema, Jetur, Napic ki Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Man aye awobe pa Icmael, nyinggi ene, kun lubu gangigi, ki kabedogi; gin luker apar wiye aryo macalo rokgi tye. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Icmael yam orii wi lobo mwaka miya acel ki pyere adek wiye abiro; ci oomo cwinye me agikine, oto woko, odok bot lutugi. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Kabedogi yam ocake nia ki Kavila nio wa i Cur mukemo tung Ejipt ma dok tung Aciria; en obedo ikabedone pat kun pyem ki utmegine ducu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nywalo Ecau ki Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Man aye likwayo pa Icaka, wod pa Abraim: Abraim onywalo Icaka, <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Icaka onyomo dakone Labeka kun onongo tye ki mwaka pyere angwen; Labeka yam nya pa Becweri ma jo Aram, ma i lobo Paddan-aram, lamin Laban ma jo Aram. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Icaka ocako lego Lubanga pi dakone, pien onongo lalur; ci Rwot ocwako kor legane, ka dakone Labeka ogamo ic. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Ikare ma lutino gubedo ka twome ki i iye, en owaco ni, “Kace gitime kitmeno, man nyutu gin ango?” Ci ocito ka penyo dog Rwot. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:12">Rom 9:12</ref></char></note>Ka Rwot otite ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Rok aryo aye gitye i ii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Rok aryo meno ma ibinywaloni gibipoke woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Acel bibedo oteka makato lawote;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Latin kayo bibedo latic pa latin matidi.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ka kare me gonyene oromo, ci en onywalo lutino rudi. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Onywalo latin kayo ma kome kwar, kome ducu obedo ki yer calo bongo yer; omiyo kicako nyinge ni Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Lacen dok kinywalo omine, kun cinge omako opuny tyen Ecau, omiyo kicako nyinge ni Yakobo. Ikare ma kinywalo lutinonu onongo Icaka dite dong romo mwaka pyere abicel.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecau ocato dit me anywaline woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Ma awobe meno gudongo, ci Ecau obedo oken makwiri, ladwar i tim, Yakobo obedo lamwolo, kun bedo mere i kema mot. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Icaka yam maro mere Ecau, pien onongo bedo kacamo cinge; ento Labeka dok onongo maro mere Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Ikare ma Yakobo tye katedo dek ngor, ci Ecau oa ki i tim, odwogo ma kec obwoye woko. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ci Ecau olego Yakobo ni, “Miya dek ngor ma oboki wek acam, kec obwoya woko.” Pi lok meno omiyo kilwongo nyinge Ecau ni Edom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="fk">Edom </char> te loke ma obok makwar.</note>. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo owace ni, “Kong icata dit me anywalini.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Ci Ecau ogamo ni, “An acok to woko; dit me anywalini kono konye tye kwene?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Ibru 12:16</ref></char></note>Yakobo ogamo ni; “Kong icak ki kwonga kwong.” Ma omiyo en okwonge kwong, ci ocato dit me anywaline woko bot Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Ka Yakobo ocako miye kwon ki dek ngor, ka ocamo, omato pii i wiye, ci oa malo, ocako wot ocito woko. Ecau ocayo dit me anywaline kitmeno.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Icaka i Gerar ki i Beer-ceba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Kec dok opoto i lobo aye, ma pat ki kec mayam kong opoto ikare pa Abraim ca. Ka Icaka ocito i Gerar, bot Abimelek rwot Piliciti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ci Rwot onen bote kun wace ni, “Pe icit i lobo Ejipt; ber ibed i lobo ma abititi. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:3:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16-18">Aca 22:16-18</ref></char></note>Kong ibed i lobo man calo adonyi, an bene abibedo kwedi, abimiyi gum; pien lobo man ducu abimiyo boti ki bot likwayi, dok abicobo kwong mayam akwongo bot woru Abraim. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Abimiyo likwayi nya mapol macalo lwak lakalatwe me polo, abimiyo ki likwayi lobo man ducu; dok rok ducu ma iwi lobo gibilimo gumgi ki ikomgi. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Pien yam Abraim oworo doga, kun cobo cika ki gin ma aciko ducu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Ci Icaka obedo i Gerar. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:13">Aca 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 20:2">20:2</ref></char></note> Ma jo kunu gupenye lok kom dakone, en ogamo ni, “En lamera,” pien olworo waco ni, “Dakona,” kun tamo ni, “Wek wegi lobo pe guneka woko pi Labeka,” pien en onongo mwonya mada. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Ikare madong odike kunu, ci Abimelek rwot pa jo Piliciti oneno Icaka ki iwang dirica ka obedo katuku ki dakone Labeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimelek olwongo Icaka ci owace ni, “Nen, man dakoni; pingo in kono nene iwaco ni, ‘En lamera’?” Icaka odoke iye ni, “Pien onongo atamo ni, nyo koni kitwero neka woko pire.” <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimelek ogamo ni, “Itimowa kuman pingo? Ka nene dano mo obutu ki dakoni, kono ikelo bal ikomwa nonono.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Abimelek ocako juku lwake ducu, kun waco ni, “Ka dano mo otero laco man nyo dakone marac, ci kibineke woko.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Ci Icaka ocoyo kodi i poto i lobo meno; ci okayo cam ma dodo tyen miya i mwakanu. Rwot aye omiye gum, <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />omiyo danoni odoko lalonyo, obedo ka mede ki limo jami, nio ka odoko twon lalonyo. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Olimo lim madwong makwo, dyangi ki dyegi, ci gange opong ki lwak dano, omiyo nyeko omako jo Piliciti ikome.<verse eid="GEN 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Piman jo Piliciti gujuku wang it mayam con lutic gukwinyo ma wone Abraim pud kwo. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Ci Abimelek owaco ki Icaka ni, “A woko ki botwa, pien in dong idoko tek ikatowa woko.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Ci Icaka oa woko ki botgi, ocito, otiro i nota me Gerar, kama ogony ci obedo iye. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Icaka dok ogolo wang pii mayam kikwinyo ikare pa wone Abraim; pien yam kong jo Piliciti gujukugi woko ikare madong wone Abraim oto wokoni; ci dok olwongo nyinggi kit mayam wone, olwongogi kwede. <verse eid="GEN 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Ento ma lutic pa Icaka gutyeko kwinyo wang it i notanu, ci gunongo iye wang it malongo. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Lukwat pa jo Gerar gucako da ki lukwat pa Icaka, kun giwaco ni, “Pii man mewa.” Ma omiyo en ocako nying wang pii meno ni Ecek,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="fk">Ecek </char> te loke daa nyo pyem.</note> ni pien gubedo ka daa kwede. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ka dong okwinyo wang it mukene, dok gucako daa pi eno bene; ma omiyo olwongo ni Citna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="fk">Citna </char> te loke mone.</note> <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Icaka dok oa woko ki kunu, okwinyo wang it mukene dok aye. Pe dong daa obedo tye pimeno; ma omiyo olwongo nyinge ni Rekobot,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="fk">Rekobot </char> te loke ni kabedo malac.</note> kun waco ni, “Pien tin dong Rwot oyabo ki wan kabedo malac, dong wabinya i loboni.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Lacen Icaka oa woko ki kunu odak i Beer-ceba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Rwot dok onen bote idyewor meno, kun wace ni, “An Lubanga pa woru Abraim; pe ilwor, pien atye kwedi, abimiyi gum, dok abimiyo likwayi nya mapol pi gicikena bot latica Abraim.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Ci Icaka ocano keno tyer pi Rwot kunu, ci oworo iye Lubanga; ci oguro kemane kunu. Lutic pa Icaka dok gukwinyo wang it kunu.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike ikin Icaka ki Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:26:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 21:22">Aca 21:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Abimelek ocito bote, oa ki i Gerar, kacel ki Akujat lamii tam, ki Pikol ladit lawimony mere. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Ci Icaka owaco botgi ni, “Wun wubino bota pi lok ango, ma wun wudaga, dok yam dong wuryema woko ki i lobowu?” <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Gin gugamo ni, “Wan waneno atir ni Lubanga tye kwedi, ma omiyo wawaco ni, wek kwong obed ikin in ki wan, wek waket gicike ki in, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />wek pe ibitimwa marac, kit macalo wan bene yam pe wagud komi, pe bene watimo gin mo marac ikomi, ento tim mabere keken, dok bene waryemi woko ia ki ikinwa ki kuc. Kombedi in aye ngat ma Rwot omiyo gum ikome.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Ci otedigi karama, ka gucamo, gumato. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Gua malo odiko con, ci gukwongo kwong ngat man ki lawote; ka dong Icaka olwokogi i yo tugi, gua, gupoke kwede ki kuc. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Inino meno bene kikome en aye lutic pa Icaka gubino bote, gutite lok kom wang it ma gityeko kwinyone, kun giwace ni, “Watyeko nongo pii.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />En ocako nyinge ni Ciba, ma omiyo nying gang meno kilwongo ni Beer-ceba nio wa onyo.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Ka Ecau dong dite romo mwaka pyere angwen, ci onyomo mone, Judit nya pa Beeri, jo Kit, ki Bacemat nya pa Elon, jo Kit bene. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Mon magi gumiyo cwercwiny madwong bot Icaka ki Labeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Icaka olamo gum ki Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Ka Icaka dong otii, ki wange bene dong ocido woko madong pe neno piny, ci olwongo latin kayone Ecau, owace ni, “Latina.” En ogamo ni, “Ana ene.” <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Ci Icaka owace ni, “Nen, an dong atii woko, pe angeyo nino ma abito iye. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Dong ikwany jami dwari, jurani ki atummi, wek icit idwara lee, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />wek icela ringo makur, kit ma amaroni, ci ikela, wek dong acam cingi, ka dong alami gum ma peya ato.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Ikare ma Icaka tye kalok ki wode Ecau, onongo Labeka bene winyo. Ci Ecau okato ocito i tim ka dwaro lee, wek ekel ringone. <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Ci Labeka owaco ki wode Yakobo ni, “Abedo kawinyo woru ka loko ki omeru ni, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Cit ikela ringo lee, wek icela makur, wek dong acam cingi, ka dong alami gum inyim Rwot ma peya ato.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Ma omiyo latina, winy doga malube ki lok ma abicikini. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />A icit ikin dyegi, icit ikela lutino dyegi aryo ma komgi bulubulu. Wek an ayub ringone makur ki woru, kit ma en maroni, <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />wek iter ki woru ocam cingi, wek olami gum ma peya oto.” <verse eid="GEN 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Ento Yakobo ogamo dog mine kun wace ni “Nen ba, omera Ecau kome ki yer, ento an koma pwot. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Gwok nyo ka wora bibonga, ci abinen macalo acito ka nyware, miyo bicena, pe bilama gum.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Ento mine ogamo doge kun waco ni, “Wek ceni opot ikoma, latina; winy doga keken, kat icit, icikelgi bota.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Ci en ocito, okelogi bot mine, ci mine ocelo ringo makur, kit ma wone maroni. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Ka Labeka okwanyo ginaruka pa wode Ecau, ma en yam ruku mabereni, ma nongo tye i ot bot mine, ci oruku ki Yakobo wode matidini. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Ka oboyo laa lutino dyeginu ki bade ducu, ki ngute bene kama yer pe iye; <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />ka otingo ringo ma ocelo makuri, ki kwon ma omyeno, omiyo i cing wode Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Ci Yakobo odonyo kwede bot wone, kun wace ni, “Aba,” en oye ni, “An atye en do latina; in anga ce?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo ogamo dog wone ni, “An Ecau, latin kayoni. Atyeko timo kit ma nakanen ititani; dong i cukke, ia malo wek icam cinga, ka dong ilama gum.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Icaka owaco ki wode ni, “In inongo ringo oyotoyot marom man ningning, latina?” En ogamo ni, “Pien Rwot Lubangani omiyo gum okaya oyot.” <verse eid="GEN 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Dok Icaka owaco bot Yakobo ni, “Kong inyik cok bota kany, wek abong komi latina, wek ange ka in latina Ecau kikome ada nyo pe.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Ci Yakobo onyiko cok bot wone Icaka; obongo kome, ci owaco ni, “Dwoni dwon Yakobo, ento badi en aye bad Ecau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ci dong pe omedo kingene, pien onongo bade ki yer macalo bad omine Ecau. Ka dong oye lame gum, ci openye ni, <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />“In ada latina Ecau kikome?” En odok iye ni, “An kikoma.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Ci Icaka owace ni, “Kel cam bota cok, wek dong acam cing latina, ka dong alami gum.” Ci oketo cam inyime, ka ocamo; dok okele kongo bwino, omato bene. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Ka dong wone Icaka owace ni, “Bin cok, wek inot lema, latina.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:27:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibru 11:20</ref></char></note>Ci Yakobo onyiko cok bote, ka onoto leme; ci wone ongweyo ngwec ginarukane, ka omiye gum, kun wace ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Nen, ngwec kom woda kur</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">macalo poto ma Rwot omiyo gum ikome!<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Lubanga omii ki in toyo ma luk ma a ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:28">ki lobo ma ceko cam mapek.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:29:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aca 12:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wek lwak jo mapol gubed lutici,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">ki rok mapol bene guryebe piny inyimi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Wek in aye ibed ladit maloyo omegini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">wek lutino awobe pa meni ducu bene guryebe piny inyimi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Cen obed ikom dano ducu ma biceni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">dok gum obed ikom jo ducu ma bilami gum!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ecau okok pi gum pa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Cutcut madong Icaka otyeko lamo gum ki Yakobo ma en pud okato akata woko nia ki inyim wone Icaka, ci omine Ecau bene otugi dwogo ki ka dware. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />En bene ocelo ringo makur, okelo bot wone. Owaco ki wone ni, “Wore, dong icuke, ia malo, wek icam cing latini, ka wek dong ilama gum.” <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Wone Icaka owace ni, “In anga doki?” En ogamo ni, “An a wodi do, latin kayoni, Ecau do.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Kom Icaka ocako myel matek licukcuk, kun waco ni, “anga ma nakanen kong odwaro lee, okelani, madong atyeko camone woko ducu, ma onongo peya idwogoni, dok atyeko lame gum woko do, gum dong bibedo gire ikome.” <verse eid="GEN 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Ikare ma Ecau owinyo lok pa wone, ci otoke ki twon koko madit magwar bene, kun waco bot wone ni, “Lama gum bene do, aya aba na!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Icaka dok owace ni, “Omeru obino, obwola, ci dong otyeko buyu gumi woko.” <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:36:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Aca 25:29-34</ref></char></note>Ecau owace ni, “Pe dong ineno, nyinge gire kicako kakare ni Yakobo? Pien nen, en dong obuya kun laro jamina kiryo kulu. Okwongo buyu dit anywalina, dok nen, tin bene dok otyeko buyu guma woko.” Dok omede ki waco lok ni, “In dong pe igwoko gum mo pira ce?” <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Ci Icaka ogamo dog Ecau ni, “Nen, dong atyeko keto en me bedo rwodi otum, ki omege ducu atyeko miyogi me bedo lutice; amiye wa kal ki kongo bwino ducu kubed me pito en. Gin ango ma dok abimini do, latina?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:38:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Ibru 12:17</ref></char></note>Ecau dok owaco bot wone ni, “Onongo itye ki gum acel keken bo, wora? Lama gum, lama gum mo bene do, ai abana.” Ecau oilo wiye malo kakoko. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Ibru 11:20</ref></char></note>Ci Wone Icaka ocako gamo loke ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Nen, i bibedo bor ki lobo ma ceko cam mapek iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">dok i bibedo bor ki toyo ma luk ma a ki malo ipolo.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:40:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 36:8">Aca 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2 Luk 8:20</ref></char>
    </note>Ibikwo meri ki lak pala lucwani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">i bibedo latic pa omeru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">ento ikare ma ibijemo ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">ci i bituru rii okol ma oriyo ingutini woko.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Ecau ocako kwero omine pi gum ma wone olamo ikomeni. Ecau opiro lok i cwinye ni, “Kare me to pa wora dong onyiko cok; en aye abineko iye omera Yakobo bene.” <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Ento ka gitito ki Labeka lok pa latin kayone Ecau, en ocwalo dano, olwongo Yakobo wode matidine, kun wace ni, “Nen, omeru Ecau obedo ma cuko cwinye kun oyube me neki. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Ma omiyo in iwor doga, latina; a malo, ilwii, iring woko bot omera Laban i Karan. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Kong icibed kunu, nio wang ma kiniga pa omeru opye; <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />wek wiye kong owil i gin mayam itimo ikomeni; ka dong abicwalo dano kaomi ki kunu. Bibedi ningning ka arwenyo wun aryo ducu woko lawangacel?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Icaka ocwalo Yakobo i Karan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Ci Labeka dok owaco ki Icaka ni, “An dong iya odak woko ki ikom mon kit pa Ecau ni pi yo kwogi. Ka dok Yakobo bene binyomo anyira Kit marom ki mon ma gitye i loboni, ci dong kwo na bikonyo ango?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Ka Icaka olwongo Yakobo, ci olame gum, ka ocike ni, “In dong pe inyom dako mo ki ikin anyira me Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Ber ia, icit Paddan-aram i ot pa kwaru Becweri ma won meni; en aye inyom iye nya pa Laban ma omin meni kikome. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Lubanga Matwero ducu omini gum, owek inya mapol, wek ibed lwak rok mapol. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Aca 17:4-8</ref></char></note>Dok omii gum pa Abraim opot ikomi, ki ikom likwayi, wek icam lobo ma ibedo iyeni macalo welo, mayam Lubanga omiyo ki Abraim!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Kitmeno Icaka ocwalo Yakobo, ocito i Paddan-aram bot Laban, wod pa Becweri me Aram, ma omin Labeka ma min Yakobo ki Ecau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecau dok onyomo dako mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Ecau oneno ni Icaka dong otyeko lamo gum ikom Yakobo, ka dok ocwale wa i Paddan-aram wek onyom dako ki kunu, dok ikare ma olame gum ocike ni, “In pe inyom nyako mo ki ikin Lukanaan,” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />dok Yakobo bene oworo dog wone ki mine, ci ocito i Paddan-aram. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Ci ma Ecau oneno ni kit pa anyira Kanaan pe yomo cwiny wone Icaka, <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />ci ocito bot jo Icmael, onyomo iye dako, omedo ikom mere ma con ca. Onyomo Makalat ma nya pa Icmael wod pa Abraim, ma lamin Nebaiot.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lek obino iwi Yakobo i Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo oa ki, Beer-ceba, ci odok tung Karan. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Ka oo ikabedo mo, obutu kenyo idyewor meno, pien onongo ceng dong opoto woko. Ka otingo got acel mo ki ikin wadi, opyelo piny, oteno ki wiye, ci onino woko ikabedo meno. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:51">Jon 1:51</ref></char></note>Lek obino iwiye, kun neno rwom ma kijengo tere ocung piny i ngom, ento wiye kijengo oo wa i polo; kun neno lumalaika pa Lubanga kun gilor piny, ka dok giito gidok malo. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-15">Aca 13:14-15</ref></char></note>Ci oneno Rwot ocung tung ka wiye malo, kun wace ni, “An a Rwot, Lubanga pa kwaru Abraim, ki Lubanga pa Icaka; abimiyi lobo ma ibutu iyeni, abimiyo boti ki bot likwayi; <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aca 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref></char></note>dok likwayi gibibedo marom ki apwa me lobo, dok wubimede wuromo tung kupotoceng ki tung kunyango, ki tung kumalo ki tung kupiny bene; dok ikom in ki ikom likwayi en aye kaka ducu ma wi lobo bilimo iye gumgi. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Nen, an atye kwedi, abigwoki kama ibiwoto iye ducu, dok abidwoki cen wa i lobo man; pe abiweki ata nio wang ma acobo gin ma atyeko lokone botini.” <verse eid="GEN 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Ka Yakobo oco woko ki iwang nino, ci owaco ni, “Rwot tye ikabedoni ada; onongo an kara pe angeyo.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Ci lworo ocako make, kun waconi, “Kabedo man kara kabedo me awora kuman! Man ot pa Lubanga kikome, man aye dogcel me polo kikome.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobo oa malo odiko con, otingo got ma oteno ki wiyeni, ci ocibo wek obed wir, ka oonyo moo iwiye. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Ocako nying kabedo meno ni Betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="fk">Betel </char> te loke Ot pa Lubanga.</note>; ento nia wa con onongo nying kabedo meno gilwongo ni Luj. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Ci Yakobo okwongo kwong kun waco ni, “Ka Lubanga bibedo kweda, kun gwoka i yo man ma awoto iyeni, ka dok bimiya kwon me acama, ki bongi me aruka, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />kace abidwogo wa i ot pa wora ki kuc, ci Rwot dong bibedo Lubangana. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Dok kabedo man bene, ma acibo iye gotti, bidoko Ot pa Lubanga: ki gin ducu ma ibimiina, an bene abimini dul acel me apare.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo i ot pa Laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Yakobo dok omede ki wote, ci oo i lobo pa jo ma tung kunyango. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Ci nen, wange ocob iwang pii matye i dye olet, ki lwak romi ma gubutu piny i dul adek ma gicok inget wang pii; pien romi gimato pii iwang it meno, matye ki got madit idoge. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Ka romi ducu dong gugure, gucoke kunu, ci lukwat gitore, gingilo got woko cen ki i dog wang pii, ka gimiyo romi gimato, ka dok gingilo got, gidwoko cen, kiumu ki dog wang pii kakare.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Ci Yakobo openyogi ni, “Utmegina, wun wua ki kwene?” Gugamo ni, “Wan waa ki i Karan.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />En openyogi ni, “Wun mono wungeyo Laban wod pa Nakor?” Gugamo ni, “Wangeyo en.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ci dok openyogi dok ni, “En tye maber mono?” Gugamo ni, “En tye maber gire. Nen, nyare Lakeri tye kabino ki romigi ca!” <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo owacigi ni, “Nen, tipu peya oloke do, man peya kare me guru lee kacel; pingo pe wumii pii ki romi, wek dok wudwogi cen kacam i olet?” <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Ento gin gutite ni, “Wan pe watwero miyogi, wang ma lee ducu gucoke, gugure kacel, ka dong wangilo got woko cen ki iwang pii, ka dong wamiyo ki romi pii.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Ka onongo en pud tye kalok kwedgi, ci Lakeri ocoro ki romi pa wone, ma onongo kwayogi. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Ka Yakobo oneno Lakeri nya pa Laban, nya pa omin mine, ki romi pa nerone Laban, Yakobo okato ci ongilo got woko cen ki iwang pii, ka ocako miyo romi pa nerone Laban gumato pii. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Ci Yakobo onoto lem Lakeri, kun kok matek. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yakobo otito ki Lakeri ni, en ebedo wat pa wone kikome, dok en e wod pa Labeka; ci Lakeri oringo, ocito otito ki wone.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Ikare ma Laban owinyo lok kom Yakobo wod pa lamine, ci oringo ocito kangolo wiye; okwako kore, onoto leme bene, ka ocako tere wa i ode. Yakobo otito lok magi ducu kore kikore bot Laban, <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />ka Laban owace ni, “In ada i cogona dok i ringo koma bene!” Ci obedo kwede dwe acel.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo otiyo pi nyomo Lakeri ki Lea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Laban ocako waco bot Yakobo ni, “Pien in i wata, dong ibitina tic nono bo? Ber itita, i mito aculi ki gin ango?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laban onongo tye ki anyirane aryo; nying nyare madite Lea, ki nying matidine Lakeri. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea onongo wange kingicngic, ento Lakeri nen mwonya mulinge. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo onongo maro Lakeri: ci owaco ni, “Abitini tic mwaka abiro pi Lakeri, nyari matidini.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Laban ogamo ni, “Bedo ber mada ka amiyo en boti, makato ka amiye bot dano mukene; bed bota.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Yakobo otiyo pi Lakeri mwaka abiro; kare meno obedo macalo nino manok mo keken ki bot Yakobo, pien onongo iye omaro Lakeri mada.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Yakobo openyo Laban ni, “Dong imiya dakona wek abed kwede, pien kare dong oromo.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Ci Laban otedo karama ci olwongo iye dano ducu ma gitye ikabedo meno. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Ci okelo nyare Lea bot Yakobo otyeno, ci obutu kwede. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Laban omiyo angecane Jilpa bot nyare Lea wek okonye. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Odiko con ma piny oru, aye Yakobo oniang ni kara kimiye Lea aye. Yakobo owaco ki Laban ni, “Itima kuman pingo? Onongo pe abedo katic boti pi Lakeri? Ibwola kuman pingo?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Ento Laban ogamo ni, “Pe gitimo kitmeno i lobo tuwa kany, pe kimiyo nyako matidi aye kwongo ger ki madite. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Kong i kur wangma ityeko kwero cabit me nyom piman, ci dok wabimiyi giri Lakeri bene, ka ibitina tic pi mwaka abiro mukene.” <verse eid="GEN 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Ci Yakobo otimo kitmeno; ocobo cabit pa Lea, ka Laban omiye nyare Lakeri me bedo dakone. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Laban dok omiyo angecane Bila bot nyare Lakeri wek okonye. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Yakobo ocako bedo ki Lakeri bene; cwinye omaro Lakeri makato Lea, dok omede otiyo tic bot Laban mwaka abiro mukene.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutino ma kinywalo ki Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Ma Rwot oneno ni gidag Lea, ci omiye nyodo; ento Lakeri ocung ma pe nywal. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, ci ocako nyinge Reuben, kun waco ni, “Pien Rwot oneno aromana; koni olo dong cwara bimara.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Dok ogamo ic, ci onywalo latin laco, owaco ni, “Pien Rwot owinyo ni kidaga, omiyo dok omiya latin man bene,” ci ocako nyinge ni Cimeon. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Lacen dok ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, owaco ni, “Cwara dong bidwogo ikoma, pien dong anywale awobe adek kulu,” ma omiyo kicako nying latin nu Levi. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Dok ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, owaco ni, “Man aye kare ma abipako iye Rwot,” ma omiyo ocako nying latin Juda; ci kong ocung woko.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Ikare ma Lakeri oneno ni peya enywalo latin mo ki Yakobo, ci nyeko omake ikom lamine. Oweko owaco bot Yakobo ni, “Miya lutino; ka pe, ci ato woko.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Ci kiniga omako Yakobo ikom Lakeri, kun wace ni, “Iketa adoko Lubanga bo, ma en ogengi nywali?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Ci Lakeri ogamo ni, “Angecana Bila en do, dong icit ibut kwede, wek onywal latin mo me kakara, wek an bene anong lutino mogo ki tung bote.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Ci omiyo angecane obedo dakone, Yakobo obutu kwede. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Ci Bila ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco ki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Lakeri owaco ni, “Lubanga otyeko ngola kop, owinyo ki dwona bene, ci omiya gira latin laco,” omiyo ocako nyinge Dan. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Bila angeca pa Lakeri dok ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco ki Yakobo me aryone. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Ci Lakeri dok owaco ni, “Ka me lweny dong alwenyo matek wan ki lamera, ci aloye,” ma omiyo ocako nying latin Naputali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Ka Lea bene oneno ni dong ecung woko, ma pe enywalo lutino, ci okwanyo angecane Jilpa, omiyo ki Yakobo wek obed dakone. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Ci Angeca pa Lea bene onywalo latin laco ki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea owaco ni, “Gum maber okaya!” Ma omiyo ocako nyinge Gad. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Jilpa angeca pa Lea dok onywalo latin laco ki Yakobo me aryone, <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Omiyo Lea owaco ni, “An koma gum! Pien mon gibilwonga ni lagumkom”; ma omiyo en ocako nying latin ni Acer.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Ikare me kayo ngano, Reuben ocito i poto, ci onongo iye yat nyodo, ci okelogi wa bot mine Lea. Ci Lakeri olego Lea ni, “Alegi, imiya yat nyodo pa wodi mogo do.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ento Lea ogamo ni, “In imayo cwara woko ki bota, itamo ni loke tidi ce? Man dok i mito ni ikwany yat nyodo pa woda woko bene?” Lakeri ogamo ni, “En tin obut kwedi dyewor me ka yat nyodo pa wodini.” <verse eid="GEN 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Ikare ma Yakobo odwogo nia ki i tim otyeno, Lea okato ocito kangolo wiye i yo, ci owace ni, “Myero tin idony i oda; pien atyeko wilo in woko ki yat nyodo pa woda.” Ci ocito obutu ki Lea idyewor meno. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Lubanga owinyo lega pa Lea, ci ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco me abice ki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Ci Lea owaco ni, “Lubanga dong oculu wang miyo angecana bot cwara,” ma omiyo ocako nyinge Icakar. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea dok ogamo ic ci onywalo latin me abicele ki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Omiyo Lea dok owaco ni, “Lubanga dong omiya mot mabeco mupore; cwara dong biwora, pien dong atyeko nywale lutino co abicel kulu,” ma omiyo ocako nyinge Jabulon. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Lacen dok onywalo nyare, ci ocako nyinge Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Lubanga dong ocako po ikom Lakeri, dok owinyo legane bene, ka omiye nyodo. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Ci ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, kun waco ni, “Lubanga otyeko kwanyo lewic woko ki ikoma,” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />ci ocako nyinge Yucepu, kun waco ni, “Myero Rwot dok omeda latin laco mo acel!”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok ma Yakobo oyubu ki Laban kom mucarane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Ikare ma Lakeri otyeko nywalo Yucepu, ci Yakobo owaco bot Laban ni, “Dong icwala wek adok paco i lobo tuwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Miya monna ki lutinona mayam atiyo pirgi botini, wek dong aciti; in bene ingeyo tic ma atiyo boti do.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Laban ogamo ni, “Ka iye, ci wek awaci lok mo kong; atyeto tyet ci aniang ni Rwot omiya gum pi in. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Ber itita wel ma i mito amini me mucarani, ci abimini.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Ci Yakobo owace ni, “In ki komi ingeyo kit ma atiyo ki tici, ki kit ma agwoko kwede limi makwo. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Pien yam ma peya abino onongo limi makwo nok mo, nen dong gumede madwong mukato; Rwot obedo ka mini gum kama adok iye ducu. Ento an dong abicako gwoko jo oda awene?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Ci Laban openye ni, “Gin ango ma abimini?” Yakobo ogamo ni, “Pe amito kit cul mo wa ki acel. Ka ibiye, tima gin macalo man, ci an abimede ka kwayo limi, ki gwokogi bene: <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />wek tin acit awot ikin limi makwo ducu, wek ayer ki ikin gi romi ma komgi opajupaju ki ma abacabac, ki lutino romi macol ducu, kacel ki dyegi ma gubedo abacabac ki ma opajupaju; meno gin aye gibibedo mucarana. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Kitmeno leng cwinya binen lacen, ka ibibino ka ngiyo kom mucarana. Ka ibinongo dyegi ma komgi pe opajupaju ki abacabac, ki lutino romi ma pe gicol gitye ikin mega, meno kibikwano ni kikwalo akwala.” <verse eid="GEN 30:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Ci Laban ogamo ni, “Ber, wek obed kit ma iwaconi.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Ento inino meno Laban okoyo nyogi dyegi ma gubedo ma oceruceru, ki ma abacabac, ki megi dyegi ma komgi opajupaju ki abacabac, ma kitartar ducu, ki lutino romi ducu macol, oketo i cing awobene. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Opoko kin gi woko ki Yakobo ma bore romo wot me nino adek kulu; Yakobo odong ka kwayo lee pa Laban mudonge. <verse eid="GEN 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobo ocako jako jang pobo madyak ki yaa ki ogali, ci ongweko pokgi, wek kom kedi onen ma oceruceru ma kitartar. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ci okwanyo kedi ma ongweko komgini, ci opyelogi inyim romi i wee pii, kama gionyo iye pii, kama lee cito iye kamato pii, pien nyogine giyito megine ka gibino kamato pii. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Ka kiyitogi inyim kedi, miyo ginywalo lutino ma akolakol, ki ma aciriaciri ki ma abacabac. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo dok opoko lutino romi pat, oloko wang lee maneno gin ma akolakol ki lwak lee pa Laban macole ducu, ka opoko dul lee pat kun pe dok ribogi ki pa Laban. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Ikare ma nyogi yito megine matego, ci Yakobo pyelo kedi i wee pii inyim romi, wek guyite inyim kedi. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Ento ka megine magorogoro aye kiyitogi, en pe pyelo kedi inyimgi; pimeno lee magoro ducu pa Laban, mategone ducu pa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Kitmeno Yakobo odoko lalonyo matek, matye ki lwak lee, ki lwak angeca ki lwak opiine, ki lwak kinaga ki kana.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo olwi woko ki bot Laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Yakobo obedo kawinyo ni awobe pa Laban giwaco ni, “Yakobo dong otero lim pa wonwa woko ducu, oguru lonyo nia ki ikom lee pa wonwa.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobo oneno ni wang Laban ocido woko ikome, pe dong nene maber kit macon. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Ikare meno Rwot owaco bot Yakobo ni, “Dong idok cen i lobo pa kwarowu bot lutuwu, an abibedo kwedi.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Ci Yakobo olwongo Lakeri ki Lea i bar olet kama lime tye iye, <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />ci owaco botgi ni, “An aneno wang wonwu dong ocido woko ikoma, pe dong nena maber kit macon. Ento Lubanga pa wora yam tye kweda. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Wun wungeyo ni atyeko tic bot wonwu ki teka ducu; <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />ci en obedo kabura kun dwoko mucarana piny tyen apar kulu, ento Lubanga pe oye en me timo gin mo marac ikoma. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Ka owaco ni, ‘Lim ma abacabac bibedo meri me mucarani,’ ci lee ducu ginywal ma obedo abacabac keken. Ka dok oloko doge ni, ‘Lee ma gibedo akolakol gin aye bibedo meri me mucarani,’ ci lee ducu dok ginywal akolakol. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Meno aye kit ma Lubanga okwanyo kwede lim pa wonwu ci omiyogi bota.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Ikare ma giyitogi megine, ailo wanga malo ki iwang lek, ci aneno nyogi ma gitigo megine komgi obedo akolakol ki abacabac ki opukopuk. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Lamalaika pa Lubanga oloko kweda iwang lek ni, ‘Yakobo,’ an agamo ni, ‘An a ene!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Ci owaca ni, ‘Il wangi malo wek inen, nyogi ducu ma gitigo megineni gubedo akolakol ki abacabac ki opukopuk; pien atyeko neno kit ma Laban timi kwede. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-22">Aca 28:18-22</ref></char></note> An Lubanga mayam anyute boti i Betel, kama yam i wiro iye wir ki moo, ka ikwongo iye kwong botani. Dong ia malo, icit woko cen ki i lobo man, idok i lobo ma kinywali iye ca.’” <verse eid="GEN 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Lakeri ki Lea gugamo ni, “Tye dok dul lim mo nyo ginaleya mo ma dok odong pirwa i ot pa wonwa? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />En dong nenowa macalo lurok ata. En dong otyeko catowa woko, dok tye kacamo bene lim ma kimiyo pirwa woko. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Lim ducu madong Lubanga otyeko kwanyo ki bot wonwa dong mewa ki pa lutinowa; dong gin ducu ma Lubanga owaco ni aye itim.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Ci Yakobo oa, oketo awobene ki mone iwi kinaga, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />oleko lime ducu, mayam onongo i Paddan-aram; ci ocako wot me dok i lobo Kanaan bot Icaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Laban onongo ocito kangolo yer kom romine, ci Lakeri okwalo cal lubanga ki i ot pa wone. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo obwolo Laban La-aram kun pe otite pi wote. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Olwi ki lwak lim ducu mayam tye kwede, ka ocako wot, ongolo nam Euprate, ci okemo lobo godi me Gilead.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Laban olubu kor Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Ka nino okato adek kulu, ci kitito bot Laban ni, “Yakobo dong otyeko lwi, ocito woko.” <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />En ogware ki lutugi, gutware, gulubu kore; ka guwoto nino abiro, ci gudingo kore cokcok ikin godi me Gilead. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Ento Lubanga obino bot Laban La-aram iwang lek, kun wace ni, “Gwoke, pe icilok lok mo maber nyo marac bot Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Laban omako Yakobo i yo. Onongo dong otyeko gony woko i lobo godi, ci Laban ki lutugi gugony i lobo godi meno me Gilead. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Ci Laban owaco bot Yakobo ni, “Itimo tim kuman pingo?, Ibwola kit man, dok itingo anyirana, kun ilwii kwedgi, macalo iyakogi ayaka ki i dog lweny. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Pingo ilwii woko alwiya i mung alii, kun iumu wanga ma pe itita gin mo? Ka onongo itita kono nene aciki ki yomcwiny ki wer ki ajaa ki opuk. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Pingo pe iweko aciko lutinona kun anoto lem anyirana? Man itimo gin me mingo atika. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Onongo atwero timi marac; ento Lubanga pa woru oloko kweda tin idyewor, ocika ni ‘Gwoke pe icilok lok mo maber nyo marac bot Yakobo.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Man dong ia icako wot woko, pien pi ot pa woru odoko miti mada; ento dok ikwalo ki cal lubangana me ngo kono?” <verse eid="GEN 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo ogamo dog Laban ni, “Onongo abedo ki lworo, abedo ka tamoni gwok nyo ibimayo anyirani woko ki bota.” <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Ento ka ibinongo cal lubangani bot ngat mo kany, ngat meno pe bikwo. Cim koni jamini ma inongo tye bota kany inyim utmegiwa ci ikwany idok giri kwede, “Onongo Yakobo pe ongeyo ni Lakeri aye ma okwalogi.”<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Kitmeno Laban ocako donyo i kema pa Yakobo, ki i kema pa Lea, ki i kema pa mon angeca aryonu ducu, ci pe omedo ki nongogi; ka okato woko ki i kema pa Lea, dok odonyo i kema pa Lakeri. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Ikare meno onongo Lakeri otingo lubanganu, ci orwakogi ikom me bedo iwi kinaga; ci obedo iwigi. Laban ongiyo jami ma i kema ducu, pe omedo ki nongogi. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Lakeri owaco bot wone ni, “Ladita, pe kiniga omaki ikoma ka ineno ni pe atwero a malo inyimi, pien atye ikit pa wan mon.” Kitmeno Laban oyenyo cal lubangane kwe, pe omedo ki nongogi.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Omiyo kiniga omako Yakobo, ci oda ki Laban, kun waco bot Laban ni, “Balla dong tye kwene ka? Atimo bal ango, ma omiyo ilubu kora tutwali? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Kadi bed iyenyo ikin jamina ducu, kit gin ango ma inongo ikom jami ducu ma oa i odi? Kel iket kany inyim utmegini ki utmegina, wek gungol kop ikin wan aryoni. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />An abedo kwedi mwaka pyere aryo kulu; pe tye megi romini ki megi dyegini mo ma iye opoto, pe bene acamo nyok romoni mo. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Kare ducu ka nguu omwodo lee mo, pe amedo ki kelo ringone boti, ento an aye aculu gira; lim ma kikwalo i dyeceng ki idyewor bene ducu iweko an aye aculu pire. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Yam abedo kitmeno, kun ceng wanga dyeceng, koyo neka dyewor, pe aketo nino mo i wanga. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />I lwak mwaka pyere aryo kulu ma abedo kwedi i odini, atiyo boti mwaka apar wiye angwen pi anyirani aryoni, ki mwaka abicel pi limi, ibedo kadwoko mucarana piny tyen apar kulu. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Kace Lubanga pa wora, Lubanga pa Abraim ma Icaka bene lworo, pe obedo tung bota, kono tin icwala adok tuwa ki cinga nongo adada. Lubanga oneno twon aromana, ki tic ma atiyo ki cinga ci tin dyewor bene ojuki.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ki Laban gucike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Laban ogamo kun dok iye bot Yakobo ni, “Anyira man gin anyirana, ki lutino bene gin lutinona, lim bene gin lima, ki gin ma inenoni gin ducu lima. Ento pe dong atwero timo gin mo ikom anyiranani, nyo ikom lutinogi ma gunywalo. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Dong ibin wek waket gicike ikin in ki an, me bedo caden ikin in ki an.” <verse eid="GEN 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Ci Yakobo otingo got ocibo wek obed wir. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Ka Yakobo owaco bot utmegine ni, “Wucok got,” ci gucoko got, guguru kacel, ka gucamo cam inget odur got meno. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laban ocako nying kabedo meno ni Jegarcaduta; ento Yakobo ocako nyinge ni Galeed. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Laban owaco ni, “Odur got man en aye caden ikin in ki an tin.” Ma omiyo ocako nyinge Galeed. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Laban ocako nying kabedo meno ni Mijpa, pien owaco ni, “Rwot ogwok kin an ki in, ka kinwa dong bipoke woko. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Ka ibiketo gingi marac ikom anyirana, nyo ka dok ibinyomo mon mukene, idodogi ikom anyirana, kadi ngat mo pe tye kwedwa, ber ipo ni Lubanga en aye caden ikin in ki an.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Ci Laban dok owaco bot Yakobo ni, “Nen odur man, ki wir ma atyeko cibo ikin in ki an. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Odur man aye caden, ki wir bene en caden, an pe abikato ka nget odur man pi cito boti, in bene pe ibikato ka nget odur man ki wir man pi cito bota, ni pi tim marac. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Lubanga pa Abraim, Lubanga pa Nakor, Lubanga pa won gi, obed langolkop ikinwa.” Ci Yakobo okwongo kwong ki nying Lubanga ma wone Icaka lworo. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Yakobo otyero gitum iwi got, kun olwongo iye utmegine ducu kacamo cam kwede, ci gucamo gubutu kunu iwi got.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Ka piny oru odiko con, Laban oa, onoto lem likwaye ki lem anyirane, olamo gum ikomgi, ci opoke kwedgi odok i gange.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo oyube pi rwate ki Ecau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Lacen Yakobo omede ki wote ci lumalaika pa Rwot guromo kwede. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Ka Yakobo onenogi, owaco ni, “Man mony pa Lubanga!” Ma omiyo olwongo nying kabedonu ni Makanaim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="fk">Makanaim </char> te loke mony aryo.</note><verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Ci Yakobo ocwalo lukwena bot omine Ecau matye i lobo Ceir, i lobo pa jo Edom. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />En opwonyogi ni, “Wubiwaco bot ladita Ecau kit man: Latici Yakobo owaco ni, ‘Dong atyeko bedo bot Laban abedo nio wa ikareni. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Atye ki twoni ki lwak kana, ki lwak lim, ki lwak opii ki lwak angeca; acwalo kwena boti ladita wek anong pwoc mo ki tung boti.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Ikare ma lukwena gudwogo bot Yakobo, guwace ni, “Wao bot omeru Ecau, en obibino ka rwate kwedi i yo, kacel ki jo miya angwen.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Lworo omako Yakobo matek kome bene oryange woko; ci opoko kin jo ma onongo gitye kwede, ki dyegi ki dyangi, ki kinaga, dul aryo, <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />kun tamo ni “Ka Ecau obino olwenyo ikom dul man aceli otyeko woko, ci dul acel mudong ca bibwot.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Yakobo olego ni, “Ai Lubanga pa kwara Abraim, Lubanga pa wora Icaka, ai Rwot in mayam iwaca ni, ‘Dong idok tuwu bot kakawu, an abitimi maber.’ <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />An pe amyero kadi matidi mo ki mar meri ducu ma pe loke, ki ada meri ducu ma inyutu ikom an latici; pien con angolo kulu Jordan ma kun atye ki odoona keken, ci kombedi dong adoko lwak aryo kulu. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Alegi ni ilara ki i cing omera, lara ki i cing Ecau; pien alwore, gwok nyo obibino ka neko wan ducu, mon ki lutinogi. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">Aca 22:17</ref></char></note>Ento yam onongo iwaco ni, ‘Abitimi ber, abimiyo likwayi bedo macalo kweyo ma i dog nam, ma pe kwane pi dwonge.’”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />En obutu kenyo inino meno, okwanyo dul lim mogo mayam tye kwede ocwalo bot omine Ecau, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />megi dyegi miya aryo ki nyogi dyegi pyere aryo, megi romi miya aryo ki nyogi romi pyere aryo, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />megi kinaga ma kinyeto cakgi pyere adek ki lutinogi, megi dyangi pyere angwen ki twoni apar, megi kana pyere aryo ki twoni kana apar. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />En otingo magi ducu, ci omiyo i cing lutice, kun gilekogi dul ki dul patpat. Dok ociko lutice ni, “Wun wukat inyima, wek kinwu obed mabocoboco ka wutye kalekogi.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Ociko latel yo ni, “Ka omera Ecau oromo kwedi, ce openyi ni, ‘Wun jo pa anga? Wucito kwene? Lim man ma i nyimwuni pa anga?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Ibiwace ni, ‘Lim pa latici Yakobo; gin aye mot ma ocwalo bot ladite Ecau; en bene pud odong cen ingewa.’” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Dok omede ki ciko dano me aryo ki me adeke, ki gin ducu ma gileko lim, ocikogi ni, “Wubiloko lok ma romrom bot Ecau ka wuromo kwede. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Wubiwaco bote ni, ‘Dok bene latici Yakobo aye odong cen ingewa.’” Onongo otamo ni, “Wek akwe cwinye ki mot ma ocito anyimi, ci lacen olo abineno wange twal, dok en bene gwok dong bijola.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Kitmeno mot okwongo nyime, kun en kikome obutu i gony idyewor meno.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo olwenyo i Peniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />I dyewor meno en oa malo, ci okwanyo mone aryo, angecane aryo, kacel ki lutinone apar wiye acel, owoto ongolo kwedgi kulu Jabok. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Okwanyogi, omiyo gungolo kulu, kacel ki lim ma en tye kwede ducu. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:24:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3-4">Koc 12:3-4</ref></char></note> Yakobo odong kene; ci laco mo obino, ocako rete kwede nio wa kwarpiny. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Ikare ma laco meno oneno ni pe dong etwero loyo Yakobo, ci otwomo awangmace; ci em Yakobo otuk owil woko lacungo ma en rete kwede. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Laconu owace ni, “Weka dong aciti, pien piny dong mito ruu woko.” Ento Yakobo ogamo ni, “Pe abiweki, nio wang ma kong ilama gum.” <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Laconu openye ni, “Nyingi kono anga?” En owaco ni, “Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:10">Aca 35:10</ref></char></note>Ci dok owace ni, “Nia tin nyingi dong pe kibilwongo ni Yakobo, ento ni Icrael,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="fk">Icrael</char> te loke ngat murete ki Lubanga.</note> pien ibedo kalweny ki Lubanga, dok ki dano bene, ci imedo ki loyo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:17-18">Lung 13:17-18</ref></char></note>Yakobo dok openye ni, “Alegi ni ituca nyingi do.” Ci en ogamo ni, “Ipenyo nyinga kono pingo?” Ci laconu omiye gum kakenyo. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Ci Yakobo ocako nying kabedo meno ni, Peniel, kun waconi, “Pien atyeko neno Lubanga wang ki wang, ento pud akwo gira aye.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Ceng otuce i Peniel kun dong woto ma komo akoma pi eme ma otuk owil wokoni. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Omiyo wa ikare man jo Icrael gikwero ringo puc me bam matye i awangmac, pien Lubanga otwomo Yakobo i ler awangmac.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ki Ecau dok gumer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo oilo wange malo, ci oneno ka Ecau bino, kacel ki jone miya angwen, ci opoko lutino ikin Lea ki Lakeri ki bot angecane aryoni. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ocwalo angeca ki lutinogi anyim, ka dok Lea ki lutinone, ka dong Lakeri ki Yucepu gudong cen i korgi ducu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />En kikome obole, ocito anyim, kun woto kulu wiye piny tyen abiro nio ka oo kwede cok bot omine.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Ento Ecau otoke ki ngwec, oringo ka mote, ci opoto okwako kore, ka omako ngute, onoto leme, ci gucako koko. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Ka dok Ecau oilo wange malo, ci oneno lwak mon ki lutinogi, ci owaco ni, “Maca kono jo mene ma gibinoni?” Ci Yakobo ogamo ni, “Meno aye gin lutino ma Lubanga omiyo ki latici pi kicane.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Ka angeca gunyiko cok, kacel ki lutinogi, ci gukulu wigi piny. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Lea bene kitmeno kacel ki lutinone ka gunyiko cok ci gukulu wigi piny; me agikine Yucepu ki Lakeri gunyiko cok, gin bene guryebe piny. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Ci Ecau owaco ni, “Lwak man ma arwate kwedgi ducu, teloke ango?” Yakobo ogamo ni, “Wek anong pwoc inyim ladita.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Ento Ecau owaco ni, “An atye ki ma roma, omera; wek lim man ducu gubed meri.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Ci Yakobo ogamo ni, “Aa, pe. Alegi ni, ka ineno an ayomo cwinyi, ci ber igam mot ma amiyi ki i cingani; pien ada, neno wangi, rom ki neno wang Lubanga, pi kit cwiny maber ma ijola kwedeni. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Dong alegi igam mot ma amiyo gikelo botini, pien Lubanga dong onyutu kicane ikoma, dok bene atye ki mera ma roma.” Yakobo obedo karide ki lok meno, nio ka oye, ogamo mote.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Lacen Ecau owaco ni, “Wek dong wanywaku yo kacel, kun atelo nyimi.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Ento Yakobo ogamo ni, “Ladita, ingeyo ni lutino pud peya gutegi, dok atye kagwoko romi ki dyangi ma pud gidoto lutinogi; ka wamiyogi wot malac, bibwoyogi woko, kadi bed pi nino acel, lim ducu gibito woko. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Wek in ladita iwot, icit anyim inyim latici, kun an alubu kori motmot, muporo wot pa lim mutela yo, ki wot pa lutino, nio ka abio boti i Ceir.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Ci Ecau ogamo ni, “Wek awek boti jo mogo ma abino kwedgini.” Ento en owaco ni, “Meno pe bimite Ladita, tima ber, wek dong anong pwoc keken inyimi.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Kitmeno Ecau ocako wot inino meno me dok i Ceir. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Ento Yakobo owoto odok mere tung Cukot, ogero ode pire kene dok oguro dwol dyangine. Ma omiyo nying kabedo meno gilwongo ni Cukot.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="fk">Cukot </char> te loke gony.</note><verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Lacen Yakobo oo ki kuc labongo ayela i gang me Cekem, matye i lobo Kanaan, kun oa ki i Paddan-aram; ci oguro kemane inyim gang. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yoc 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Jon 4:5</ref></char></note>Dul latin lobo ma oguro iye kemani, owilo ki bot lutino pa Kamor, ma won Cekem, ki wel lim maromo wel ryal miya acel. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Ci ocano keno tyer kunu, ci olwongo ni El-Eloe-Icrael.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="fk">El-Eloe-Icrael </char> Lubanga, Lubanga pa Icrael.</note><verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Kironyo Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Nino mo acel Dina nya pa Lea, ma onywalo ki Yakoboni, ocito kalimo mon ma i lobo meno. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Cekem wod pa Kamor ma Lakiv, laker me lobo meno, onene, ci omake tektek obutu kwede. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Ci cwinye omaro Dina nya pa Yakobo; ocako mare, kun loko kwede mot mupye. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Cekem oloko ki wone Kamor ni, “Nyoma nyako man, wek obed dakona.” <verse eid="GEN 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Ci Yakobo owinyo ni otyeko ronyo nyare Dina; ento onongo awobene gitye ki lime i olet. Yakobo odiyo cwinye, oling gire mot, nio ka gudwogo, <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Kamor won Cekem ocito bot Yakobo kapenyo keny. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Ka awobe pa Yakobo guwinyo lok meno, gua ki i olet, gudwogo, ki keco, ki akemo madit, pien Cekem otimo gin ma pe myero i Icrael, pi butu ki nya pa Yakobo, pien kit tim macalo meno pe myero otime.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Kamor oloko kwedgi kun waco ni, “Cwiny woda dong omaro nyarwu; alegowu, wuwek en onyom nyarwu, obed dakone. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Wek nyome obed ikin wan kwedwu; wumii anyirawu botwa, wun bene wunyom anyirawa. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Wun wubibedo kwedwa, wubibedo i loboni macalo wumito; wubed iye wucat iye wilwu, wek wulim iye lonyo.” <verse eid="GEN 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Cekem bene owaco kitmeno bot won nyako ki omegine ni, “Ber wujol kenya, abikelo botwu lim ducu ma wubingola. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Wungola wel lim kit ma wumito ducu ki me ayal, abikolo lim kit ma wubiwaca; ento wumiya anyom nyakoni obed dakona.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Awobe pa Yakobo gugamo dog Cekem ki wone Kamor kun gibwologi abwola, pien oronyo lamin gi Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Guwaco botgi ni, “Pe watwero timo tim man, me miyo laminwa bot dano ma pe giliro, meno bikelo lewic ikomwa. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Tye yo acel keken; ma ka otime, ci bimiyo wabiye, en ene: ka wudoko macalo wan, ka dano acel acel ma laco ikinwu olire. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Miyo wan dong wabimiyowu anyirawa, ki wan bene dong wabinyomo anyirawu; ci dong wabibedo ikinwu macalo wat acel. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ento ka pe wuwinyo lokwa, ka wukwero lire, ci wabikwanyo nyarwa, wabicito giwa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Lokgi oyomo cwiny Kamor ki wode Cekem. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Latin awobi orune katimone woko cut, pien onongo cwinye omaro nya pa Yakobo ma pe tite, onongo yam giwore makato jo ducu ma i ot pa wone. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Kitmeno Kamor ki wode Cekem gucito i dog gangi, ci guwaco bot jo me ganggi ni, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Jo man gimer kwedwa; waweku gin gubed i lobowa, gucat wilgi iye; nen, loboni tye malac ma romogi; wuwek wanyom anyiragi, wek wamii gin bene gunyom anyirawa. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Tye lok acel ma bimiyo giye bedo ikinwa, en aye bedo wat acel, ka laco acel acel ikinwa bilire, kit macalo gin gilire. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Pe limgi, ki lonyogi ki lwak lee matye i cinggi ducu gibidoko limwa? Ber waye lokgi wek gubed kwedwa.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Ci jo ducu ma guwok ki i dog gang guwinyo lok pa Kamor ki wode Cekem; ma omiyo co ducu ki acel acel gulire woko.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omegi Dina guculu kwor pi ronye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Inino me adeke, madong bur okwok, ci awobe pa Yakobo aryo, Cimeon ki Levi, omegi Dina, gukwanyo pala lucwan, gucito, guturu ki donyo i gang meno ma wegine pe gingeyo, ci guneko co woko ducu. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ci guneko Kamor ki wode Cekem ki pala lucwan, ci gukwanyo Dina woko ki i ot pa Cekem, gucito kwede. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Awobe pa Yakobo gucore i gang pa luto, guyako iye jamigi pi ronyo lamingi. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Guyako dyegigi ki dyangigi, ki lwak kana, ki jami ducu matye i gang ki matye i poti bene. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Guyako lwak lonyogi ducu, ki lutinogi ducu ki mon gi, ki jami ma i odigi ducu, gutero odoko meggi. <verse eid="GEN 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Ci Yakobo owaco bot Cimeon ki Levi ni, “Wun wukelo ayela ikoma, wumiyo nyinga odoko ngwe lituny ikin wegi loboni, Lukanaan ki Luperiji; An lwaka nok mo, kace gucoke kacel me lweny kweda, gibityeka woko liweng, an kacel ki oda ducu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Ento gugamo ni, “Nen ma myero ka dong en otero laminwa macalo lakwele bo?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga omiyo Yakobo gum i Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:11-17">Aca 28:11-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lubanga owaco ki Yakobo ni, “A woko icit i Betel, wek ibed kunu; dok ican keno tyer kunu kama yam an anen iye boti ikare ma iringo ilwii woko ki bot omeru Ecau.” <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Omiyo Yakobo owaco bot jo ma i ode ki jo ducu ma gibedo bote ni, “Wubol lwak cal lubanga pa lurok ma wutye kwedgi ikinwuni woko, wek wulonye kenwu, dok bene wulok ginarukawu woko; <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />ka dong wa ayu, wacitu woko wa i Betel, wek acit acan keno tyer pi Lubanga mayam ogamo doga inino mayam can odingani, ma obedo kweda ikabedo ducu ma awoto iye.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Gumiyo ki Yakobo cal ducu, ki agit ma nongo tye i itgi bene; ci cal lubanga pa lurok ma gitye kwede Yakobo oyikogi piny ite yat kworo mayam tye cok ki Cekem.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Ikare ma Yakobo ki awobene gucako wot, lworo ma oa ki bot Lubanga opoto ikom wegi taun matye cok kwedgi, omiyo pe gulubu kor awobe pa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobo otiro i Luj ma en aye Betel, matye i lobo Kanaan, en kacel ki lwak dano ducu mayam gitye kwede. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />En ocano keno tyer kunu, ci olwongo nying kabedo meno ni El-betel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="fk">El-betel </char> te loke Lubanga me Betel.</note> pien onongo Lubanga yam onen iye bote ikare ma olwi oringo woko ki bot omine. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Debora lakony Labeka oto woko, ci kiyike ite yat kworo ma inget Betel; ma omiyo nying kabedo meno kilwongo ni Alon-bakut.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="fk">Alon-bakut </char> te loke, “Kworo me kumu.” </note><verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Lubanga dok onyute bot Yakobo ikare ma en oa ki i Mesopotamia, ci omiye gum. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Aca 32:28</ref></char></note> Lubanga owace ni, “Nyingi Yakobo; pe dok kibilwongo nyingi ni Yakobo, ento nyingi dong bibedo Icrael.” Omiyo nyinge odoko Icrael. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:11:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-8">Aca 17:4-8</ref></char></note> Lubanga dok owace ni, “An Lubanga Matwero ducu; nywal, inya; rok ki lwak rok mapol bia ikomi, ki luker bene gibia ki ikomi. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Lobo mayam amiyo ki Abraim ki Icaka abimiyo boti, ka dok abimiyo lobo bot likwayi ma gibilubi.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Lubanga oa ki ikabedo kama yam oloko iye kwedeni odok malo. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18-19">Aca 28:18-19</ref></char></note> Ci Yakobo ocibo wir ikabedo kama oloko ki Lubanga iyeni, ocibo iye wir got; oonyo gityer amata, ka oliyo moo ikome. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo olwongo nying kabedo ma Lubanga oloko iye kwedeni ni Betel.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Lakeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobo ki jone gumede ki wot nia ki i Betel. Ikare ma pud Eprat kiborbor, ci mwoc ogoyo Lakeri, ci nyodone obedo tek. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Ikare madong arem omede matek, dako lacolo owace ni, “Pe ilwor; tin doki ibinywalo latin laco mukene.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Ikare ma en to ma cwinye cok ka tum, ocako nying latine ni Benoni; ento wone ocako nyinge ni Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Lakeri oto woko kitmeno, ci guyike i yo ma cito Eprat, ma en aye Beterekem. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo ocibo wir got iwi lyel pa Lakeri; meno wir lyel pa Lakeri ma pud tye ocung kunu nio wa ikare man. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Icrael omede ki wote, ogony inge lubele me Eder ma wiye ocudu malo.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awobe pa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Tek 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:22:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:4">Aca 49:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare ma Icrael tye i lobo meno, ci wode Reuben otimo tim caro, obutu ki ciwone Bila ma angeca; ci wone owinyo pire bene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo yam tye ki awobene apar wiye aryo. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Lutino awobe pa Lea gin aye Reuben, latin kayo pa Yakobo, Cimeon, Levi, Juda, Icakar ki Jabulon. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Lutino awobe pa Lakeri gin aye Yucepu ki Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Lutino awobe pa Bila, angeca pa Lakeri, gin aye Dan ki Naputali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Lutino awobe pa Jilpa, angeca pa Lea, gin aye Gad ki Acer. Meno gin aye lutino awobe pa Yakobo ma kinywalogi i Mesopotamia.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Icaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:27:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 13:18">Aca 13:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yakobo obino bot wone Icaka i Mamre, i Kiriat-arba, en aye Kebron kama yam Abraim ki Icaka gubedo iye. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Icaka yam orii iwi lobo mwaka miya acel ki pyere aboro. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Icaka oomo cwinye me agiki ka dong oto. En onongo dong dano ma oteggi mada; ci awobene Ecau ki Yakobo guyiko kome.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Ecau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Tek 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Man aye likwayo pa Ecau, en aye Edom. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Aca 26:34</ref></char></note>Ecau onyomo anyira Kanaan: Ada nya pa Elon Lakit, Okolibama nya pa Ana, wod pa Gibeon Lakiv, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:3:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:9">Aca 28:9</ref></char></note>ki Bacemat nya pa Icmael, lamin Nebayot. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada onywalo ki Ecau Elifaji; Bacemat onywalo Reuel; <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />ki Okolibama onywalo Jeuc, Jalam ki Kora; meno aye lutino awobe ma kinywalo ki Ecau i lobo Kanaan.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Ci Ecau otero mone ki lutino awobene ki anyirane, ki lwak jo ducu ma en tye kwede, ki lime, lee mere ducu ki lonyone ducu ma olimogi ki i lobo Kanaan, odak kwedgi i lobo mukene kun opoke ki omine Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Gin ducu onongo gitye ki lim madwong, ma pe dong romogi bedo kacel: pien lobo ma onongo gibedo iye pe romo me kwayo limgi. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Omiyo Ecau odak obedo i lobo godi me Ceir; Ecau en aye Edom.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Likwayo pa Ecau won jo Edom ma i lobo godi me Ceir gin ene. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Man aye nying lutino awobe pa Ecau: Elifaji wod pa Ada ma, dako pa Ecau, ki Reuel wod pa Bacemat dako pa Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Lutino awobe pa Elifaji gin Teman Omar, Jepo, Gatam ki Kenaj. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Timna yam en dako pa Elifaji, wod pa Ecau, ma angeca; onywalo Amalek ki Elifaji. Man gin aye lutino awobe pa Ada, dako pa Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Man gin aye lutino awobe pa Reuel: Nakat, Jera Cama ki Mija. Man aye lutino awobe pa Bacemat dako pa Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Man aye lutino awobe pa Okolibama nya pa Ana wod pa Jibeon, dako pa Ecau; onywalo ki Ecau awobe magi: Jeuc, Jalam ki Kora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Magi aye kaka pa awobe pa Ecau. Elipaji latin kayo pa Ecau aye obedo kwaro pa kaka magi: Teman, Omar, Jepo, Kenaj: <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora, Gatam ki Amalek. Magi aye gubedo likwayo pa Ada. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Reuel wod pa Ecau aye obedo kwaro pa kaka magi: Nakat, Jera rwot Cama ki Mija. Magi aye gubedo likwayo pa Bacemat, dako pa Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Ecau aye kwaro pa kaka magi ducu ma onywalogi ki dakone Okolibama: Jeuc, Jalam ki Kora: meno gin aye likwayo pa Okolibama nya pa Ana, dako pa Ecau. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Kaka magi ducu gua ikom Ecau, en aye Edom.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Ceir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Tek 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Magi aye awobe pa Ceir Lakorit, ma gin wegi lobonu: Lotan, Cobal, Jibeon, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dicon, Ejer ki Dican; magi aye kaka pa jo Kori, lutino awobe pa Ceir ma i lobo Edom. <verse eid="GEN 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lutino awobe pa Lotan gin aye Kori ki Eman; ki lamin Lotan en Timna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Cobal: Alvan, Manakat, Ebal, Cepo ki Onam. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Jibeon: Aiya, ki Ana; en aye Ana mayam onongo wang pii amuru matye i tim, ikare ma en tye ka kwayo lwak kana pa wone Jibeon. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Magi aye lutino pa Ana: Dicon ki Okolibama, nya pa Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Dicon: Kemdan, Eciban, Itran ki Keran. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Ejer: Bilan, Jaavan ki Akan. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Magi aye lutino awobe pa Dican: Uj ki Aran. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Magi aye kaka pa jo Kori: Lotan, Cobal, Jibeon, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dicon, Ejer ki Dican; meno aye kaka pa jo Koti, kit macalo kakagi tye kwede i lobo Ceir.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luker pa jo Edom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Tek 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Magi aye luker ma guloyo lobo Edom, ma onongo pud peya rwot mo oloyo jo Icrael. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela wod pa Beor onongo loyo Edom, nying gang kale kilwongo ni Dinkaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela oto, ci Jobab wod pa Jera me Bojra oleyo katyene. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Jobab oto, ci Kucam ma oa ki i lobo pa jo Teman oleyo katyene. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Kucam oto, ci Adad wod pa Bedad oleyo katyene. En con olwenyo, oloyo jo Midian ma gitye i lobo Moab; nying gang kale kilwongo Avit. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Adad oto ci Camla me Macireka oleyo katyene. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Camla oto, ci Caul me Rekobot matye i dog nam Euprate oleyo katyene. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Caul oto, ci Baal-kanan wod pa Akbor oleyo katyene. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baal-kanan wod pa Akbor oto, ci Kadar oleyo katyene; nying gang kale kilwongo Pau. Nying dakone Meketabel, nya pa Matred, nya pa Mejakab.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Magi aye nying kaka ma tung bot Ecau, macalo dogolagi tye kwede, ki kabedogi, malubu nyinggi: Timna, Alva, Jetet, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Okolibama. Ela ki Pinon, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenaj, Teman, Mibjar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magdiel ki Iram; magi aye kaka pa jo Edom, en aye Ecau, ma kwaro pa jo Edom, kit mayam gibedo kwede ikabedogi, i lobo ma odoko megi.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Yucepu ki omegine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo obedo i lobo mayam kong wone obedo iyeni, lobo me Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Man aye lok me tekwaro pa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Ka Yucepu dong oromo mwaka apar wiye abiro, onongo dong kwayo lim kacel ki omege; en obedo ki lutino awobe pa Bila ki Jilpa, mon pa wone; Yucepu onongo kelo lok malube ki tim maracu ma omegine timo bot won gi. <verse eid="GEN 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yakobo onongo maro Yucepu makato lutinone ducu pien onongo en latin ma kinywalo ka wi tiyone. Yakobo onongo okwone kanyi mabor ma bade boco. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Ento ma omegine guneno ni won gi maro en makato gin ducu, ci cwinygi ocako kwere woko, kun pe gimito lok kwede maber.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Ikare mo Yucepu oleko lek, ci otito bot omegine, ci gumede ameda ki kwere. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />En otito botgi ni, “Kong wuwiny kit lek ma alekoni: <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />nen ba, ikare ma wabedo ka tweyo larita i poto, ci nen, laritana oa malo ocung atir; ci laritawu gugure, gurume dyere, ka gukulu wigi piny bot laritana.” <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Ci omegine gugamo ni, “In ada ibiloyowa? In aye dong ibiloyo wiwa?” Gumede ki kwere dong marac pi leke ki pi loke. <verse eid="GEN 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Yocepu dok oleko lek mukene, dok otito ki omegine aye, kun waconi, “Nenu ba, dok aleko lek mukene aye. Nen, ceng ki dwe ki lakalatwe apar wiye acel gubedo kakulu wigi piny inyima.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Ka otito bot wone ki bot omegine, ci wone ocoke, ocoke ma juke matek, kun wace ni, “Meno kit lek ango ma ileko kumenoni? An ki meni ki omegini wabibino, ci wapoto waryebe piny inyimi ada?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Tic 7:9</ref></char></note>Omiyo nyeko omako omegine ikome ento wone okano lok meno i cwinye.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kicato Yucepu ci kitere i lobo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Inino mo acel ka omegine gucito kakwayo lee pa won gi macok ki Cekem, <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />ci Icrael owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Omegini gitye kakwat inget Cekem, bin wek aori icit botgi.” En ogamo doge ni, “An a ene.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Ci owace ni, “Kong, icinen ka omegini gitye maber, kacel ki lim bene, ka idwoka lok doki.” Ka ocwale nia ki i nota me Kebron, ci ocito wa i Cekem. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Ka Yocepu oo kunu ci laco mo ononge kawoto junge atata i olet; ci openye ni, “In ibiyenyo ango?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />En ogamo ni, “Atye kayenyo omegina. Alegi itita kama gitye iye kakwayo limgi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Laco meno owace ni, “Dong gutyeko a woko, pien awinyo ka giwaco ni, ‘Wacitu wa i Dotan.’” Yucepu ocako lubu kor omegine, ka onongogi i Dotan.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Ka gunene ki kamabor, ma onongo peya oo botgi cok, ci guyubu lok ikome me neke, <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />kun giloko keken gi ni, “Lalek eno binonu. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Wubin tin wa neke woko, wek wabole i bur mo kany; ci wabitito ni, ‘Nguu mo aye omake, omwode woko,’ wek wanen kit ma lekenu bicobe kwede.” <verse eid="GEN 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Reuben owinyo yub meno, ci olare ki i cinggi, kun waconi, “Pe wan aye waneke.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Reuben owaco ki gin dok ni, “Pe giony remone mo; wubole woko i bur man matye i tim kany, ento pe wuket cingwu ikome.” En owaco man pien onongo en oyube me kwanye woko ki i cinggi pi dwoke bot wone. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Ka Yucepu oo bot omegine, ci gupoto ikome, gulunyu bongo kanyine woko, kanyi mabor ma bade boco ma onongo orukuni; <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />ci gumake, gutere gubole woko i bur. Bur meno onongo pii pe iye.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Lacen gubedo piny kacam; ka guilo wanggi, ci guneno lwak jo Icmael ma gua i Gilead, ki lwak kinaga ma gutingo yec odok, moo yat to ki mura, ma giwoto gicito kwede i Ejipt. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Juda dok openyo omegine ni, “Konyo ango ka waneko ominwa dok ka wamungu to ne woko? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Wubin wek wacatu en bot jo Icmael, pe wan aye waneke ki cingwa, pien en ominwa, remowa kikome.” Ci omegine guworo doge. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Tic 7:9</ref></char></note>Jo Midian ma lucatwil gubino kenyo; ci guywayo Yucepu woko ki i bur, gucate woko bot jo Icmael, kun giwile ki cekel me ryal pyere aryo; ci gutero Yucepu wa i lobo Ejipt.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Ikare ma Reuben odwogo i dog bur, ci oneno Yucepu dong pe i bur, ci cwinye ocwer ocako yeco bongone woko. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Ka odok cen bot omegine, ci owaco ki gin ni “Awobini dong pe do; man abidok kwene ba?” <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Ka gukwanyo kanyi pa Yucepu, ci guneko dyel, ka gulutu kanyi i remo. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Gukelo kanyi mabor ma bade boco bot won gi, kun giwaco ni, “Wan wanongo man; kong ingii, ka nyo kanyi pa wodi onyo pe.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Ka ongiyo, ci owaco ni, “Man kanyi pa woda do; nguu dong omwode woko do; adada Yucepu dong nguu okido woko matinotino do.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yakobo bene cwinye ocwer, ocako yeco bongone, ci otweyo bongo cola i pyere, obedo kakoko wode pi kare malac. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Awobene ducu ki anyirane gua malo gucito ka kweyo cwinye; okwero ni pe kikwe cwinye, kun waconi, “Aya do, abilubu kor latina i lyel ki koko.” Wone obedo ka koke kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Ci jo Midian gucato Yucepu woko i Ejipt bot Potipar, ladit tic pa Parao, maloyo acikari lukurpiny.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Juda ki Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ikare meno Juda oa woko ki bot omegine, ocito odak bot laco mo ma jo Adulam, ma nyinge Kira. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Juda oneno nya pa Lakanaan mo ma nyinge Cua; ci onyomo, ka obedo kwede. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Ci ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, wone ocako nyinge Er. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Dakonu dok ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco, ocako nyinge Onan. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Dok ogamo ic aye, onywalo latin laco, ocako nyinge Cela. Latin meno en onywalo i Kejib.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Juda onyomo nyako ma nyinge Tamar ki wode Er ma latin kayone. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Ento Er latin kayo pa Juda yam onongo dano marac inyim Rwot, ci Rwot oneke woko. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Ci Juda owaco bot Onan ni, “Lak ciomeru, ci ibed kwede macalo won ot, wek inywal kwede wi omeru.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Ento Onan ongeyo ni lutino pe bibedo mere; pimeno kare ducu ma obedo ka butu ki ciomine, ci en nyeto kodi me co ne piny, wek pe enywal kwede wi omine. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Gin ma otimo pe oyomo cwiny Rwot, ci oneke woko bene. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Juda dok owaco bot ciwode Tamar ni, “Kong dong ibed macalo dato i ot pa woru, nio wang ma woda Cela bidongo,” pien onongo lworo ni gwok bito woko, macalo omegine. Kitmeno Tamar odok obedo i ot pa wone.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Ka kare okato, ci dako pa Juda ma nya pa Cua oto woko. Lacen ma cwiny Juda dong opye, ci ocito i Timna bot lungol yer romine, onywako yo ki lareme Kira ma jo Adulam. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Ci kitito bot Tamar ni, “Kwaru okato obicito i Timna kangolo yer romine.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Ci olunyu bongo cola me dalako woko, ka oume ki kitambara, odwalo ki kome woko ducu, ka ocito obedo kwede i dogcel me Enaim, ma okemo yo me Timna; pien onongo oneno ni kadi bed Cela dong oteggi, ento peya kimiye ni olake. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Ka Juda onene, ci otamo ni gwok dako lakwele mo, pien onongo en oumu wange woko ducu. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Ka ocito bote kama obedo iye inget yo, ci owace ni, “Bin wek abut kwedi,” kun pe ngeyo ni ciwode. En ogamo ni, “Ibimiya gin ango kono, ka wek ibin ibut kweda?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />En odok iye ni, “Abikwanyo latin dyel ki ikin dyegina, acwali.” Ci dakonu ogamo ni, “Kong ijeng gin mo bota, ka dong ibicwala dyel.” <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Ci Juda openyo ni, “In imito ajengi gin ango?” En odok iye ni, “Agit meri, ki toli, ki odooni matye i cingini.” Ci otingo omiyogi ducu bote, ka odonyo obutu kwede, ci dakonu oyac kwede. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Dako oa okato ocito gire woko, olunyu bongo kitambara ma oume kwedeni, ka dong oruku bongo cola me dalako.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Ikare ma Juda ocwalo Laadulam ma lareme pi tere latin dyel, wek odwoke jami mayam ojengo bot dakonu, ci pe omedo kinongo kome. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Ci en obedo ka penyo jo ma ikabedonu ni, “Dako mo ma lakweleni tye kwene, ma onongo yam bedo inget yo Enaim?” Guwace ni, “Lakwele mo pe ma bedo kany ba.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Ka odok cen bot Juda, ci owace ni, “Pe amedo ki nongo dakonu; ki jo ma ikabedo meno bene guwaco ni, ‘Lakwele mo pe mayam bedo kany.’” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Ci Juda ogamo ni, “Wek dong oter jaminu obed mere, wek pe kinyerwa; nen, acwalo latin dyel man, ci nongo kome aye oloyi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Dwe maromo adek okato, ci gitito ki Juda ni, “Ciwodi Tamar obedo katime tim kwelekwele, ci dong oyac woko ki tim kweleneni.” Ci Juda owaconi, “Wukele woko, wek kiwange woko.” <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Ikare ma kitye ka kele woko, ci en ocwalo lok bot kwarone ni, “Won jami man en aye ayac kwede.” Dok onwoyo aye ni, “Alegi ni ingigi; agit, ki tol ki odoonu jami pa anga ka?” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Juda ongiyogi ci oniang ni jaminu mege, ci otucu kun waconi, “Dako man otiyo gin ma atir makato an woko, pien pe amedo ki miyo en bot woda Cela.” Pe bene omedo ki butu kwede.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Ka kare me gonyene oromo, ci onen ni lutino rudi tye i iye. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ka mwoc dong ogoye, latin ocwalo cinge woko, ci lacolo otweyo uci makwar i cinge, kun waconi, “Man aye okwongo kati woko.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Ka dong ongunyo cinge, odwoko cen, ci nen, omine aye dok okati woko, ci dakonu owaco ni, “In dong ituru ki baro dye ic, ikati woko ningning?” Ma omiyo kicako nyinge Perej.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="fk">Perej </char> te loke baro dyere.</note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Ka lacen omine dok kinywalo kun uci makwar tye i cinge; ci kicako nyinge Jera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yucepu ki dako pa Potipar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Jo pa Icmael onongo dong gutero Yucepu woko i Ejipt, ci Potipar ladit tic pa Parao, maloyo acikari lukurpiny, ma Laejipt, owilo en woko ki botgi. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Tic 7:9</ref></char></note>Rwot yam tye ki Yucepu, ci odoko lakomegum; ocako bedo gire i ot pa ladite ma Laejipt. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Ci ladite bene oneno ni Rwot tye kwede, pien Rwot omiyo gin ducu ma en tiyo bedo maber. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Cwiny Potipar obedo yom ikom Yucepu, ci odoko latice. Ocako keto en me bedo ladit maloyo ode ki jamine ducu. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Nia ikare meno ma oketo en me bedo ladit maloyo ode, ki lalo jamine ducu, Rwot ocako miyo gum obedo i ot pa Laejipt meno pi Yucepu; gum pa Rwot opoto ikom jami mayam tye kwede ducu, ma i ot ki ma i potogu. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Ci Potipar omiyo jami ducu ite loc pa Yucepu; pi bedo kwede omiyo dong pe paro gin mo, kono pi cam keken ma en camoni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yucepu onongo nen mabulubulu, dok mwonya matek. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Lacen dako pa ladite cwinye ocako pyete ikom Yucepu, ci owace ni, “But kweda.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Ento en okwero woko, ci owaco bot dako pa laditeni, “Nen ba, pi bedona kany omiyo ladita pe dong paro pi gin mo matye i otti, dok otyeko keto gin ducu ma etye kwede i cinga. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />En pe dong tye ki dit makato an i ot man, pe tye gin mo ma dok okano ma peya omiyo i cinga, kono in keken, pien in i dakone. An dok acore katiyo bal madit marac kuman ningning, kun atimo wa bal ikom Lubanga kulu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Kadi bed dako meno obedo ka bito Yucepu jwijwi, ci pe omedo ki winyo loke, pe oye butu kwede.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Ento ma nino mo acel owec, ma onongo laco mo pe i ot, ikare ma Yucepu odonyo i ot katiyo tice, <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />ci dakonu omake ki bongone, kun waconi, “But kweda.” Ento Yucepu omwome oweko bongone i cinge, okato gire woko ki i ot. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Ka dakonu oneno en oweko bongone i cinge, omwome gire okato woko ki i ot, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ci olwongo co ma gibedo i ode, ci otitigi ni, “Nenu, laditi okelo Laibruni kany me nywarowa; obino bota i ot ni ebut kweda kulu, ci atoke adange ki koko matek. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Ka oneno ni atye kadange kun agore matek ki koko, ci otenyo ginarukane bota, ci omwome okato woko ki i ot.” <verse eid="GEN 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Ci opyelo bongone kangete nio ka won ot odwogo paco. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Otite kit lok acelu, kun waconi, “Opii Laibru ni ma ikelo ikinwa obino bota i ot kanywara; <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />ento ma ailo dwona malo oyotoyot kun adange, ci oweko ginarukane bota, omwome gire woko ki i ot.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Tek Potipar winyo lok ma dakone oloke ni, “Man en aye kit ma opii man otima kwede,” ci kiniga omake matek mada. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Ocako mako Yucepu, oketo i buc, ikabedo ma gitweyo iye lumabuc pa rwot, ci obedo i buc kunu. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:21:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Tic 7:9</ref></char></note>Ento Rwot onongo tye ki Yucepu, ci onyute mar mere ma pe loke, ci omiyo cwiny lagwok ot buc omare. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Lagwok ot buc omiyo twer ki Yucepu me gwoko lumabuc ducu ma gitye i buc; gin ducu ma gitiyo kunu, en aye loyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Lagwok ot buc pe dong paro pi gin mo ma oketo i cing Yucepu, pien onongo Rwot tye kwede; gin ducu ma Yocepu otiyo, Rwot omiyo iye gum.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yucepu ogonyo te lek pa lumabuc</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Ma kare okato, latyer kongo bwino pa rwot me Ejipt ki lated mugatine gubalo inyim rwot. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Kiniga omako Parao ikom ludito tice aryonu, ladit latyer kongo bwino ki ladit me tedo mugati, <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />ci otweyogi i ot kol pa ladit maloyo acikari lukurpiny me gwokogi, i ot kol ma Yucepu bene gitweye iyeni. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Ladit maloyo acikari lukurpiny oketogi i cing Yucepu, en okurugi; ka gitweyogi i ot kol kare mo. <verse eid="GEN 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Ci guleko lek inino mo acel, latyer kongo olok ki lated mugati pa rwot me Ejipt, ma kitweyogi i ot buc; ngat acel acel oleko gire leke, kun lek acel acel tye ki tyen loke. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Ikare ma Yucepu obino botgi odiko, ci onenogi kun gitye ki cwercwiny. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Ci openyo ludito tic aryo pa Parao ma gitye kwede i ot kol i ot pa ladite ni, “Tin cwinywu obale woko pingo?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Gugamo doge ni, “Tin waleko lek, ci pe tye dano mo ma gonyowa te leke.” Yucepu owaco ki gin ni, “Pe Lubanga gire aye lagony tere? Kong wutita leke mono.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Ci latyer kongo bwino olok ocako tito leke bot Yucepu, kun waco ni, “Iwang leka onongo olok tye inyima, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />olok onongo tye ki jange adek; ma pud oluru me keto ture, ci onyak, olugu ocek woko. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Onongo amako kikopo pa Parao i cinga, ci angolo nyige, abiyo i kikopo, ka amiyo kikopo i cing Parao.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yocepu ogamo doge, kun wace ni, “Man aye te leke: jange adeki, meno nino adek; <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />inino me adeke Parao bigonyi woko ci bidwoki cen i dog tici, ci dok ibimiyo kikopo pa Parao i cinge kit macon ca, kit macalo con ikare ma in latyer kongo bwino oloke. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Ento ber ipo pira ka dong idok i dog tici; alegi ni in bene itima ber do, itit pira bot Parao, wek kigonya woko ki i ot man. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Pien yam kikwala akwala ki i lobo pa jo Ibru; man bene dok kiketa kany i ot kol nono ma pe abalo gin mo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Ikare ma ladit me tedo mugati oneno ni kigonyo te lek maber, en owaco ki Yucepu ni, “An bene onongo aleko leka: onongo adodo aduku adek me mugati iwiya. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />I aduku ma malone ca onongo opong ki lwak kit gin ma kitedo ducu pi Parao, ento winyo obedo kacamogi woko ki i aduku matye iwiyani.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yucepu ogamo ni, “Man aye te leke: aduku adek en aye nino adek; <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />inino me adeke Parao bigonyi, ci kibingolo nguti, ci bingabi ikom yat, ka winyo bicamo ringo komi woko.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Inino me adeke, ma en aye nino ma kinywalo iye Parao, ci otedo karama me kwero nino nywale ki lutice ducu, ci Parao okelo ladit latyer kongo bwino kacel ki ladit lated mugati inyim lutice. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Odwoko ladit latyer kongo bwino i dog tice me tyero kongo, ci en otingo kikopo pa Parao omiyo i cinge. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Ento ongabo ladit lated mugati malo ikom yat kit ma nene Yucepu ogonyo kwede te lekgi. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ento ladit latyer kongo bwino pe omedo ki po pi Yucepu, wiye owil woko ikome matwal!<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Yocepu ogonyo te lek pa Parao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Ka mwaka okato aryo kulu, Parao oleko lek ni onongo ecung inget nam Nail, <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />ci nen, dyangi abiro ma komgi pilpil ma gucwe gukati ki i Nail, gubedo kacamo lum tiro. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Dyangi mukene abiro dok gukati woko ki i nam Nail ma komgi omok, gujony woko lingok, ma gulubu korgi, ka gucung ka nget dyangi meno, ma gitye inget nam Nail. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Dyangi ma komgi omok, ma gujony woko lingoki gucamo dyangi ma komgi pilpil mucweni woko. Ci Parao oco woko ki iwang lek. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Ka dok odok cen ka nino, ci dok oleko lek mukene me aryone, oneno wit kal abiro ma ocek olunge, mabeco, ma gujany ikom tyen kal acel. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Dok ingegi oneno wit kal abiro ma gulot gujany ma witgi otwil, ma gubwaro woko pi yamo malyet ma oa ki tung kunyango. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Ci wite abiro ma witgi otwili gumwonyo wit kal ma ocek olunge, ma witgi ngarangarani woko. Ma Parao dok oco woko ki iwang nino, onongo ni dok eleko lek aye. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:2">Dan 2:2</ref></char></note> Piman cwinye obedo ka cwer odiko con; ci ocwalo kwena olwongo lutyet ki luryeko ma i Ejipt ducu. Parao otitigi leke, ento ngat mo pe onen ma otwero gonyo ki Parao te leke.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Ladit latyer kongo bwino owaco ki Parao ni, “Ada tin wiya opo pi rocana. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Ikare ma in Parao ikeco ikom lutici, ci itweya i ot kol kacel ki ladit lated mugati i ot pa ladit maloyo acikari lukur piny, <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />wan ducu waleko lek idyewor acelu, en ki an, waleko lek matyen lokgi patpat. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Latin Ibru mo onongo tye kwedwa, ma obedo latic pa ladit maloyo acikari lukurpiny. Ikare ma watite, ci ogonyiwa te lekwa, kun gonyo te lek pa ngat acel acel kit ma leke tye kwede. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Kit ma en ogonyo te lekwa, ci otime kumeno; an kidwoka i dog tica, ento lated mugati kingabo malo ikom yat.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Ci Parao ocwalo kwena kilwongo Yucepu, kikelo woko aruya ki i ot kol; olyelo wiye, ka oloko bongone, ci ocito odonyo bot Parao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “An onongo aleko lek, ento ngat mo pe ononge matwero gonya te leke; abedo kawinyo ka giloko ikomi ni ka iwinyo lek mo, ci itwero gonyo tere.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yucepu ogamo dog Parao ni, “Meno pe a ki ite twerona; ento Lubanga aye binyutu ki Parao telok man maber.” <verse eid="GEN 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Ci Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Nen, iwang leka onongo acung inget nam Nail; <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />ci dyangi abiro mucwe ma komgi pilpil gukati woko ki i nam Nail, gubedo kacamo lum tiro. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Ka dok dyangi mukene abiro bene gukati woko gulubu korgi ma gigoro, komgi omok ma gujony woko lingok, kit mayam peya aneno i lobo me Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ci dyangi ma komgi omok ma gujony woko lingoki gucamo dyangi abiro mucweni woko. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Ento kadi bed gucamogi woko, pe onen ikomgi ni gucamogi, pien onongo pud gujony woko lingok marom aroma ki kit ma nene gitye kwede. Ci aco woko ki iwang nino. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Dok aneno ki iwang leka wit kal abiro ma gujany ikom tyen kal acel, ma wanggi ngarangara mabeco. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Ka dok wite abiro muner ma wangi atati, ma gubwaro woko pi yamo malyet ma oa i tung kunyango, gulot gudongo ingegi; <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />ci wite ma titinoni gumwonyo wite abiro mabeconi. Ci atito bot lutyet, ento pe tye ngat mo matwero gonya tere.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Yucepu ogamo dog Parao owaco ni, “Lek pa Parao en lek acel; Lubanga dong onyutu ki Parao gin ma en bitiyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Dyangi abiro mabeconi nyutu mwaka abiro, ki wit kal abiro mabeco bene nyutu mwaka abiro; lek aryonu telokgi acel. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Dyangi ma komgi otuk, ma gujony woko lingoki ma dok gukati woko gulubu korgini, ki wit kal abiro ma obware woko pi yamo malyet ma oa i tung kunyango ca, meno nyutu mwaka abiro me kec. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Tye kit macalo dong atito ki Parao, Lubanga onyutu ki Parao gin ma en bitiyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Mwaka abiro bibedo ma cam bicek madwong tutwal i lobo ducu me Ejipt, <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />ento ingegi dok bibino mwaka abiro me kec, ma wi dano biwil woko i lwak camgi ma guceko i lobo Ejipt. Kec bimako lobo Ejipt woko ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Ki lonyo cam mayam dwongi pe binen ni yam tye i lobo pi kec ma bilubune, pien kec meno bibedo gwa matek. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Kit ma lek meno otime tyen aryoni nyutu ni lok man Lubanga aye omoko, dok bimiyo time ikare macok.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Ma omiyo ikare man in omyero iyer dano manen kwiri, maryek, ci iket en oloo lobo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Dok myero iketo lutela me doro wi dano, wek gubed kajogo dul acel me abic me cam ma bicek i lobo Ejipt ikin mwaka abiro ma cam bicek iyeni. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Wek gin gubed ki twero me guru cam ki me gwokone i mwaka mabeco ma cam bicek iyeni, wek gugwok woko ite twero ni, i gangi ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Cam meno bibedo i dero me agwoka ma kibigwoko i lobo Ejipt ducu pi kec ma bipoto i mwaka abiro mukene ca ma bibinoni, wek kec pe onek dano i lobo man.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yucepu odoko latela i lobo Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Tam ma Yucepu omiyo onen maber bot Parao, kacel ki lutice ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Piman Parao owaco ki lutice ni, “Watwero nongo dano mukene macalo man ki kwene, ma cwiny pa Lubanga tye kwede bene?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Ci Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Kit macalo Lubanga dong otyeko nyuti telok magi ducu wokoni, pe dong tye dano mo manen kwiri, dok maryek calo in. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:40:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:10">Tic 7:10</ref></char></note>In aye dong ibiloyo oda, ki lwaka ducu gibitiyo kun gilubu gin ma iciko; ento lok ma dok ikom komker keken, en aye bimiyo abedo dit makati.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Parao dok owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Nen, dong atyeko keti me loyo lobo Ejipt ducu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:42:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:29">Dan 5:29</ref></char></note> Ci Parao okwanyo lagit me ker ma olunyu ki i cinge, orwako i cing Yucepu, dok oruke ki ginaruka me bongo camanini pa luker maber, ka dok oruku nyor jabu i ngute. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Ci Parao omiyo en oringo ki gadigadine ma ngat malubu kor Parao aye ringo kwede, kun dano gidange inyime ni, “Rumu congwu piny!” Ci oketo en me loyo lobo Ejipt ducu kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Parao dok omede kalok ki Yucepu kun wace ni, “An Parao; ka in pud peya imoko lok mo, ci pe bibedo ngat mo ma bitingo cinge nyo tyene i lobo ducu me Ejipt me timo gin mo.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Ci Parao ocako nying Yucepu ni Japengat-panea; ci omiye Acenaci nya pa Potipera ajwaka me On me bedo dakone. Ci Yucepu ocako wot orumu lobo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yucepu onongo dong mwaka me dite romo pyere adek ikare ma odonyo i tic pa Parao rwot me Ejipt. Yucepu okato woko ki inyim Parao, ci owoto orumu lobo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Ci cam ocek i lobo madwong tutwal pir mwaka abiro, <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />ci Yucepu ocoko cam ducu ma ocek i mwaka abironi ikare ma lobo Ejipt oceko cam madwong, ci okano cam i dero i gangi ducu; i gang acel acel en okano cam ma oa i poti ma gurumu kenyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yucepu okano lwak cam madwong i dero; cam obedo dwong marom ki kweyo ma i dog nam, nio ka oweko pimone pien pe twero pime.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Ma mwaka kec peya oromo, onongo Yucepu dong tye ki lutino awobe aryo, ma Acenaci nya pa Potipera ajwaka me On onywal kwede. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yucepu ocako nying latin kayone ni Manace, kun waconi, “Pien Lubanga dong omiyo wiya owil woko ki ikom aromana ducu ki ikom jo ducu me ot pa wora.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Nying latin me aryone ocako ni Epraim ni, “Pien Lubanga omiya anywal i lobo ma abedo iye ki aroma.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Ka mwaka abiro ma cam obedo kacek iye madwong tutwal i lobo Ejipt dong ogik, <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:11">Tic 7:11</ref></char></note>ci mwaka abiro me kec ocake, kit mayam Yucepu owaco ni. Kec opoto i lobo ducu; ento i lobo Ejipt ducu onongo cam tye. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:55:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:5">Jon 2:5</ref></char></note>Ka cam dong otum woko i lobo Ejipt ducu pi kec ma opoto, dano gucako koko pi cam bot Parao; ci Parao owaco ki jo Ejipt ducu ni, “Wucit bot Yucepu wutim gin ma owaciwu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Ka kec opoto oromo lobo Ejipt ducu, ci Yucepu ocako yabo dog dero cam ducu, ocato cam bot jo Ejipt, pien onongo kec dong lyet tutwal i lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Lobo ducu gucako mol i Ejipt bot Yucepu kawilo kal, pien onongo kec dong lyet tutwal iwi lobo ducu.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Omegi Yucepu gucito i Ejipt pi wilo cam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Ikare ma Yakobo owinyo ni cam tye i Ejipt, owaco bot awobene ni, “Pingo wubedo kanene anena?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:12">Tic 7:12</ref></char></note>Ka owaco botgi ni, “Nen, an awinyo ni cam tye i Ejipt; wucit wuwil ki wan ki kunu, wek wabedu kwo, pe wato ki kec.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Ma omiyo omegi Yucepu apar gucito i Ejipt kawilo cam. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Ento Yakobo pe ocwalo Benjamin, omin Yucepu, kacel kwedgi, pien obedo kalworo ni gwok dok kibitime rac bene. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Kitmeno awobe pa Icrael gucito kawil ikin jo mukene ma gicito kunu, pien onongo kec oromo lobo Kanaan ducu.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Ikare meno onongo Yucepu odoko laloc maber i lobo Ejipt; en obedo kacato cam bot lwak me lobo meno. Ci omegi Yucepu bene gubino, gupoto piny aryeba cwiny inyime, kun gukulo wangi i ngom. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yucepu oneno omegine, ci ongeyogi cut, ento obedo kigero ikomgi, kun terogi calo lurok ata, kun gere agera ni, “Wun wua ki kwene?” Gugamo ni, “Waa ki i lobo Kanaan, wabino ka wilo cam.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Kadi bed Yucepu ongeyo omegine, ento gin pe gumedo ki ngene. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5-10">Aca 37:5-10</ref></char></note>Yucepu ocako poo lek mayam eleko ikomgini; dok owacigi ni, “Wun lurot piny do, wun wubino kakengo lobowa wek wuniang ka goro nyo pe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Gugamo doge ni, “Pe kumeno laditwa, wan lutici wabino giwa kawilo cam. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Wan ducu awobe pa ngat acel, wan jo ma cwinywa leng, wan pe lurot piny.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Owaco ki gin ni, “Pe ya, wun wubino mewu kakengowa wek wunen ka wan wagoro nyo watek.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Gugamo dok ni, “Wan ducu onongo watye omego apar wiye aryo, ma awobe pa laco acel matye i lobo Kanaan; ci ominwa matidine odong bot wonwa, ki acel aye dong oto woko.” <verse eid="GEN 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yucepu owaco ki gin ni, “Dong kara tye kit ma awaco ki wun, ni wun lurot piny. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Man aye dong kit ma wabiniang ni wun kitwu atir: macalo Parao tye makwoni, wun pe dong wubicito kamo, ka ominwu matidini pe obino kany. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Wucwal ngat acel ikinwu, wek en ocit okel ominwu, kun nongo wun pud wudong kany i buc, wek lokwu kong ginen maber, ka wun wutye ki ada i iwu. Ka pe, macalo Parao tye makwo ni, wun lurot piny i ada.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Ci oketogi ducu i ot kol pi nino adek.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Ka nino adek oromo, ci Yucepu owaco botgi ni, “Wutim kit man ci wubikwo, pien alworo Lubanga. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ka wun jo ma iwu leng, wuwek ngat acel aye gitwe odong i buc, wek jo mukene gucit paco guter kal ki jo ma paco pi larogi ki kec. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ka wucit wukel ominwu matidini bota; miyo binen ni lokwu dong tye ada, ci pe wubito.” Ci gutimo kitmeno. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Gucako lok gigi keken gi ni, “I adane, wan waroco ikom ominwa, pien waneno cwercwinye, ka yam bako doge botwa, ci pe wamedo ki winyone; ma omiyo tin can man opoto ikomwa bene.” <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21-22">Aca 37:21-22</ref></char></note>Reuben owacigi ni, “Yam pe awaco ki wun ni pe wutim bal mo ikom latin ca? Ento wun pe wumedo ki winyo, en aye ma omiyo kipido pi remone ikomwa ni.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Pe gumedo ki niang ni Yucepu winyo lokgi ni, pien onongo lagony leb aye tye ikin gi. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yocepu oa woko ki botgi ci ocako koko; lacen ma odok botgi kalok kwedgi, omako Cimeon ki ikin gi ci oweko gitweye woko ki inyimgi.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omegi Yucepu gudwogo i Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yucepu ociko ni dong kipik kal opong kicaa pa omegine, ka dok lim pa ngat acel acel bene kipik kidwok cen i kicaane, dok gumi botgi peke me wotgi. Man ducu kitimo botgi.<verse eid="GEN 42:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Gutweyo kal inge kanagi, ci gucako wot. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ka guo ikabedo ma gubutu iyeni, ngat acel oyabo dog kicaane wek emii cam ki kanane, ci oneno lim kiketo i dog kicaane. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Owaco ki omegine ni, “Lima ducu gidwoko kakare. Nen, tye i kicaana ene.” Ma guwinyo, ci cwinygi opoto lirut, gubedo kacabe keken gi ki myelkom kun giwaco ni, “Lubanga otimowa kuman pingo?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Ikare ma gudwogo bot won gi Yakobo i lobo Kanaan, gutite gin ducu ma otime ikomgi, kun giwaco ni, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Dano ma ladit me lobo Ejipt obedo kalok ki gero, kun tongo lok ikomwa ni wan lurot piny dok wabino kakengo lobogi. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ento wan watite ni, ‘Wan jo ma lulok ada, wan pe lurot piny. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Wan omego apar wiye aryo ma wonwa acel. Ominwa acel aye dong oto, ki acel matidine tye odong bot wonwa i lobo Kanaan.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Ci dano meno, ladit me lobonu, owaco botwa ni, ‘Man aye miyo abiniang ni wun jo ma lulok ada: wuwek ominwu acel odong bota, wuciti, wuter kal me laro kec ki jo ma i pacowu. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Wucit wukel ominwu matidini bota, ci dong abingeyo ni wun pe lurot piny, ento wun jo ma lulok ada, ci dong abimiyo ominwu i cingwu, dok wubicato wil i loboni.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Ikare ma gitye ka onyo kal ma i kicaagi, ci gin ducu gunongo lim ma nene guboyo ca tye i kicaagi. Ma gin ki won gi guneno lim ma giboyo, ci lworo omakogi matek. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Wongi Yakobo owaco ni, “Wumito tyeko lutinona woko liweng? Yucepu dong pe, Cimeon bene dong pe, dok wumito tero Benjamin woko; man ducu cane poto iwiya.” <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Reuben owaco ki wone ni, “Ka pe adwogo Benjamin cen boti ci ibineko lutino awobena aryoni ducu. Ket en i cinga, abigwoke dok abidwoge paco boti.” <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Ento Yakobo ogamo ni, “Woda pe bicito kwedwu kunu, pien omine dong oto mere woko, en kene aye odong. Gin mo marac dok twero time ikome i dog wotwuni. An dong atii woko dok cwercwinye bineka woko lutuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Omegi Yucepu gudok i Ejipt ki Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Kec omede odoko lyet tutwal i lobo Kanaan, <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />dok kal ma onongo gikelo ki i Ejipt dong otum woko. Ci Yakobo owaco ki awobene ni, “Wudok kunu, wucit wuwil ki wan cam mo manok.” <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Juda ogamo doge ni, “Laco ca ocikowa matek kun waco ni, ‘Pe kibikelowu inyima ka ominwu Benjamin pe ikinwu.’” <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ka icwalo ominwa owoto kwedwa, ci wabicito kunu kawili cam; <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />ento ka pe icwalo en, pe wabicito kunu, pien laco ca owaco botwa ni, “Pe kibiterowa inyime ka ominwa Benjamin pe kwedwa.” <verse eid="GEN 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Yakobo owaco ni, “Pingo wutima marac kuman? Pingo dok wutito ki laconu ni wutye ki ominwu mukene?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Gudok iye ni, “Laco ca openyowa ki lwak peny mapol ikomwa ki ikom kakawa, kun waco ni, ‘Wonwu pud tye makwo? Ominwu mukene tye?’” Wan wagamo lapeny ducu ma mako gin ma openyo; onongo watwero ngeyo ningning ni en biwaco ni, “Wukel ominwu kany.” <verse eid="GEN 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Juda owaco bot wone Icrael ni, “Mii latin i cinga, cwale wawot kwede, ci wabia wacito, wek wabed kwo, pe wato, wan kacel ki in ki lutinowa bene. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />An abicung pire; ibipenya pire. Kace pe abikelo en boti ikare ma adwogo, akete inyimi, ci wek an aye abed won alii matwal. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Pien ka nene pe wagale, kono man dong wawire kunu kiryo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Ci won gi Icrael dok owaco botgi ni, “Ka dong myero obed kitmeno, ci wukwany ginacama mabeco ma nonge i lobo kany wupik i kicaawu, wek wuter macalo mot ki ladit lobo meno, moo makur manok ki moo kic, odok yat ki murra, nyig otitimo ki yaa. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Dok wuter lim maromo culu wil tyen aryo; wuting lim ma nene gidwoko kiketo i dog kicaawuni; gwok nyo yam wigi owil awila. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Wua wucito ki ominwu Benjamin bot laconu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Lubanga Matwero ducu omii kica omak laconu ikomwu, wek ocwal ominwu mukene ca gin ki Benjamin gudwog cen. Ka kityeko lutinona woko, dong gityeka arumu do!” <verse eid="GEN 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Ci gutero mot, ki wel lim ma dodo tyen aryo, kacel ki Benjamin; gua gucito i Ejipt, gucung inyim Yucepu.<verse eid="GEN 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Ka Yucepu oneno ni Benjamin tye ikin gi, ci owaco bot lakan jamine me ot ni, “Kel jonu i ot. Cit inek lee wek iyubi pien gin koni gibicam kweda i dyeceng.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Latic meno otiyo kit ma Yucepu ocike, okelo jonu i ot pa Yucepu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Lworo omakogi ikare ma giterogi i ot pa Yucepu, guwaco ni, “Man kikelowa i otti pi lok me lim, ma nene kidwoko kiketo i dog kicaawa ikare mukwongo ca. Koni dong gipoto ikomwa, gimakowa, ka dok gimayo lwak kanawa woko wek wadok opiine.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Pimeno gucito bot lakan jami me ot pa Yucepu, guloko kwede ki i dogola, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />guwace ni, “Ladita, wan yam wabino kany kawilo cam ikare mukwongo ca. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Ikare ma wao ikabedo ma wabutu iyeni, wagonyo dog kicaawa, ci wanongo lim tye i dog kicaa pa ngat acel acel ma ikinwa, limwa ducu onongo tye ki bere; en watyeko dwogo kwedeni. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Kombedi dok wabino ki lim mukene me wilo cam, pe wangeyo ngat ma oketo limwa i kicaawa.” <verse eid="GEN 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />En ogamo ni, “Wuywe ma cwinywu opye mot, pe lworo omakwu. Lubanga ma Lubanga pa wonwu en aye gwok nyo okano ki wun lim i kicaawu; an agamo limwu ma lacengman wuculuni gire.” Ci ocito okelo Cimeon botgi. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Latic meno oterogi i ot pa Yucepu, omiyogi pii me lwoko tyen gi, ka dok omiyo cam ki kanagi. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Guyubu motgi me atyera bot Yucepu ka bidwogo i dyeceng, pien guwinyo ni gibicam kwede.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Ikare ma Yucepu odwogo paco, gutero motgi bote i ot, guryebe piny inyime. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Openyogi ka gitye maber, kun waco ni, “Wonwu ma nene wuloko pire ni dong otii woko ni pud tye makwo?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Gugamo ni, “Latici ma wonwa tye maber, pud tye makwo.” Gukulo wigi piny, guryebe inyime. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Ma Yocepu oneno omine Benjamin, latin pa mine, ci owaco ni, “Man aye ominwu matidini bo, ma nene wutita pireni? Lubanga omini gum, latina!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yucepu okato woko oyot, pien onongo cwinye puke pi omine, ocito oyenyo kama myero ekok iye. Ci odonyo kakoko i kicikane. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Lacen olwoko wange, okati woko kun diyo cwinye, ci owaco ni, “Dong kitok cam.” <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Kitoko cam pa Yocepu kene pat, ki pa omegine bene pat, ki pa Luejipt mayam gicamo kwedgi bene pat kaken gi, pien Luejipt pe gicamo kacel ki jo Ibru, bedo me kwer ki bot Luejipt. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Omegine gubedo piny inyime, cake ki ikom kayo nio ikom latin cogo; ci gucako bedo kanene keken gi kun giuru. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Kipoko botgi cam kun kitoko a ki i meja pa Yucepu, ento pa Benjamin kipoko mere ododo pa omegine tyen abic kulu. Kitmeno gucamo dok gumato, kun gubedo kwede ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Kikopo pa Yucepu orwenyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Yucepu ociko lakan jami me ot ni, “Pik cam opong kicaa pa jonu, mabup, ma gitwero tingo; dok iket lim pa ngat acel acel i dog kicaane. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Ci dok iket kikopona me ryali, i dog kicaa pa latin matidini, kacel ki lime me wilo kal.” En otimo kit ma Yucepu owace. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Ka piny dong oru maleng, ci gucwalo jonu gukato woko kacel ki kanagi. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ikare ma pud guwoto manok keken nia ki i gang, Yucepu owaco ki lakan jamine ni, “Dong ilub kor jonu; ka imakogi, ci iwac botgi ni, ‘Pingo wuculu gin maber ki gin marac? Pingo wukwalo kikopo ryal ma mera woko? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Pe rwoda mato ki kikopo meno? Dok pe en aye tyeto kwede bene? Wutimo rac mada.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ikare ma omakogi i yo, ci owaco ki gin lok meno. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Gugamo doge kun giwaco ni, “Gin ango ma omiyo in laditwa iloko lakit lok meno? Wan lutici pe myero watim lakit tim macalo meno! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Nen ba, lim ma nene wanongo i dog kicaawa, wadwoko cen boti nia wa ki i lobo Kanaan; dok wan myero wakwal ryal nyo jabu ki i ot pa laditwa ningning? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Kace kibinongo tye bot ngat mo ikinwa, wek en aye oto, wan bene wabibedo opiini laditwa.” <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />En ogamo ni, “Wuwek kong dong obed kit ma wuwaconi: ngat ma kibinongo kikopo bote aye bibedo opiina, jo mukene bal bibedo pe ikomgi.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Ngat acel acel ocako cibo yece piny oyotoyot, ci guyabo dog kicaagi. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Latic pa Yocepu oyako kicaagi nia ki kom pa ladit nio wa kom latin, ci ginongo kikopo i kicaa pa Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Gucako yeco bongigi pi cwercwiny, gin ducu gutweyo yec inge kanagi, gudok cen i Ejipt.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Ikare ma Juda ki omegine gudok i ot pa Yucepu, gunongo en pud tye kenyo; gupoto, guryebe piny inyime. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Ci Yucepu owacigi ni, “Wun wutimo kit tim macalo man pingo? Wun pe wungeyo ni dano macalo an ngeyo tyet?” <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Juda ogamo kun waco ni, “Kit lok ango ma wan watwero gamo ne ladit? Wabipido ki lok ango kono? Wabikwanyo bal wa kekenwa ningning? Lubanga dong otyeko nongo bal ikomwa woko; nen, wan tin wadoko opiini, laditwa, wan ducu kacel ki ngat ma ginongo kikopo boteni.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Ento en ogamo ni, “An pe atwero timo kit eno! Ento ngat ma ginongo kikopo boteni, aye bibedo opiina; ento ki tung botwu wun wudok mewu bot wonwu ki kuc.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda opido pi Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Juda ocako cito bote, owace ni, “Alegi ladita, ye wek alok lok mo kwedi, pe iwek kinigani obed lyet ikoma, pien in irom ki Parao kikome. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Ladit, in yam ipenyowa ni, ‘Wun wutye ki wonwu, onyo omegiwu?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Wan wagamo dogi ni, ‘Watye ki wonwa, dano ma otii dong, ki ominwa matidine latin me tiyone.’ Omine aye oto woko, en aye odong latin acel i kor mine; wone bene maro en. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Ka dok iwaco botwa ni, ‘Wukel en bota, wek anen kome.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Wan watito boti ni, ‘Latin awobinu pe twero weko ka nget wone; kace opoke woko ki wone, ci wone to woko.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ento in onongo iwaco botwa ni, ‘Ka ominwu matidini pe obino kany kacel kwedwu, pe dok wubibino inyima.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Ka wadok paco bot wonwa ladit, ci watite loki ducu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Ka wonwa owaco ni, “Wudok cen wek wucit wuwil ki wan cam mo manok. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Wan wawace ni, ‘Pe watwero dok ka ominwa matidini pe bicito kwedwa. Pien pe wabicito inyim laco ca, ka ominwa matidine pe ikinwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Ci wora owaco ki wan ni, ‘Wun wungeyo ni dakona Lakeri onywalo lutino awobe aryo keken; <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />acel oweka woko, ci yam awaco ni ada nguu okide woko, pe dok amedo ki nene matwal. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Ka dok wukwanyo man woko ki bota, ce gin marac bipoto ikome, ci wubineka woko ki cwercwiny kit macalo dong atii woko ni.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Ma omiyo ka an adok bot wora ma latin awobini pe ikinwa, ci en bito woko, pien kwo ne ocung ikom latin awobini. <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />Miyo wabineko wonwa woko ki cwercwiny kit macalo dong otii woko ni. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />An nene acung pi latin awobi man bot wora, kun awace ni, ka pe abidwoko en boti, an abibedo won alii inyim ikare me kwona ducu. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Ma omiyo kombedi alegi ni ber iye an opiini, adong ma ka latin awobi man, abed opiini ladit; wek latin man odok paco kacel ki omegine. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Pien atwero dok paco bot wora ningning, ka pe latini tye kweda? Alworo neno gin marac ka poto ikom wora.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yucepu onyute kekene bot omegine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:1:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:13">Tic 7:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yucepu pe dong otwero diyo cwinye ki inyim lutice ducu ma gucung kangete, ci odange ni, “Wuwek dano ducu gua gukat woko ki bota, gucit cen.” Kitmeno ngat mo pe odong bote ikare ma en nyute kekene bot omegine. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ocako koko matek ma Luejipt bene giwinyo, ki jo ma i gangkal pa Parao bene guwinyo pire. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yucepu owaco bot omegine ni, “An a Yucepu; wora mono pud tye makwo?” Ento omegine pe gitwero gamo doge, pien tipu komgi oto woko inyime.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yucepu owaco bot omegine ni, “Alegowu, wubin bota cok.” Gucito cok bote. Owaco ki gin ni, “An aye ominwu Yucepu, mayam wucato i Ejipt. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Pe dong wubed ki cwercwiny, dok cwinywu bene pe owang ikomwu kekenwu pi cato an kany; pien Lubanga aye yam ocwala kany inyimwu, wek akony kwo pa dano. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Pien kec dong obedo i lobo pi mwaka aryo; pud dok odong mwaka abic ma pur ki kac bibedo pe. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Lubanga ocwalo an inyimwu me larowu wek wudong makwo i lobo, ki pi gwoko ki wun jo mapol ma gibibwot makwo. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Pien wun aye yam pe wucwala kany, ento Lubanga gire; omiyo an adoko lamitam bot Parao, ki lalo ode ducu ki lalo lobo Ejipt ducu. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:9:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Tic 7:14</ref></char></note>Wutim oyot, wucit bot wora, wucit wuwace ni, latini Yucepu owaco kuman ni, ‘Lubanga oketa abedo laloyo i Ejipt ducu; bin bota kany, pe dok iruu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Ibibedo i lobo Gocen, i bibedo cok kweda, in ki lutinoni ki lutino pa lutinoni ducu, ki dyegini ki dyangini ki gin ma itye kwedgi ducu. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Abipito in kunu pien pud dok odong mwaka me kec mukene abic anyim; omiyo pe amito ni in ki jo ma i paconi, ki gin ma itye kwedgi ducu me to ki kec.’” <verse eid="GEN 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Yocepu dok omede ki waco ni, “Kombedi dong wangwu ducu, ki wang omera Benjamin bene oneno ni an kikoma aye atye kalok kwedwu ki doga, <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Myero wun wucitit bot wora kit deyona ducu ma atye kwede i Ejipt, ki gin ducu madong wuneno. Wucit oyot, wek wukel wora kany.” <verse eid="GEN 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Ocako gwako kor omine Benjamin ki koko, ki Benjamin bene okok i ngute. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Ka onoto lem omegine ducu kun kok; ka dong lacen omegine gucako boko lok kwede.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Ma lok man owinye i ot pa Parao ni, “Omegi Yucepu gubino,” pire oyomo cwiny Parao ki lutice matek. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Wac bot omegini ni, ‘Wutim kit man, wutwe yecwu inge kanawu, wek wudok cen i lobo Kanaan. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Wucit wugam wonwu ki jowu, wek wubin bota; abimiyowu gin mabeco matye i lobo Ejipt, wubicamo gin mabeco matye i lobo man.’<verse eid="GEN 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Dok icikgi ni, ‘Wutim kit man: wuter gadigadi nia ki i lobo Ejipt kany pi lutinowu matino ki pi monwu, wek wukel wonwu kany. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Pe wupar pi jamiwu, pien jami mabeco matye i lobo Ejipt ducu mewu.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Awobe pa Icrael gutimo kitmeno; Yucepu omiyogi gadigadi kit macalo Parao ociko, ka dok omiyogi peke me wotgi. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Omiyo bot ngat acel acel ducu bongi mabeco me aruka, ento bot Benjamin omiyo cekel me ryal miya adek ki ruk mabeco abic. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Ocwalo bot wone jami magi: kana apar ma guyene ki jami mabeco ma oa ki i Ejipt, ki megi kana apar ma guyeyo kal, ki cam, ki peke me wot pa won gi. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Ka dong ocwalo omegine gucito. Ka dong gia ocikogi ni, “Pe wubed ka da i yo.” <verse eid="GEN 45:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Gua woko ki i Ejipt, ci gudok i lobo Kanaan bot won gi Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ka gutite ni, “Yucepu pud tye makwo, en aye ladit maloyo lobo Ejipt ducu!” Ci tipu kome oto woko lirut, pien onongo petwero ye lokgi. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Ento madong gutite lok kom Yucepu ducu, kit ma ocikogi kwede, ka dok pi neno lwak gadigadi ma Yucepu ocwalo pi tingo en, ka tipu kom won gi ocako dwogo. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ka Icrael ocako lok ni, “Dong aye, woda Yucepu kara pud tye makwo; abiwot acito kanene ma pud peya ato.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ocito i Ejipt kacel ki jo me ode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Icrael ocako wot ki jami mayam en tye kwedgi ducu ocito i Beer-ceba, ci otyero gitum bot Lubanga pa wone Icaka. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Lubanga oloko ki Icrael iwang lek dyewor kun lwonge ni, “Yakobo, Yakobo.” En ogamo ni, “An a ene.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Owace ni, “An Lubanga, Lubanga pa woru; pe ilwor cito i Ejipt, pien abimiyi idoko rok madit ki kunu. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Abicito kwedi wa i Ejipt, dok abidwoki cen bene; doki ikare ma ibito Yucepu bibedo kacel kwedi.” <verse eid="GEN 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Yakobo ocako wot ki i Beer-ceba, kun awobene gutinge, kacel ki lutinogi matino, ki mon gi, i gadigadi ma Parao ocwalo me tingogi. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Tic 7:15</ref></char></note>Gutero limgi makwo ki jamigi mayam gulimo ki i lobo Kanaan, gucito kwede i Ejipt; gutero Yakobo ki lutinone ki likwaye ducu. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />En ocito i Ejipt ki awobene ki anyirane ducu, wa ki likwaye ma co ki ma anyira.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Man aye nying likwayo pa Icrael ma gucito i Ejipt: Yakobo ki awobene. Reuben, latin kayo pa Yakobo, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />ki awobe pa Reuben, aye Kanok, Pallu, Kejeron ki Karmi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Awobe pa Cimeon aye Jemuel, Jamin, Okad, Jakin, Jokar ki Caul, ma awobi pa dako Lakanaan. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Awobe pa Levi aye Gercon, Kokat ki Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Awobe pa Juda aye Er, Onan, Cela, Perej ki Jera, ento Er ki Onan guto woko i lobo Kanaan; awobe pa Perej aye Kejeron ki Kamul. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Awobe pa Icakar aye Tola, Puwa, Iob, ki Cimron. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Awobe pa Jabulon aye Cered, Elon ki Jaleel. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Meno aye awobe pa Lea ma en onywalo ki Yakobo i Paddan-aram, kacel ki nyare Dina; wel lutino awobene ki anyirane giromo pyere adek wiye adek.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Awobe pa Gad aye Jipion, Kagi, Cuni, Ejibon, Eri, Arodi ki Areli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Awobe pa Acer aye Imna, Iciva, Icivi, Beria ki Cera ma lamingi. Awobe pa Beria aye Keber ki Malkiel. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Meno aye lutino awobe pa Jilpa, ma Laban omiyo bot Lea; en onywalo ki Yakobo lutino apar wiye abicel.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Awobe pa Lakeri dako pa Yakobo aye Yucepu ki Benjamin. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:20:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50-52">Aca 41:50-52</ref></char></note>Yucepu onywalo Manace ki Epraim ki i lobo Ejipt, ma Acenaci, nya, pa Potipera ajwaka me On aye onywalogi. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Awobe pa Benjamin aye Bela, Beker, Acibel, Gera, Naaman, Eki, Roc, Mupim, Kupim ki Arud. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Meno aye awobe pa Lakeri ma en onywalo ki Yakobo, lutino ducu apar wiye angwen. <verse eid="GEN 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Awobi pa Dan aye Kucim. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Awobe pa Naputali aye Jajeel, Guni, Jejer ki Cilem. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Meno aye likwayo pa Bila ma Laban yam omiyo ki nyare Lakeri; en onywalo ki Yakobo lutino ducu abiro. <verse eid="GEN 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Jo ducu ma tung bot Yakobo mayam ocito kwedgi i Ejipt, ma gin yam lutinone ki likwaye kikome, ma pe gikwano iye mon pa lutino awobene onongo giromo jo pyerabicel wiye abicel. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Tic 7:14</ref></char></note>Ki lutino awobe ma nene Yucepu onywalogi ki i Ejipt, nene gin awobe aryo. Pieno jo ducu ma tung bot Yakobo ma gucito i Ejipt giromo pyere abiro.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ki jo ma i ode i Ejipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo ocwalo Juda anyim bot Yucepu, wek gurwate i Gocen. Ma guo i lobo Gocen, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yucepu oyubu gadigadine me cito karwate ki wone Icrael i Gocen. Ma gurwate, ci ocito bote ka opoto i ngute kun kok kwede pi kare mo malac. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Icrael owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Kombedi do aromo to, pien dong aneno wangi, aniang ni pud i kwo ada.” <verse eid="GEN 46:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yucepu owaco ki omegine ki jo ma i ot pa wone ni, “Abidok katito ki Parao, abiwace ni, ‘Omega ki jo ma i ot pa wora, mayam gitye i lobo Kanaan, dong gutyeko bino bota; <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />gin lukwat, pien gin yam lukwat dyangi; dok gin gubino ki dyegigi ki dyangigi, ki gin ducu ma gitye kwede.’ <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Kace Parao olwongowu, ka openyowu ni, ‘Wun wutiyo tic ango?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Wun wubidok iye ni, ‘Wan lutici wan lukwat dyangi nia ka tinowa nio kwede wa onyo, wan kacel ki kwarowa.’ Man bimiyo wun wubibedo i Gocen, pien bedo me kwer bot Luejipt me bedo ki lakwat mo.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Ci Yucepu okwanyo omegine abic ocito kwedgi bot Parao. Otite ni, “Wora ki omega gutyeko bino ki i lobo Kanaan, ki dyegigi ki dyangigu ki jamigi ducu; kombedi dong gitye i lobo Gocen.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Ci okwanyo omegine, oterogi, onyutugi bot Parao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Parao openyo omegine ni, “Wun wutiyo tic ango?” Gin guwaco bot Parao ni, “Ladit, wan lukwat macalo kwariwa.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ka guwaco bot Parao ni, “Wan dong wabino kabedo i loboni; pien kec opoto malyet tutwal i lobo Kanaan oweko ka kwayo limwa odoko peke woko; kombedi walegi ni, wek wabed i lobo Gocen.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Woru ki omegini dong gubino boti. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Lobo Ejipt tye boti, ket woru ki omegini i lobo mabere, wek gubed i lobo Gocen; ka ingeyo ikin gi jo makwiri, ci iketgi gubed ludito ma gwoko lima.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Lacen Yucepu okelo wone Yakobo, okete inyim Parao, ci Yakobo olamo gum ikom Parao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Parao openyo Yakobo ni, “In mono dong irii wi lobo mwaka adi ka?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo owaco bot Parao ni, “An dong arii wi lobo mwaka miya acel ki pyere adek macalo labedo. Ento mwaka ma ari kwede pud nok, dok opong ki can, peya rom ki mwaka pa kwarina ma gubedo kwede macalo lubedo.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Yakobo olamo gum ikom Parao, ka dong okato woko ki inyime. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yucepu omiyo ki wone ki omegine kabedo i lobo Ejipt, i ngom mabere, i Ramcec, kun miyogi lobo wek obed megi, kit macalo Parao ociko. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yucepu ocako poko cam ki wone, ki omegine ki bot jo ducu me ot pa wone, kun lubu wel jo matye botgi.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Yucepu ikare me kec</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Ikare meno onongo cam dong pe i lobo ducu; pien onongo kec dong lyet tutwal, omiyo jo ma i lobo Ejipt ki i lobo Kanaan kec obwoyogi woko. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yucepu ocoko cente ducu mayam tye i lobo Ejipt ki i lobo Kanaan, mayam dano guwilo ki cam; ci otero i ot pa Parao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Ka cente dong otum woko ki i lobo Ejipt ki i lobo Kanaan bene, ci jo Ejipt ducu gubino bot Yucepu, guwaco ni, “Miniwa cam; myero wato ki ikomi ma ineno pingo? Pien centewa dong otum woko.” <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yucepu ogamo ni, “Wumiya lim makwo, ci an abimiyowu cam aloko ki dyangwu, ka limwu me cente dong otum woko.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Gucako kelo limgi makwo bot Yucepu, aguragura, romi, dyangi ki kana; ci Yucepu olokogi ki cam. I mwaka meno opoko botgi cam pi lwak lim makwo ma gukelo.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Ka mwaka meno dong otum, ci gubino bote i mwaka ma lubune, kun giwace ni, “Wan pe dong wakano lok mo boti, laditwa, centewa dong watyeko woko ducu; ki lim makwo dong odoko pa laditwa; gin mo pe ma odong inyim laditwa, kono komwa ki lobowa keken. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Myero wato ki ikomi ma inenowa pingo, myero wato wa wek lobowa odong nono pingo? In i wilwa ki cam kacel ki lobowa, wan kacel ki lobowa wabibedo opii pa Parao; dok imiwa kodi wek wabed makwo, pe wato, wek lobo pe odong nono.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Kitmeno Yucepu owilo lobo ducu me Ejipt obedo pa Parao; pien Luejipt ducu gucato potigi woko, pi kec ma onongo dong lyet tutwal. Lobo odoko pa Parao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yucepu oloko dano ducu gubedo opii, nia i agiki lobo Ejipt tung cel, nio tung cel. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Lobo pa ajwaki keken aye pe giwilo, pien ajwaki onongo gitye ki camgi ma a ki i cing Parao; onongo gubedo kacamo gin ma Parao miyogi, ma omiyo pe gucato lobogi. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yucepu dok owaco bot lwak ni, “Nen, ikare man atyeko wilowu ki lobo mewu me bedo pa Parao. Kombedi dong wugam kodi ma wubicoyo i lobo. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Ikare me kac wubimiyo acel me abic bot Parao, ki dul angwen me abic bibedo mewu, pi kodi me acoya i potiwu, ki pi camwu, ki jo ma i pacowu, ki cam pa lutinowu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Gugamo ni, “Dong ityeko laro kwowa, wek cwinyi obed yom ikom wa ladit, wan wabibedo opii pa Parao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Pi lok man Yucepu oketo odoko cik i lobo Ejipt, pud tye nio wa onyo ni, Parao myero oter dul acel me abic. Lobo pa ajwaki keken aye pe odoko pa Parao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo ociko Yucepu me agikine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Jo Icrael gubedo i lobo Ejipt, i lobo Gocen; gunongo iye lim, gumede, ci gunya mapol. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo obedo i lobo Ejipt mwaka apar wiye abiro; kitmeno nino pa Yakobo, mwaka me kwo ne ducu oromo miya acel ki pyere angwen wiye abiro.<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:29:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:29-32">Aca 49:29-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:6">50:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ka kare me to pa Icrael dong onyiko cok, ci olwongo wode Yucepu, owace ni, “Ka imar ci ber dong, irwak cingi, odony ki piny ite ema, icike kweda ki gen ki ada ni, pe ibiyika i Ejipt. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Ento wek acit abut kacel ki kwarina; tinga woko ki i Ejipt, ci iciyika ikabedo ma kiyikogi iye.” Yucepu ogamo ni, “Abitiyo kit madong iwaconi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Dok Icrael owaco ni, “Kwonga kwong,” ci Yucepu ocako kwongo kwong. Lacen Icrael okulu wiye piny iwi kitandane.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo olamo gum ikom Epraim ki Manace</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Lacen gitito bot Yucepu ni, “Nen, woru kome lit.” Ci en otero lutino awobene aryo, Manace ki Epraim. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Ka gitito ki Yakobo ni, “Wodi Yucepu obino boti,” ci Icrael ocuke oa malo, obedo iwi kitandane. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-14">Aca 28:13-14</ref></char></note>Yakobo owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Lubanga Matwero ducu yam onen bota i Luj i lobo Kanaan, ci omiya gum <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />kun waca ni, ‘Nen, abimiyi inya imede mapol, dok abimiyi idoko rok mapol. Abimiyo lobo man bot likwayi ki jo ma bilubugi me bedo meggi matwal.’ <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Awobeni aryoni ma inywalogi i lobo Ejipt ma onongo peya abino boti i Ejipt, meno mera gira. Epraim ki Manace gibibedo lutinona, macalo Reuben ki Cimeon bene. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Lutino ma kinywalogi ki ingegi bibedo meri, ento kibikwanogi ki nying omegigi ikare ma gipoko lobo me bedo ginaleyagi. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:16-19">Aca 35:16-19</ref></char></note> Atimo kit man pien mayam aa ki i Paddan, Lakeri otona woko i lobo Kanaan i wangayo, munongo Eprat pud kiborbor; ci ayiko en i yo ma cito Eprat.” (Eprate kombedi kilwongo Beterekem).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Ka Icrael oneno awobe pa Yucepu, ci owaco ni, “Man kono jo mene?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yucepu ogamo dog wone ni, “Gin lutino awobena, ma Lubanga omiya ki kany.” Ci owaco ni, “Kelgi bota kany, wek alam gum ikomgi.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Ikare meno onongo Yakobo dong otii, wange ocido woko, ma pe dong neno piny. Ka Yucepu okelogi cok bote, ci onoto lemgi ka okwakogi ki bade. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Ci Icrael owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Onongo yam atamo ni pe dok abineno wangi; nen, ka Lubanga dok omiyo aneno wa lutinoni bene.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yucepu odirogi cen manok ki ka conge; oryebe piny, okulu wiye i ngom. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yucepu otero gin aryo ducu, omako Epraim ki cinge tung lacuc mukemo cing Icrael ma lacam, ki Manace omako ki cinge tung lacam ma okemo cing Icrael ma lacuc, odirogi cok bote. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Icrael oketo cinge ma lacuc iwi Epraim, ma latin matidi, ki cinge ma lacam oketo iwi Manace, kun ogwenyo cinge, kadi bed Manace aye onongo latin kayo. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Icrael olamo gum ikom Yucepu kun waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Lubanga mayam kwarowa Abraim ki Icaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">gubedo kalubu cike omii gum bot awobeni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Lubanga ma obedo kakwayo an ikare me kwona ducu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">nio wa inino man omii ki gin gum.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Lamalaika mayam olara ki i gin marac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">omii gum bot awobeni; wek kilwonggi ki nyinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">ki nying kwarowa Abraim ki Icaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">gudong, gudok lwak mapol iwi lobo.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Ka Yucepu oneno ni wone ogwenyo cinge ma lacuc aye dok oketo iwi Epraim, pe opwoyo; ci ocako kwanyo cing wone ki iwi Epraim wek elok eket iwi Manace. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yucepu owaco bot wone ni, “Pe kitmeno wora, pien man aye latin kayo, ket cingi ma lacuc iwiye.” <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Ento wone okwero woko, kun waconi, “An angeyo ya latina, angeyo; en bibedo rok, en bene bibedo madit. Ento omine matidi bibedo dit makato en, likwaye bidoko lwak rok mapol.” <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:20:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:21">Ibru 11:21</ref></char></note>Olamo gum ikomgi inino meno, kun waco ni, “Icrael bilego gum ki nyingwu ni, ‘Lubanga omiyi ibed macalo Epraim ki Manace.’” Kitmeno oketo Epraim inyim Manace. <verse eid="GEN 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Icrael owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Nen, an dong acok to, ento Lubanga bibedo kwedwu, dok bidwokowu i lobo pa kwarowu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nen dong atyeko miyo boti ento pe bot omegini lobo ma ceko cam mayam amayo ki i cing jo Amor ki pala lucwan ki atero.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Icrael olamo gum ikom awobene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Icrael olwongo awobene, ci owacigi ni, “Wucoke kacel, wek atitiwu gin ma bitime ikomwu ikare ma anyim.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Wugure wek wuwiny, wun lutino awobe pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:2">wuwiny wonwu Icrael.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Reuben, in aye latin kayona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">in i kerona, ma akwongo nywalo ki tekona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">in aye iloyo omegini ki wake ki tekkom.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Icore macalo pii aluka ma twage, ento piri pe bibedo dit matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">pien i ito wa iwi kitanda pa woru;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">ipyede iye, i ito iwi kabutuna!<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Cimeon ki Levi gin omego.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:5">Gitiyo ki pala lucwangi me timo tim aranyi.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Tipuna, pe icit i kacokegi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">in cwinya pe iribe kwedgi i kaguregi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">pien guneko lwak dano ki kiniga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">dok gitongo odon twoni dyangi akaka.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Kicen kinigagi, pien ger;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">gicen akemogi, pien gwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Abipoko kin gi aketogi woko ata ikin jo pa Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">abikeyogi woko i dye Icrael.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Juda, omegini gibipaki;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">cingi bimako ngut lukwori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">lutino pa woru gibiryebe piny inyimi.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:9:</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:9">Wel 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">Niy 5:5</ref></char>
    </note>Juda in calo latin labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">ia ki kamwodo lee, latina, ci i ito malo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">En nyongo piny, en butu calo labwor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">macalo min labwor; anga ma bituge?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Odoo ker pe bia ki bot Juda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">tal ker bene pe bia ki katyene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">nio ka rwodi bikelo mot bote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">nio ka rok ducu biworo doge.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />En tweyo latin kanane ikom yat olok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">tweyo wod kana ikom olok mabere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">En lwoko ginarukane ki kongo bwino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">ki bongone i pig olok makwar.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Kongo bwino bimiyo wange loke doko makwar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:12">cak biloko lake doko matar.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Jabulon bibedo i dog nam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">En bibedo ki wang wat me mel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Wang lobone bibedo wa i Cidon.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Icakar en obedo calo kana matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:14">butu i dye anok romi;<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />oneno ka yweyone tye maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">ki lobone bene tye maber;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">onyoce piny katingo yec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">odoko opii ma kidiyo i tic matek.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dan biloyo jone</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:16">macalo ngat acel ikin kaka me Icrael.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dan bibedo calo twol ma inget yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">lacocodo ma i yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">ma bitongo opuny aguragura,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">miyo labed iwiye poto ataro.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Atye kakuru lar meri, ai Rwot.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gad mony bipoto ikome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:19">ento en biryemogi woko.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Acer came bibedo moo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:20">en bikelo cam mamit muporo cam pa luker.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Naputali en bibedo calo bwong til ma ngweco kama en mito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:21">ma iye olil ki lok mabeco.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Yucepu en calo jang yat ma nyak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">jange ginyak madwong inget wang it;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">jange gilak ikom cel.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Wegi atero gilwenyo ikome ki gero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:23">gibaye, gilubu kore matek;<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />ento atume cung mot liking,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">cinge odoko mit</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">pi teko pa Lubanga Matwero ducu pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">pi nying Lakwat en Got pa Icrael.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Lubanga pa woru ma bikonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Lubanga Matwero ducu ma bimiyi gum;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">gum ma a ki malo i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">gum ma a i kut matut muyare i te lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">gum me bedo ki lutino mapol ki lee mapol.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Gum pa abani dwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">loyo gum pa godi ma rii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">ki jami mabeco ma iwi cere ma bedo matwal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Gum magi ducu gubed iwi Yucepu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">ki itur nyime, en mayam opoke woko ki ikin omegine.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benjamin en calo orudi mager,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">camo lee ma oneko odiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">dok poko lim ma en oyako otyeno.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Magi aye kaka pa Icrael apar wiye aryo; man aye lok ma won gi oloko kwedgi ikare ma en lamo gum ikomgi, kun lamo gum ikom ngat acel acel kit macalo gume tye kwede.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Too pa Yakobo ki yike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Ci Yakobo ociko awobene kun waco botgi ni, “An dong abito adok bot jona, wubiyika bot kwarina i boro matye i poto pa Epron Lakit, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:30:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-20">Aca 23:3-20</ref></char></note>i boro meno matye i Makpela, tung kunyango me Mamre, i lobo Kanaan, mayam Abraim owilo kacel ki poto, ki bot Epron Lakit, odoko mere me kabedo me yik. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:31:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:9-10">Aca 25:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:29">35:29</ref></char></note>Kunu yam giyiko iye Abraim ki dakone Cara; kunu bene giyiko iye Icaka ki dakone Labeka; an bene dok ayiko Lea kunu. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Poto meno ki boro matye iye yam giwilo ki bot jo Kit.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:33:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Tic 7:15</ref></char></note>Ka Yakobo otyeko ciko lutino awobene, ci odolo tyene malo iwi kitanda, oomo cwinye me agikine, oto odok bot lutugi.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yucepu ocako poto inyim wone, okok ki pig wange kun noto leme. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Lacen ociko lutice ma ludaktar pi wiro kom wone ki yat ma talo kom, ci ludaktar guwiro kom Icrael. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Wirone otyeko nino pyere angwen, en aye nino mamite ka giwiro kom dano ki yat latal kom. Luejipt gukoko Yakobo nino pyere abiro.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Ka nino me kwero cola dong otum, ci Yucepu oloko ki jo pa Parao, kun waconi, “Alegowu ni, ka wuneno kombedi ni bedona botwu kany oyomo cwinywu, ci wuwac loke bot Parao, kun wuwace ni: <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29-31">Aca 47:29-31</ref></char></note>wora omiya akwongo kwong kun waconi, ‘An dong acok to: wubiyika i lyel mayam an kikoma aye akwinyo i lobo Kanaan.’ Ma omiyo alegi ni, itima ber, wek acit ayik wora, ka adwogi.” <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Parao ogame ni, “Ber cit giri, iciyik woru, kit macalo en omiyo ikwongo akwongani.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Ci Yucepu ocito kayiko wone. Ocito ki lwak lutic pa Parao ducu, ludongo me ode, ki ludongo ducu me lobo Ejipt. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Jo ducu me ot pa Yucepu, ki omegine, ki jo me ot pa wone. Lutinogi keken ki lwak dyangigi ki dyegigi aye gudong i lobo Gocen. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Yucepu ocito ki lwak gadigadi ki wegi aguragura, owoto ki lwak jo mapol adada. <verse eid="GEN 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Ka guo i laro moyo ma i Atad, matye loka Jordan ci gukok kunu ki cwercwiny ki kumu madwong. Yucepu okwero cola pa wone nino abiro. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ka wegi lobonu ma gin Lukanaan, guneno kwero cola ma i laro moyo i Atad, ci guwaco ni, “Man kwero cola me cwercwiny madwong bot Luejipt.” Pimeno nying kabedo meno gilwongo ni, Abel-micraim; matye loka Jordan.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Kitmeno awobe pa Yakobo gutimo ikom won gi kit ma nene en ocikogi kwede. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:13:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Tic 7:16</ref></char></note>Ci gin gutero kome i lobo Kanaan, ci guyiko kome i boro ma i poto matye i Makpela i tung kunyango me Mamre, mayam Abraim owilo, kacel ki poto, bot Epron Lakit, wek obed mere me kabedo me yik. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Ka dong otyeko yiko wone, ci Yucepu odok i Ejipt kacel ki omegine, ki jo ducu ma nene ocito kwedgi ka yiko wone.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yucepu okweyo cwiny omegine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Ka omegi Yucepu guneno ni won gi dong otyeko to woko, ci gutamo ni, “Gwok nyo Yucepu dong bicako kwerowa woko, biculu kwor mayam watime kwede marac ikomwa.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Omiyo gucako cwalo kwena bot Yucepu kun giwaco ni, “Yam woru ocikowa ki cik man ma onongo peya oto ni, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Wuwac bot Yucepu ni, alegi itim kica bot omegini pi tim aranyi ki pi bal ma gutimo ikomi, pien gutimo tim aranyi ikomi ada.’ Dong kombedi walegi itimwa kica pi tim aranyiwa, pien wan waworo Lubanga pa woru.” Yucepu okok ma guloko kwede. <verse eid="GEN 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Omegine bene gucito ci guryebe inyime kun giwaco ni, “Nen, wan dong lutici.” <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Ento Yucepu odok iye botgi ni, “Pe wulwor, an atye ma ka Lubanga bo? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Ki tung botwu yam wuyube pi timo gin marac ikoma, ento Lubanga oloko meno odoko gin maber, ma omiyo jo mapol gubedo kwo, macalo gitye kwede wa kombedi. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Pimeno pe wubed ki lworo mo; abipitowu ki lutinowu ducu.” Kitmeno Yucepu ojingo cwinygi kun kweyo igi.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yucepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Ci Yucepu omede ki bedo i Ejipt, en ki jo me ot pa wone, ci en orii mwaka miya acel ki apar. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yucepu oneno lutino pa Epraim, nio wa ikom likwaye me adeke; lutino pa Makir wod pa Manace Yucepu onenogi ma en pud tye kwo. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Ci Yucepu owaco bot omegine ni, “An dong acok to; ento Lubanga bilimowu, dok en bikwanyowu woko ki i lobo man, bidwokowu kama Lubanga okwongo me miyo bot Abraim ki Icaka ki bot Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Nia 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yoc 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Ibru 11:22</ref></char></note>Ci Yucepu omiyo lutino pa Icrael gucike kun waco ki gin ni, “Ka Lubanga bilimowu, ci wubitingo cogona woko ki kany.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Yucepu oto, ma mwaka me dite romo miya acel ki apar; guwiro kome ki yat latalkom, lacen gupyelo kome i canduk me yik i Ejipt.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>